        "@value": "2023 Guyleigh Johnson – Prismatic Festival"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Guyleigh Johnson is a proud African Nova Scotian author, spoken word artist, community advocate, and Arts facilitator from Dartmouth. She has a passion for inner and collective healing, youth engagement, and creative expression. She has published two books, Expect The Unexpected (2016) and Afraid Of the Dark (2018)."
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#url": [
