        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Industry Events Since its inception, the Prismatic Arts Festival has been a platform for Indigenous artists and artists... <a class=\"excerpt-read-more\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/industry-events-2022/\"><span>Continue Reading</span></a>"
