        "@value": "Masterclasses in partnership with Fountain School of Performing Arts, Dalhousie University Prismatic and the Fountain School of Performing... <a class=\"excerpt-read-more\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/masterclasses-2022/\"><span>Continue Reading</span></a>"
