    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h1>Dance Battle</h1>\t\t\n\t\t<p>Wednesday, September 28th | 5PM Doors open, 5:45PM event start<br><a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#breaking-circus\">Breaking Circus Studio</a><br>PWYC Admission</p><p>in partnership with <a href=\"https://liveartdance.ca/\">Live Art Dance</a> </p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"768\" height=\"1187\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/dance_battle_ebnfloh_2_web_tabloid-768x1187.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/dance_battle_ebnfloh_2_web_tabloid.jpg?resize=768%2C1187&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/dance_battle_ebnfloh_2_web_tabloid.jpg?resize=194%2C300&amp;ssl=1 194w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/dance_battle_ebnfloh_2_web_tabloid.jpg?resize=662%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 662w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/dance_battle_ebnfloh_2_web_tabloid.jpg?resize=994%2C1536&amp;ssl=1 994w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/dance_battle_ebnfloh_2_web_tabloid.jpg?resize=1120%2C1731&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/dance_battle_ebnfloh_2_web_tabloid.jpg?resize=640%2C989&amp;ssl=1 640w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/dance_battle_ebnfloh_2_web_tabloid.jpg?w=1242&amp;ssl=1 1242w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Tap into your competitive spirit and come out to the Prismatic 2022 Dance Battle! Whether you’re a full-fledged pro, a dabbler in dance, or just enjoy expressing yourself through motion, we want to see your moves. Show off your skills, win over the judges, and take home the top prize! All levels, styles, and ages are welcome at this public event.</p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;In partnership with Live Art Dance and Ebnflōh Dance Company.</strong><br><strong>This Dance Battle is open to all — join us as a battler or an audience member!</strong></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"800\" height=\"534\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/5-Dance-Battle-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©STOO.ca-73.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/5-Dance-Battle-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©STOO.ca-73.jpg?w=800&amp;ssl=1 800w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/5-Dance-Battle-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©STOO.ca-73.jpg?resize=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/5-Dance-Battle-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©STOO.ca-73.jpg?resize=768%2C513&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/5-Dance-Battle-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©STOO.ca-73.jpg?resize=640%2C427&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"800\" height=\"534\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/2-Dance-Battle-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©STOO.ca-122.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/2-Dance-Battle-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©STOO.ca-122.jpg?w=800&amp;ssl=1 800w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/2-Dance-Battle-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©STOO.ca-122.jpg?resize=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/2-Dance-Battle-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©STOO.ca-122.jpg?resize=768%2C513&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/2-Dance-Battle-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©STOO.ca-122.jpg?resize=640%2C427&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Photo Credit: Stoo Metz</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/industry-events-2022/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to Industry Events\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/canadian-heritage.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"250\" height=\"166\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-03-e1662144841715.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://canadacouncil.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-07.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.halifax.ca/parks-recreation/events\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-09.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://artsns.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-10.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.td.com/about-tdbfg/our-business/index.jsp?mobile=No\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-01.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.neptunetheatre.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-15.png\" title=\"sponsor-logos-15\" alt=\"sponsor-logos-15\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://li