e.ca/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Mermaid-Theatre-r8h2cknh9uchg4lgv51lrq9musn0a96dlahpyrxkk6.png\" title=\"Mermaid Theatre\" alt=\"Mermaid Theatre\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://kingstheatre.ca/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Kings-Theatre-1-r8ij93b4r9hlcy6dtdmou4px2diecfzdfs4xg031au.png\" title=\"Kings Theatre\" alt=\"Kings Theatre\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.ceciliaconcerts.ca/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Cecilia-Concerts-SAC-LOGO-FILE-ENGLISH-WHITE-r8wbujzodda99twf22cgne2enwye67dwnhj7zwjph4.png\" title=\"Cecilia-Concerts-SAC-LOGO-FILE-ENGLISH-WHITE\" alt=\"Cecilia-Concerts-SAC-LOGO-FILE-ENGLISH-WHITE\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://nscad.ca/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/312853622_534621328673040_1675656375722940672_n-e1755529571971-rag0cehk569s617vhxm0ithpxqd1vw1uonil9qow74.jpg\" title=\"312853622_534621328673040_1675656375722940672_n\" alt=\"nscad-logo\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://nscad.ca/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/the-craig-foundation.png\" title=\"the craig foundation\" alt=\"the craig foundation\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
