    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h1>About Prismatic</h1>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Prismatic is Art for Everyone!</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"768\" height=\"1154\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/KSF_8556-768x1154.jpg\" alt=\"A Tribe called Red Prismatic Arts Festival 2014\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/KSF_8556.jpg?resize=768%2C1154&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/KSF_8556.jpg?resize=200%2C300&amp;ssl=1 200w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/KSF_8556.jpg?resize=682%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 682w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/KSF_8556.jpg?resize=1022%2C1536&amp;ssl=1 1022w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/KSF_8556.jpg?resize=1120%2C1683&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/KSF_8556.jpg?resize=640%2C962&amp;ssl=1 640w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/KSF_8556.jpg?w=1278&amp;ssl=1 1278w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\tThe Prismatic Arts Festival is an annual, multidisciplinary arts festival that showcases and celebrates innovative work by Indigenous artists and artists of colour from across Canada. Based in Kjipuktuk (Halifax, Nova Scotia), Prismatic has been bringing audiences vibrant, boundary-pushing new works in theatre, dance, music, film, visual arts, media arts, and spoken word since 2008.Through engaging performances,<a background-color: #0e0c13;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/the-talk-2022/\"> the TALK conference</a>, workshops, and <a background-color: #0e0c13;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/masterclasses-2022/\">Masterclasses</a> Prismatic’s annual festival brings artists and audiences together for an open dialogue. People of all ages and backgrounds are invited to experience Prismatic performances, engage with artists, and learn about new art forms and traditional cultural practices.<p>Within the broad community of Indigenous artists and artists of colour in Canada, Prismatic is committed to prioritizing the work of artists who identify as part of communities that are underrepresented in Canadian professional arts, including women, members of the LGBTQIA2S+ community, and artists who are D/deaf and/or disability identified.</p><p><em>Since 2008, Prismatic has showcased over 665 performances by 1540 artists and arts professionals, and has engaged 100,690 audience members.</em></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Our Mission</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The <em><strong>Prismatic Mission</strong></em> is to be a leading Canadian arts festival that engages diverse stakeholders through performance, networking, and collaborative learning.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Our Mandate</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>To bring new works of leading Indigenous artists and artists of colour from across Canada to a wide audience;</p>\n<p>To create opportunities for the public to engage with and learn about art forms and artistic traditions;</p>\n<p>To facilitate the professional and artistic development of emerging and professional artists;</p>\n<p>To partner with a variety of stakeholders to bring diverse perspectives, experiences, and vision to Prismatic’s artistic pursuits and professional development activities.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"768\" height=\"1152\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/prismatic-2020-42-copy-768x1152.jpg\" alt=\"Jah&#039;mila at the Carleton\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/prismatic-2020-42-copy.jpg?resize=768%2C1152&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/prismatic-2020-42-copy.jpg?resize=200%2C300&amp;ssl=1 200w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/prismatic-2020-42-copy.jpg?resize=683%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 683w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/prismatic-2020-42-copy.jpg?resize=640%2C960&amp;ssl=1 640w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/prismatic-2020-42-copy.jpg?w=792&amp;ssl=1 792w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"768\" height=\"513\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©-Photo-Credit-@stoometzphoto-85-768x513.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-85.jpg?resize=768%2C513&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-85.jpg?resize=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-85.jpg?resize=1024%2C684&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-85.jpg?resize=1536%2C1026&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-85.jpg?resize=1120%2C748&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-85.jpg?resize=640%2C427&amp;ssl=1 640w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-85.jpg?w=1920&amp;ssl=1 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"768\" height=\"576\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Shauntay-Grant-1-768x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Shauntay-Grant-1.jpg?resize=768%2C576&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Shauntay-Grant-1.jpg?resize=300%2C225&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Shauntay-Grant-1.jpg?resize=640%2C480&amp;ssl=1 640w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Shauntay-Grant-1.jpg?w=960&amp;ssl=1 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"768\" height=\"511\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Drumming-Prismatic-2015-768x511.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Drumming-Prismatic-2015.jpg?resize=768%2C511&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Drumming-Prismatic-2015.jpg?resize=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Drumming-Prismatic-2015.jpg?resize=1024%2C682&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Drumming-Prismatic-2015.jpg?resize=1536%2C1022&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Drumming-Prismatic-2015.jpg?resize=1120%2C745&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Drumming-Prismatic-2015.jpg?resize=640%2C426&amp;ssl=1 640w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Drumming-Prismatic-2015.jpg?w=2048&amp;ssl=1 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"768\" height=\"576\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG_5376-768x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG_5376.jpg?resize=768%2C576&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG_5376.jpg?resize=300%2C225&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG_5376.jpg?resize=1024%2C768&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG_5376.jpg?resize=1536%2C1152&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG_5376.jpg?resize=1120%2C840&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG_5376.jpg?resize=640%2C480&amp;ssl=1 640w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG_5376.jpg?w=1920&amp;ssl=1 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"768\" height=\"513\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©-Photo-Credit-@stoometzphoto-43-768x513.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-43.jpg?resize=768%2C513&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-43.jpg?resize=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-43.jpg?resize=1024%2C684&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-43.jpg?resize=1536%2C1026&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-43.jpg?resize=1120%2C748&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-43.jpg?resize=640%2C427&amp;ssl=1 640w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-43.jpg?w=1920&amp;ssl=1 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5>Accessibility \n&amp; Inclusion</h5>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p data-wahfont=\"30\"> </p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-wahfont=\"30\"><strong>Art for Everyone!</strong></p><p data-wahfont=\"24\"><em>We are committed to making our events and performances accessible to all.</em></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-wahfont=\"18\"><strong>This means that we:</strong></p><ul><li>Strive to use venues that have wheelchair accessible entrances, washrooms, and seating options (see <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/accessibility/\"><strong>here</strong></a> for a list of our venues with accessibility details)</li><li>Seek out venues that provide all-gender washroom options.</li><li>Welcome service animals and personal support workers to performances and events at no additional cost (Please reach out to ensure your spot is reserved).</li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\">Work intentionally with artists, communities, and venues to provide ASL interpretation, captioning, assisted listening devices, and written and audio descriptions of performances, when possible.</li><li><strong>Offer content notices for select performances and have active listeners and cultural support workers on site, when possible.</strong></li><li>Have Naloxone kits at the Front of House with trained personnel in case of emergency.</li><li>Provide items and options at the Front of House including balloons, ear plugs, sunglasses, masks, and quiet spaces.</li><li>Offer a pay-what-you-can ticketing model, whenever possible. If finances are a barrier to accessing an event, please contact us or come see us at the Front of House. </li><li><b>All events at Prismatic are photographed.</b> If you do not want to be photographed, please let a staff member know when you arrive.</li></ul><p data-wahfont=\"18\">Please reach out to us to let us know if there is any way that we can support your festival experience at <a href=\"tel:9024256812\" data-wahfont=\"18\">902-425-6812</a> or <a href=\"mailto:info@prismaticfestival.com\" data-wahfont=\"18\">info@prismaticfestival.com</a>.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5>Sustainability</h5>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Knowing the responsibility we have as a leader in the arts, Prismatic is incorporating more sustainability practices into the organization. Some things we are doing include:</p><ul><li>Using QR codes, newsletters, and social media to circulate a digital program and printing fewer physical programs.</li><li>Reducing print in all forms and conducting paperwork digitally.</li><li>Prioritizing staff and volunteer time to carefully cleaning up a venue (especially outdoors), in order to ensure that no litter is left behind.</li><li>Supporting local businesses and buying locally as much as possible.</li><li>Having our festival and office located in Downtown Halifax to minimize commuting for staff, volunteers, and audiences.</li></ul><p style=\"text-align: center;\">Our Staff </p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure><a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/raeesa-lalani/\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img width=\"424\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG_0314-2-e1656973639882.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure><h3><a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/raeesa-lalani/\"><br><br>Executive &amp; Artistic Director</a></h3><p>Raeesa Lalani</p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure><a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/kelly-li/\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img width=\"424\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/Screen-Shot-2021-12-06-at-3.40.04-PM-e1656972760187.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure><h3><a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/kelly-li/\"><br>Managing Producer</a></h3><p>Kelly Li</p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>&nbsp;Willum Watt</strong> | <em>Outreach &amp; Community Coordinator</em></p>\n<p><strong>Katie Blatt</strong> | <em>Marketing &amp; Communications Coordinator</em></p>\n<p><strong>Mallory Amirault</strong> | <em>Tour Coordinator</em></p><p><strong>Michael Mader</strong> | <em>Technical Director</em></p>\n<p><strong>Ryan Nielsen&nbsp;</strong>| <em>Technical Producer</em></p>\n<p><strong>Regine Tiu</strong> | <em>Website Designer</em></p><p>Board of Directors</p><p><strong>Jacqueline Warwick</strong>&nbsp;<b>|</b> Chair<br><strong>Miya Turnbull</strong>&nbsp; <b>|</b> Vice Chair<br><strong>Kate Hamilton</strong>&nbsp;<b>|</b> Secretary/Treasurer</p><p>Jeff Ward<br />Laurie Gillis</p><p>Neal Morgan<br />Kaif Lalani</p><p>Donate to Prismatic!</p>For over 16 years, Prismatic has worked hard to showcase the work of Indigenous artists and artists of colour, bringing their brilliant work to audiences in Kjipuktuk / Halifax. As a not for profit organization, community support is essential to further our goal of creating an inclusive and vibrant artistic hub in our communities. <p><strong>Prismatic is a member of Theatre Nova Scotia’s Partnership Program.</strong> Donations over $20 made to Prismatic through Theatre Nova Scotia are eligible for a charitable tax receipt for income tax purposes.</p><strong>1.   </strong> Go to <strong><a style=\"color: #ffffff;\"href=\"https://www.theatrens.ca/donate\">Theatre Nova Scotia’s donation page</a></strong><strong>2.   </strong>In the Donation Details section, open the drop-down menu labelled <strong>“Fund”</strong><strong>3.   </strong>From the list, select <strong>“30 Prismatic Arts Festival”</strong><strong>4.   </strong>Enter your donation amount<strong>5.   </strong>Fill out personal and payment details\n<strong>6.   </strong>Submit the form by clicking <strong>“Complete Donation Now”</strong>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.theatrens.ca/donate\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDonate Today\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<p>Get in Touch</p><p><b>General Inquiries:</b><br><a style=\"color: #ffffff;\" href=\"mailto:info@prismaticfestival.com\">info@prismaticfestival.com</a><br>902-425-6812</p><p><strong>Mailing Address:</strong><br />Prismatic Arts Society<br />PO Box 1603, HFX CRO<br />Halifax NS, B3J 2Y3</p><p><strong>Office Address:</strong><br />1580 Barrington Street<br />Halifax, Nova Scotia<br />B3J 1Z6</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Prismatic is proudly affiliated with</h3>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://mulgraveroad.ca/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/APA-r54shgk5rmkrlw812wehscze6pje4x9x2flokx3iu2.png\" title=\"APA\" alt=\"APA\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://artsns.ca/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/CAPACOA-Logo-2020-r54shru7sv918xlr8gu9whj96mub849sgbm1ijucms.png\" title=\"CAPACOA-Logo-2020\" alt=\"CAPACOA-Logo-2020\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://canadacouncil.ca/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/International-Indigenous-Music-Summit-logo-q8c628fdgi5a2wj7u4orq8fjhcg3iaf5xas2obv512.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.neptunetheatre.com/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/IPAA-Logo-r54shpyjnyxmtzudk0grham04k929wb8fq4jdopl9y.webp\" title=\"IPAA-Logo\" alt=\"IPAA-Logo\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://halifaxshoppingcentre.com/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/PACT-logo-r54uampbx2hfcy9hjs2z25p02brenwt2ukpggogft0.png\" title=\"PACT logo\" alt=\"PACT logo\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://halifaxshoppingcentre.com/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/CanDance-website-logo-r54shl9e8m815pk0f060m1k4z03ifqu8uyqa4uud74.png\" title=\"CanDance-website-logo\" alt=\"CanDance-website-logo\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.wonderneath.com/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/TNS-logo-white-r54shjdogik7ov6vmpu8uqkm17q8ilpkengvfldkey.png\" title=\"TNS-logo-white\" alt=\"TNS-logo-white\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://canadacouncil.ca/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/CCA_RGB_colour_e-r7vzv385fkpgklnuqtvg59g4ni766vsjr0lllxmjri.png\" title=\"CCA_RGB_colour_e\" alt=\"CCA_RGB_colour_e\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/canadian-heritage.html\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/wordmark_C-r7vzy8ylsln80pnx99xy8h8q7dqvdbpsvhzom6ysc0.png\" title=\"wordmark_C.png\" alt=\"wordmark_C.png\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://artsns.ca/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/ArtsNS-colour-r7vzwpi487wjnann89bckoc0yllzjf8a0dru