    "http://schema.org/headline": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Jorge Requena Ramos"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"426\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Jorge-Requena-Headshot_aboutPage.jpg\" alt=\"Jorge Requena Ramos \" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Jorge-Requena-Headshot_aboutPage.jpg 426w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Jorge-Requena-Headshot_aboutPage-200x300.jpg 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 426px) 100vw, 426px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption>Jorge Requena Ramos </figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"mailto:jorge@prismaticfestival.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n\t\t\t\t\tEnvelope\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<h2>Jorge Requena Ramos</h2>\t\t\n\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><strong>Festival Curator (PIFF) | </strong><a href=\"mailto:jorge@prismaticfestival.com\">jorge @ prismaticfestival.com</a></em></p><p><strong>     As a film and television director, Jorge Requena Ramos has created dozens of episodes of internationally broadcasted television, feature documentaries and short films.</strong></p><p>     As a producer, Jorge has created multi-language programming for partners such as Bell Media, CBC, Rogers TV, TVO, Food Network, Cooking Channel, Vice Media, Super Channel, Discovery Channel, SKY TV and many others internationally. He has been the recipient of numerous awards and nominations for his work.</p><p>     Always keeping his focus on breaking the intricate and complicated glass ceiling faced by many directors of colour (and with an accent), Jorge has made it his mission to devote his work to the empowerment of filmmakers of colour. In addition to his work with Prismatic, he  showcases the work of artists of colour in the Freeze Frame Film Festival and the Pop-Up Film Festival – a mobile festival that brings films to diverse communities in Winnipeg.</p><p>     Jorge has taught courses in media arts and film making at the Freeze Frame Media Centre, The Nu Media Indigenous Film School and the University of Winnipeg. Jorge has helped train dozens of assistant directors working for the Directors Guild of Canada and has guided hundreds of Indigenous youth towards a fulfilling career in media.</p>"
      }
    ],
