        "@value": "PRISMATIC INTERNATIONAL FILM FESTIVAL   SUBMISSIONS RULES &amp; TERMS ELIGIBILITY: Submissions may be SHORT FILMS in fiction, documentary,... <a class=\"excerpt-read-more\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/submissions-and-rules/\"><span>Continue Reading</span></a>"
