        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h1>Prismatic Think Tank</h1>\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>     The Prismatic Think Tank is composed of arts and culture leaders from across Canada. The members  work in a variety of art forms, have experience in all facets of professional arts in Canada, and represent diverse Indigenous and ethno-cultural, disability-identified and LGBTQIA communities in Canada.</strong></p><p>     The Think Tank provides guidance and support to the Prismatic Arts Festival and its related activities. The members meet annually to discuss the evolution of Prismatic, to provide guidance on strategic and organizational development, and ensure that Prismatic is serving Indigenous artists and artists of colour to the best of the organization’s abilities.</p>\t\t\n\t\t<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><u>Prismatic Think Tank</u></strong></h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\">Michael Greyeyes</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">Howard Jang</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">Zab Maboungou</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">Leslie McCue</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">Diane Roberts</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">Nikki Shaffeeullah</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">Santee Smith</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">Barak adé Soleil</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">Tanisha Taitt</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">Isaac Thomas</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">Sherry Yoon</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1024\" height=\"30\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Thanks-sponsors-1024x30.jpg\" alt=\"Thanks to our Sponsors and Funders\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Thanks-sponsors-1024x30.jpg 1024w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Thanks-sponsors-300x9.jpg 300w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Thanks-sponsors-768x22.jpg 768w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Thanks-sponsors-1120x33.jpg 1120w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Thanks-sponsors-640x19.jpg 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                                        <a href=\"https://www.gctc.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/GCTC-1.jpg\" alt=\"Great Canadian Theatre Company\"></a>                                    \n                                        <a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/canadian-heritage.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Canada-wordmark.jpg\" alt=\"Canada\"></a>                                    \n                                        <a href=\"http://www.arts.on.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/oac.jpg\" alt=\"Ontario Arts Council\"></a>                                    \n                                        <a href=\"https://canadacouncil.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/canada-council.jpg\" alt=\"Canada Council for the Arts\"></a>                                    \n                                        <a href=\"https://cch.novascotia.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/novascotia.jpg\" alt=\"Nova Scotia\"></a>                                    \n                                        <a href=\"https://www.halifax.ca/recreation/arts-culture-heritage/opportunities-artists-halifax\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/halifax.jpg\" alt=\"Halifax\"></a>                                    \n                                    <!-- Add Arrows -->\n                                        <a href=\"https://www.factor.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/factor_logo.jpg\" alt=\"Factor\"></a>                                    \n                                        <a href=\"https://www.les-suites.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/Les-Suites_Logo.jpg\" alt=\"Les Suites Hotel Ottawa\"></a>                                    \n                                        <a href=\"http://eng.gokams.or.kr/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/korea-arts_logo.jpg\" alt=\"Halifax\"></a>                                    \n                                        <a href=\"https://liveartdance.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Live-Art-Dance.jpg\" alt=\"Live Art Dance\"></a>                                    \n                                        <a href=\"https://ontariopresents.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/ontario-presents_logo.jpg\" alt=\"Ontario Presents\"></a>                                    \n                                        <a href=\"https://www.atlanticpresenters.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/atlantic-presents_logo.jpg\" alt=\"Atlantic Presenters Association\"></a>                                    \n                                        <a href=\"https://www.nouvellescene.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/La-Nouvelle-Scene_Logo.jpg\" alt=\"La Nouvelle Scene\"></a>                                    \n                                    <!-- Add Arrows -->\n                                        <a href=\"https://www.thegladstone.ca/\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/theGladstone_logo.jpg\" alt=\"The Gladstone\"></a>                                    \n                                        <a href=\"https://artscourt.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/artsCourt_logo.jpg\" alt=\"Arts Court Theatre\"></a>                                    \n                                        <a href=\"https://saw-centre.com/ \"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/SAW_logo.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>                                    \n                                        <a href=\"http://halifaxcentrallibrary.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/HPL_Logo_Horizontal_Master.jpg\" alt=\"Halifax Public Libraries\"></a>                                    \n                                        <a href=\"http://musicnovascotia.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/musicNovaScotia_logo.jpg\" alt=\"Music Nova Scotia\"></a>                                    \n                                        <a href=\"https://musicandbeyond.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/musicBeyond_Logo.jpg\" alt=\"Music &amp; Beyone\"></a>                                    \n                                        <a href=\"https://cresco.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/Cresco_logo.jpg\" alt=\"Cresco\"></a>                                    \n                                        <a href=\"http://www.unitedgulf.ca/\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/unitedGulf_Log