        "@value": "Kaha:wi Dance Theatre 2014"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"918\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Screen-Shot-2021-05-05-at-2.34.50-PM-918x1024.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Screen-Shot-2021-05-05-at-2.34.50-PM-918x1024.png 918w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Screen-Shot-2021-05-05-at-2.34.50-PM-269x300.png 269w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Screen-Shot-2021-05-05-at-2.34.50-PM-768x856.png 768w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Screen-Shot-2021-05-05-at-2.34.50-PM-640x714.png 640w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Screen-Shot-2021-05-05-at-2.34.50-PM.png 972w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 918px) 100vw, 918px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.kahawidance.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tDesktop\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Kaha:wi Dance Theatre</h3>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>NeoIndigenA</h3>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>Type of Art:</strong>  Dance</p><p><strong>Dates: </strong>August 23rd @ 4:30 pm</p><p><strong>Location: </strong>Alderney Landing Theatre</p>\t\t\n\t\t<p>Answer the call for connection, transformation, and healing as Kaha:wi Dance Theatre presents NeoIndigenA. A performance of the soul exploring our relationship to all living entities and elements, it promises to be both transcendent and primordial.</p><p>The performance of NeoIndigenA by award-winning Artistic Director, Choreographer and Performer—Santee Smith, is produced by Kaha:wi Dance Theatre. NeoIndigenA is an elemental search that fiercely cycles through the sacred portals between Skyworld, Earthworld, and Underworld. Her solo journey places her in search of humanity, ancient ways of knowing, and spiritual evolution while intuitively discovering the sacred pathways of the human connection to self and universe.</p><p><b>Santee Smith: Artistic Director/Choreographer/Production Design/ Performance<br />Arun Srinivasan: Lighting Designer<br />Elaine Redding and Santee Smith: Costume Design<br />Alejandro Ronceria: Dramaturgy<br />Margie Gillis: Solo Mentor<br />Louis Laberge-Côté: Rehearsal Director<br />Santee Smith: Creative Producer<br />Jesse Zubot: Composition/Score  Arrangement/Viola<br />Cris Derksen: Composition<br />Adrian Harjo: Composition<br />Tanya Tagaq: Composition/Singer<br />Michael Red: Programming/Composition<br />Joy Mullen: Percussion<br />Nelson Tagoona: Additional Vocals<br />Nikki Shawana: Additional Vocals<br />Donald Quan: Additional Mixing</b><br /><b>Sheldon Zaharko: </b>Zed Productions<br /><b>Jesse Zubot:</b> Studio Engineer/Mastering<br /><b>Tim Hill</b>: Set Construction<br /><b>Summer Faith Garc iaand Isreal Garcia</b>: Make-up/Hair<br /><b>Kalina Janik</b>: Production/Stage Manager</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2014-archive/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2014\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
      }
    ],
