      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"672\" height=\"960\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Asheq.jpg\" alt=\"Asheq Ritual Music to Cure a Lover\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Asheq.jpg 672w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Asheq-210x300.jpg 210w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Asheq-640x914.jpg 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 672px) 100vw, 672px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/onelighttheatre\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFacebook\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/user?screen_name=onelighttheatre&#038;original_referer=https://onelighttheatre.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTwitter\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://onelighttheatre.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tDesktop\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Onelight     Theatre&nbsp;Asheq: Ritual Music To Cure a lover</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>Type of Art:</strong>  Theatre</p><p><strong>Date:</strong> Sept 19th @ 5pm</p><p><strong>Location: </strong>Dal Arts Centre- Dunn Theatre</p>\t\t\n\t\t<p>Set in a sun-baked fishing village on the shores of the Persian Gulf, <strong>Asheq</strong> explores forbidden love, a family divided by long-held secrets, and a community balancing traditions and the modern world. The play culminates in a zar exorcism ceremony to rid a young man of the “sickness” of his love for an outcast young woman, that reveals a father’s long-buried secrets. See a workshop presentation of Asheq in it's early stages of development under the artistic leadership of Onelight Theatre's Shahin Sayadi.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2017-archive/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2017\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
