    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"538\" height=\"806\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/IMPAR_foto-Paula-Kossatz3-1120x1680-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/IMPAR_foto-Paula-Kossatz3-1120x1680-1.jpg 538w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/IMPAR_foto-Paula-Kossatz3-1120x1680-1-200x300.jpg 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 538px) 100vw, 538px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Focus     Cia     de     Dança&nbsp;Impar</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>Type of Performance:</strong>  Dance</p><p><strong>Dates: </strong>September 20th @ 7pm</p><p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">   September 21st @ 7pm</p><p><strong>Venue: </strong>Dunn Theatre - Dalhousie Arts Centre</p><p><strong>Ticket Prices: </strong><strong>$32.50</strong> <em>(Gen Ticket) </em>/ <strong>$20</strong><em> (Sr./Student)</em></p>\t\t\n\t\t<p>From Rio de Janeiro , Live Art Dance and the Prismatic Arts Festival is excited to bring Focus Cia de Dança with their mesmerizing piece Impar. This company has toured Brazil, Europe and the US extensively and now brings its magic to Halifax as a part of their first Canadian tour. </p><p>Founded in 1997, this brilliant contemporary dance company embodies a movement that builds art and meaning about the daily lives of the people in its home city of Rio de Janeiro. Impar, which loosely translates as “Odd”, presents a fragmented story, stripped and striking. The stage becomes a playground where seven bodies give us a story that seems absurd and yet magically reveals the genius of the choreographer and his company.</p><p>“Impar” Choreographed  by Artistic Director – Alex Neoral</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong style=\"text-align: center;\"> </strong><strong style=\"text-align: center;\">Co-presented with Live Art Dance</strong><a href=\"https://liveartdance.ca/\"><br /></a></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://liveartdance.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"750\" height=\"375\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Live-Art-Dance.jpg\" alt=\"Live Art Dance Logo\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Live-Art-Dance.jpg 750w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Live-Art-Dance-300x150.jpg 300w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Live-Art-Dance-640x320.jpg 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPrevious\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNext\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2019-archive/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2019\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
