        "@value": "<img width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Eastern-Owl-Jenelle-2-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"Eastern Owl-Jenelle (2)\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Eastern-Owl-Jenelle-2-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Eastern-Owl-Jenelle-2-300x200.jpg 300w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Eastern-Owl-Jenelle-2-768x512.jpg 768w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Eastern-Owl-Jenelle-2-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Eastern-Owl-Jenelle-2-1120x747.jpg 1120w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Eastern-Owl-Jenelle-2-640x427.jpg 640w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Eastern-Owl-Jenelle-2.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/jenelleduval1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tInstagram\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Jenelle     Duval&nbsp;</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>Type of Art:</strong>  Music</p><p><strong>Date: </strong>Sept 19 @ 7:30 pm</p><p><strong>Location: </strong>Grand Parade</p>\t\t\n\t\t<p>Jenelle Duval is a singer and songwriter from St. George's, Ktaqmkuk (the island of Newfoundland). Her work is centred in contemporary narrative spertaining to her relationship with the land, Mi'kmaq identity, language, and reclamation of cultural practices. Best known for her years of work with award-winning ensemble Eastern Owl, Jenelle is currently working on her debut solo-album, set to be released in the winter of 2021.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/prismatic-2020/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2020\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
