      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "TALK Conference  Voices We Need to Hear Series co-presented by Atlantic Presenters Association  LISTEN TO PART ONE March... <a class=\"excerpt-read-more\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/the-talk-2020/\"><span>Continue Reading</span></a>"
