        "@value": "Shifting Versea Prismatic Arts Festival Production Presented byNational Arts Centre English Theatre’sGrand Acts of TheatreMarking this Moment As the performing... <a class=\"excerpt-read-more\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/shifting-verse/\"><span>Continue Reading</span></a>"
