    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h1>TALK and Arts Assembly Schedule\n</h1>\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>Date &amp; Time</strong></p><h3><b>Event</b></h3><p><strong>Sunday, </strong><strong>Sept. 15 – 5pm</strong></p><p>GCTC​</p><p><strong>Opening Gala</strong></p><p>with showcase performances by Rebecca Thomas, Hubert Francis and JP Longboat.</p><p><em>**ASL Translation</em></p>\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>MONDAY,  Sept. 16  10am to 1:30pm</strong></p><p>​ARTS COURT STUDIO</p><p><strong>TALK Session #1: </strong><em>Land and Place</em></p><p>Collectively this international assembly of artists, thinkers, presenters, local and global citizens will begin by reflecting on where they are on Turtle Island presently;acknowledging the locality, then tuning in to an insightful discussion led by Indigenous artists that explores how <strong>Land and Place</strong> shapes the creative practice</p>\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>MONDAY,  Sept. 16 2pm to 5pm</strong></p><p>ARTS COURT THEATRE</p><p><strong>Showcases and Dialogue:</strong></p><p>Stage Left Productions, Closet Freaks; Ahmed Meree Adrenaline; Sarah Waisvisz,  Monstrous</p>\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>TUESDAY,  Sept. 17 10am to 1:30pm</strong></p><p> ARTS COURT STUDIO</p><p><strong>TALK Session #2:  </strong><em>Engaging Intersectionality</em></p><p>Noted artists, thinkers and activists from across the diaspora will be Engaging in nuanced dialogs onIntersectionalitythat affirm the lived experiences of artists from Black, Indigenous communities and communities of colour, inclusive of gender, race and disability. </p>\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>TUESDAY,  Sept. 17 10am to 1:30pm</strong></p><p> ARTS COURT THEATRE</p><p><strong>Pitch and Dialogue:</strong></p><p>Electric Company, Barbra Diabo, Aluna Theatre, Ryan Cunningham (Huff), Jacques Mindreau.</p>\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>WEDNESDAY, </strong><strong>Sept. 18  10am to 1:30pm</strong></p><p>ARTS COURT STUDIO</p><p><strong>TALK Session #3: </strong><em>Addressing the Void</em></p><p>All assembled will be engaged in <strong>Addressing the Void</strong> -  offering expansive thoughts on what and who is missing in the current arts ecology; making visible what kinds of bodies and narratives are rarely reflected on stage, in film and within galleries. </p><p> <em>**ASL Translation</em></p>\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>WEDNESDAY, </strong><strong>Sept. 18 2pm to 5pm </strong></p><p>ARTS COURT THEATRE</p><p><strong>Showcase and Dialogue:</strong></p><p>Alvin Tolentino Passages, Reeny Smith, Keonte Beals,, JP Longboat Wolf a Transformation.</p>\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>WEDNESDAY, </strong><strong>Sept. 18 2pm to 5pm </strong></p><p>ARTS COURT LIBRARY</p><p><strong>Canada Council for the Arts</strong> – Presentation on Sector Innovation and Development Grant Program <em>(Denis Lepsis and Felipe Diaz)</em></p><p> <br />Are you an artist or an arts professional working with an arts group, organization, or collective with bold, innovative, or special infrastructure or sector building projects in mind? Don’t quite know which Canada Council for the Arts program they might fit under? The Canada Council for the Arts will be giving a presentation on project grant components and opportunities for arts groups, organizations, and collectives, with an emphasis on the Sector Innovation and Development component of the Supporting Artistic Practice program. This presentation (in English followed by a Q&amp;A in English and French) will include a brief overview of the Canada Council’s programs, a look at who can apply and what kinds of projects are eligible under Sector Innovation and Development, and some helpful tips on putting together your strongest application.</p><p><em>**ASL Translation</em></p>\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>THURSDAY, </strong><strong>Sept. 19 10am to 1:30pm </strong></p><p>ARTS COURT STUDIO</p><p><strong>TALK Session #4:  </strong><em>Moving Beyond Gesture</em></p><p><br />Intentional space will be carved out for those with shared cultural connections to gather amongst themselves; coming back together for a communal meal to eat and strategize on how to <strong>Move Beyond the Gesture;</strong> deepening our intention to build meaningful relationships beyond The TALK.</p><p> <br /><em>**ASL Translation</em></p>\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>THURSDAY, </strong><strong>Sept. 19 2pm to 5pm </strong></p><p>ARTS COURT THEATRE</p><p><strong>Pitch and Dialogue:</strong></p><p>Hong Kong Exile, Diyet &amp; the Love Soldiers, Dancers of Damelahamid, Ryan Cunningham (Asheq), Ensemble Kamaan.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1024\" height=\"30\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Thanks-sponsors-1024x30.jpg\" alt=\"Thanks to our Sponsors and Funders\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Thanks-sponsors-1024x30.jpg 1024w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Thanks-sponsors-300x9.jpg 300w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Thanks-sponsors-768x22.jpg 768w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Thanks-sponsors-1120x33.jpg 1120w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Thanks-sponsors-640x19.jpg 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                        <a href=\"https://www.gctc.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/GCTC-1.jpg\" alt=\"Great Canadian Theatre Company\"></a>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                        <a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/canadian-heritage.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Canada-wordmark.jpg\" alt=\"Canada\"></a>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                        <a href=\"http://www.arts.on.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/oac.jpg\" alt=\"Ontario Arts Council\"></a>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                        <a href=\"https://canadacouncil.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/canada-council.jpg\" alt=\"Canada Council for the Arts\"></a>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                        <a href=\"https://cch.novascotia.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/novascotia.jpg\" alt=\"Nova Scotia\"></a>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                        <a href=\"https://www.halifax.ca/recreation/arts-culture-heritage/opportunities-artists-halifax\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/halifax.jpg\" alt=\"Halifax\"></a>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                    \n                                    <!-- Add Arrows -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                        <a href=\"https://www.factor.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/factor_logo.jpg\" alt=\"Factor\"></a>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                        <a href=\"https://www.les-suites.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/Les-Suites_Logo.jpg\" alt=\"Les Suites Hotel Ottawa\"></a>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                        <a href=\"http://eng.gokams.or.kr/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/korea-arts_logo.jpg\" alt=\"Halifax\"></a>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                        <a href=\"https://liveartdance.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Live-Art-Dance.jpg\" alt=\"Live Art Dance\"></a>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                        <a href=\"https://ontariopresents.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/ontario-presents_logo.jpg\" alt=\"Ontario Presents\"></a>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                        <a href=\"https://www.atlanticpresenters.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/atlantic-presents_logo.jpg\" alt=\"Atlantic Presenters Association\"></a>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                        <a href=\"https://www.nouvellescene.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/La-Nouvelle-Scene_Logo.jpg\" alt=\"La Nouvelle Scene\"></a>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                    \n                                    <!-- Add Arrows -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                        <a href=\"https://www.thegladstone.ca/\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/theGladstone_logo.jpg\" alt=\"The Gladstone\"></a>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                        <a href=\"https://artscourt.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/artsCourt_logo.jpg\" alt=\"Arts Court Theatre\"></a>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                        <a href=\"https://saw-centre.com/ \"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/SAW_logo.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                        <a href=\"http://halifaxcentrallibrary.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/HPL_Logo_Horizontal_Master.jpg\" alt=\"Halifax Public Libraries\"></a>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                        <a href=\"http://musicnovascotia.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/musicNovaScotia_logo.jpg\" alt=\"Music Nova Scotia\"></a>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t           