        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Twitter Desktop Rebecca Thomas Type of Performance: &nbsp;Spoken Word (Ottawa Opening Gala) Dates: September 15th @ 5pm&nbsp; Venue:... <a class=\"excerpt-read-more\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/rebecca-thomas-2019/\"><span>Continue Reading</span></a>"
