 Manager, Co-Producer, Sound Design, Tech Operator, Assistant Technical Director<br /><strong>Mohsen Sharifian</strong> | Composer, Musician, Cultural Advisor, selected music from Lian Music<br /><strong>Habib Meftahboushehri</strong> | Composer, Musician, selected music from Shibaali Album)<br /><strong>Sina Bathaie</strong> | Additional music selections from Ray of Hope album <strong>Karen Bassett</strong> | Dramaturg<br /><strong>Mike Mader</strong> | Technical Director, Lighting and Projection Design, Construction, QLab Supervisor and 3D mapping, Sound Installation <strong>Jake Dambergs</strong> | Digital Technology Advisor, Sound, Props<br /><strong>Nick Bottomley</strong> | Projections and Animation<br /><strong>Ryan Neal</strong> | Projection, Animation<br /><strong>Payam Sayadi</strong> | Calligraphy<br /><strong>Miya Turnbul</strong>l | Props<br /><strong>Shaun Alexander</strong> | Photography and Graphic Design<br /><strong>Hugh Nielson</strong> | Strategic Advisor<br /><strong>Coleen Shirin MacPherso</strong>n | Toronto Producer</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/onelighttheatre\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFacebook-f\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://twitter.com/onelighttheatre\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTwitter\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/onelighttheatre/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tInstagram\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Onelight     Theatre&nbsp;Asheq: Ritual Music to Cure a Lover </h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>Type of Performance:</strong> Theatre</p><p><strong>Dates: </strong>September 16th @6pm</p><p>            September 17th @7pm</p><p>            September 18th @7:45pm</p><p>            September 19th @8pm</p><p><strong>Venue: </strong>Nouvelle Scene - Studio A</p><p><strong>Ticket Prices: </strong><strong>$23</strong> <em>(Gen Ticket) </em>/ <strong>$19</s