    ],
    "http://schema.org/headline": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Paul Wong 2019"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"1024\" height=\"762\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/Paul-Wong-1024x762.jpg\" alt=\"Paul Wong\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/Paul-Wong-1024x762.jpg 1024w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/Paul-Wong-300x223.jpg 300w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/Paul-Wong-768x572.jpg 768w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/Paul-Wong-1120x833.jpg 1120w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/Paul-Wong-640x476.jpg 640w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/Paul-Wong.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\">\n<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/paulwongprojects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\nFacebook\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://twitter.com/paulwongproject\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\nTwitter\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDrxTd6CaJMhqy0xx0eyIxQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\nYoutube\n</a>\n<a href=\"http://paulwongprojects.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\nDesktop\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://vimeo.com/paulwongprojects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\nVimeo\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/paulwongprojects/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\nInstagram\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://paulwongprojects.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\nTumblr\n</a>\n<h2>Paul     Wong&nbsp;Claiming Public Space</h2>\n<strong>Type of Performance:</strong>&nbsp;Media Artist Screening\n\n<strong>Dates: </strong>September 16th @ 6:30pm\n\n<strong>Venue: </strong>SAW Gallery\n\n<strong>Runtime: </strong>75 mins (includes Q&amp;A time)\n\n<strong>Ticket Prices: </strong>Free\n\nPaul Wong is an award winning artist and curator based in Vancouver. He is presenting a video screening and artist talk focusing on his new and recent public art projects that will include Occupying Chinatown, a one year City of Vancouver artists residency.&nbsp;This is the first Artist Talk and Screening of Wong’s recent interdisciplinary and media art works in Ottawa in over a decade. It is not to be missed!\n\nThe illustrated talk will focus on art projects in public spaces including large scale architectural video mapping projections, commissioned neon for the Audain Art Museum, an outdoor video installation for Vancouver Opera and projects related to Occupying Chinatown in his year long residency commissioned by the City of Vancouver.\n<ul>\n \t<li>Year of Gif (2013) commissioned by Surrey Art Gallery</li>\n \t<li>No Thing is Forever (2016) commissioned &nbsp;by Audain Art Museum</li>\n \t<li>Five Octave Range (2017) commissioned by Vancouver Opera</li>\n \t<li>Winners &amp; Loser’s (2017) video mapping commissioned by Vancouver Art Gallery and Burrard Art Foundation</li>\n \t<li>Troublemaker’s 3.0 (2018)</li>\n \t<li>Occupying Chinatown (2019) commissioned by City of Vancouver Public Art Program</li>\n \t<li>Pride In Chinatown (2019) produced by On Main Gallery, Alternative Pride Festival</li>\n</ul>\n<img width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/4b_Five-Octave-Range-1024x768.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/4b_Five-Octave-Range-1024x768.jpeg 1024w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/4b_Five-Octave-Range-300x225.jpeg 300w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/4b_Five-Octave-Range-768x576.jpeg 768w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/4b_Five-Octave-Range-1536x1152.jpeg 1536w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/4b_Five-Octave-Range-1120x840.jpeg 1120w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/4b_Five-Octave-Range-640x480.jpeg 640w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/4b_Five-Octave-Range.jpeg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\">\n<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2019-archive/\" role=\"button\">\nBack to 2019\n</a>"
      }
    ],
