wEnforcement Training Center. While in the U.S., Clyde was one of the co-founders of the Memorial Day Writers’ Project.</p><p>Over his lifetime, Clyde has appeared in and initiated countless projects in poetry, music, theatre, dance ,and spoken word. In addition to writing, performing, and acting, he is also active in mentoring and supporting young writers.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1024\" height=\"680\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/ClydeAWray-2020-2-1024x680.jpg\" alt=\"ClydeAWray-2020-2\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/ClydeAWray-2020-2-1024x680.jpg 1024w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/ClydeAWray-2020-2-300x199.jpg 300w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/ClydeAWray-2020-2-768x510.jpg 768w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/ClydeAWray-2020-2-1536x1020.jpg 1536w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/ClydeAWray-2020-2-1120x744.jpg 1120w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/ClydeAWray-2020-2-640x425.jpg 640w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/ClydeAWray-2020-2.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/prismatic-2020/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2020\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
