        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Sadaf Foroughi Sadaf Foroughi is an Iranian-Canadian, Montreal-based filmmaker. She began her artistic career in 2003 by creating... <a class=\"excerpt-read-more\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/ava-2018/\"><span>Continue Reading</span></a>"
