        "@value": "TALK Sessions and Guests DAY &amp; THEME DESCRIPTION ARTISTS &amp; THINKERS MONDAY September 16 DAY 1:  Land and... <a class=\"excerpt-read-more\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/the-talk/\"><span>Continue Reading</span></a>"
