        "@value": "The Talk (2019 at a Glance)"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h1>TALK Sessions and Guests</h1>\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>DAY &amp; THEME</strong></p><h3><b>DESCRIPTION</b></h3><h3><b>ARTISTS &amp; THINKERS</b></h3><h1><b>MONDAY</b></h1><h3>September 16</h3>\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>DAY 1:  </strong>Land and Place</p><p><strong>Description:  </strong>Collectively this international assembly of artists, thinkers, presenters, local and global citizens will begin by reflecting on where they are on Turtle Island presently; acknowledging the locality, then tuning in to an insightful discussion led by Indigenous artists that explores how <strong>Land and Place</strong> shapes the creative practice. </p><p>Artists and thinkers reflecting those being presented at this year’s Prismatic Festival as well as invited international and national guests will be announced soon.</p><p><strong>Facilitator by:  </strong>Co-curator of <strong>The TALK: 2019</strong> <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/talk-participants/#leslieMcCue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Leslie McCue</a></p><p><strong>Algonquin Spiritual Advisor:</strong> <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/talk-participants/#albertDumont\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Albert Dumont</a></p><p><strong>Invited Guests:</strong> <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/talk-participants/#ravenDavis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Raven Davis</a>, <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/talk-participants/#justinFingers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Justin Many Fingers</a>, <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/talk-participants/#theresaCutknife\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Theresa Cutknife</a>, and <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/talk-participants/#robertChartier\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Robert Chartier</a></p><h1><b>Tuesday</b></h1><h3>September 17</h3>\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>DAY 2:</strong>  Engaging Intersectionality</p><p><strong>Description</strong>:  Noted artists, thinkers and activists from across the diaspora will be <strong>Engaging in nuanced dialogs on Intersectionality</strong> that affirm the lived experiences of artists from Black, Indigenous communities and communities of colour, inclusive of gender, race and disability.</p><p><strong>Facilitator by:  </strong><a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/talk-participants/#syrusWare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Syrus Marcus Ware</a></p><p><strong>Invited Guests:</strong> <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/talk-participants/#yolandaBonnell\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yolanda Bonnell</a>, <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/talk-participants/#julieManning\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Julie Tamiko Manning</a>, and <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/talk-participants/#leeSuFeh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Su-Feh Lee</a></p><h1><b>Wednesday</b></h1><h3>September 18</h3>\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>DAY 3:</strong> Addressing the Void</p><p><strong>Description</strong>:  All assembled will be engaged in <strong>Addressing the Void</strong> -  offering expansive thoughts on what and who is missing in the current arts ecology; making visible what kinds of bodies and narratives are rarely reflected on stage, in film and within galleries</p><p><strong>Facilitator for this gathering:  </strong>Co-curator of <strong>The TALK: 2019</strong>, <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/talk-participants/#barakSoleil\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Barak adé Soleil</a> and <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/talk-participants/#tamykaBullen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Tamyka Bullen</a></p><p><strong>Invited Guests:</strong> <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/talk-participants/#ravenDavis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Raven Davis</a>, Torrie Ironstar, and <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/talk-participants/#rosinaZazi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rosina Zazi</a></p><h1><b>Thursday</b></h1><h3>September 19</h3>\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>DAY 4:</strong>  Move Beyond Gesture</p><p><strong>Description</strong>:  Intentional space will be carved out for those with shared cultural connections to gather amongst themselves; coming back together for a communal meal to eat and strategize on how to <strong>Move Beyond the Gesture</strong>; deepening our intention to buildmeaningful relationships beyond <strong>The TALK</strong>.</p><p><strong>Facilit</strong><strong>ato</strong><strong>r for this gathering:</strong>Co-curators of <strong>The TALK: 2019</strong>, <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/talk-participants/#barakSoleil\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Barak adé Soleil</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/talk-participants/#leslieMcCue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Leslie McCue</a> </p><p><strong>Invited Guests:</strong> <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/the-talk/#tamykaBullen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Tamyka Bullen</a>, Torrie Ironstar, <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/talk-participants/#paulWong\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Paul Wong</a>, and <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/talk-participants/#tylerSimmonds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Tyler Simmonds</a></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1024\" height=\"30\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Thanks-sponsors-1024x30.jpg\" alt=\"Thanks to our Sponsors and Funders\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Thanks-sponsors-1024x30.jpg 1024w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Thanks-sponsors-300x9.jpg 300w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Thanks-sponsors-768x22.jpg 768w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Thanks-sponsors-1120x33.jpg 1120w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Thanks-sponsors-640x19.jpg 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                        <a href=\"https://www.gctc.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/GCTC-1.jpg\" alt=\"Great Canadian Theatre Company\"></a>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                        <a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/canadian-heritage.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Canada-wordmark.jpg\" alt=\"Canada\"></a>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                        <a href=\"http://www.arts.on.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/oac.jpg\" alt=\"Ontario Arts Council\"></a>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                        <a href=\"https://canadacouncil.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/canada-council.jpg\" alt=\"Canada Council for the Arts\"></a>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                        <a href=\"https://cch.novascotia.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/novascotia.jpg\" alt=\"Nova Scotia\"></a>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t