    ],
    "http://schema.org/headline": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Broken English Karaoke 2018"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Stephanie-Yee-headshot-photo-credit-Jordan-Yee-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"Stephanie Yee\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Stephanie-Yee-headshot-photo-credit-Jordan-Yee-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Stephanie-Yee-headshot-photo-credit-Jordan-Yee-300x225.jpg 300w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Stephanie-Yee-headshot-photo-credit-Jordan-Yee-768x576.jpg 768w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Stephanie-Yee-headshot-photo-credit-Jordan-Yee-1120x840.jpg 1120w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Stephanie-Yee-headshot-photo-credit-Jordan-Yee-640x480.jpg 640w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Stephanie-Yee-headshot-photo-credit-Jordan-Yee.jpg 2034w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://vimeo.com/user919488\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tVimeo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/wordsketch/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSoundcloud\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://stephanieyee.info/information\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tDesktop\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Stephanie     Yee&nbsp;Broken English Karaoke</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>Type of Art:</strong> Performance</p><p><strong>Dates: </strong>Sept 12th - 16th  @ 10pm</p><p><strong>Location: </strong>Bus Stop Theatre</p>\t\t\n\t\t<p>Stephanie Yee is a multidisciplinary artist known for creating thoughtful and immersive work that interrogates concepts of community and identity. Using performance, video, sculpture and installation, she creates spaces where the audience can negotiate a work’s meaning together. Blurring the lines between real and imagined scenarios, Yee’s practice aims to re-examine notions of everyday life. Currently based in Windsor, Ontario, her artistic pursuits brought her to Halifax and New York City. As both an artist and curator, she has participated in various artist-run centers, festivals, galleries and residencies, locally and internationally. She was an Arts Nova Scotia creation grant recipient, was featured on the cover of Visual Arts News magazine’s Summer 2017 issue and is one quarter of ORIENTATION, an Asian woman arts collective.</p><p>A crowd favourite at Prismatic, Stephanie is pleased to present Broken English Karaoke and can’t wait to see you up on stage, mic in hand!</p><p><strong>Broken English Karaoke</strong></p><p>Festival goers are invited to end the night with us either on the stage or in the audience of this interactive performance installation. All within the length of a song, each opportunity challenges the participant to navigate the boundaries between the familiar and unfamiliar.</p><p>While karaoke pervades everyday life in many Asian countries, the presence of karaoke in North America is usually confined to aspiring celebrities and drinking culture. Adopting the platform of karaoke, and its myriad associations, this piece replaces the lyrics of popular American songs with broken English translations. The end result allows for a fun experience that not only exposes the complexities of language, but social anxieties as well. Come join us and have a good time as we delve into and explore the lively state of being lost and found in translation.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t\t<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"51e8911\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"IMG_4934\" href='https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG_4934.png'><img width=\"1000\" height=\"1333\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG_4934.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG_4934.png 1000w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG_4934-225x300.png 225w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG_4934-768x1024.png 768w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG_4934-640x853.png 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t\t<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"51e8911\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"IMG_5001\" href='https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG_5001.png'><img width=\"1000\" height=\"750\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG_5001.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG_5001.png 1000w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG_5001-300x225.png 300w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG_5001-768x576.png 768w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG_5001-640x480.png 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t\t<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"51e8911\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"IMG_4973\" href='https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG_4973.png'><img width=\"1000\" height=\"1333\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG_4973.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG_4973.png 1000w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG_4973-225x300.png 225w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG_4973-768x1024.png 768w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/IMG_4973-640x853.png 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2018-archive/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2018\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2018-archive/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2018\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
      }
    ],
