    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"1024\" height=\"671\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/IMG_4985-1024x671.jpg\" alt=\"The Wabanaki Confederacy Singers\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/IMG_4985-1024x671.jpg 1024w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/IMG_4985-300x197.jpg 300w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/IMG_4985-768x503.jpg 768w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/IMG_4985-1120x734.jpg 1120w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/IMG_4985-640x420.jpg 640w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/IMG_4985.jpg 1440w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>The     Wabanaki     Confederacy     Singers&nbsp;Opening Gala </h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Type of Art:  Music</p><p>Dates: Sept 14th @ 6pm</p><p>Location: Halifax Central Library – Paul O’Regan Hall</p>\t\t\n\t\t<p>Wabanaki Confederacy are a Northern Powwow styled singing group based out of Eastern Canada. This group strives to blend a traditional style of Mi’kmaq singing with a more current style of Northern Powwow. Wabanaki translated roughly means “People of the First Light.” The name of their group was chosen out of respect for their ancestors who suffered and strived to fight for their existence and life as they know it today.</p><p>Wabanaki Confederacy is a group made up of family men who take pride in promoting their eastern tribe cultural teachings, while learning and sharing other teachings from tribes throughout the globe. Their goal: creating more cultural awareness of their teachings while still maintaining an inspiring and fun atmosphere through song and dance. Although they are a newer singing group, their singers have over 15 years of experience singing powwow throughout Canada and the United States.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2017-archive/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2017\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
