    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"734\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/HubertFrancisOpeningGala-734x1024.jpg\" alt=\"hubert-francis\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/HubertFrancisOpeningGala-734x1024.jpg 734w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/HubertFrancisOpeningGala-215x300.jpg 215w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/HubertFrancisOpeningGala-768x1071.jpg 768w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/HubertFrancisOpeningGala-1102x1536.jpg 1102w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/HubertFrancisOpeningGala-1469x2048.jpg 1469w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/HubertFrancisOpeningGala-1120x1561.jpg 1120w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/HubertFrancisOpeningGala-640x892.jpg 640w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/HubertFrancisOpeningGala-scaled.jpg 1836w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 734px) 100vw, 734px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Hubert     Francis&nbsp;Opening Gala</h3>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Type of Art:  Music</p><p>Dates: Sept 14th @ 6pm</p><p>Location: Halifax Central Library – Paul O’Regan Hall</p>\t\t\n\t\t<p> Hubert Francis hails from the band Eaglefeather from Elsipogtog Mig’Mag Indian Reserve. Eaglefeather’s last cd “Message From A Drum” received Juno, East Coast Music, and American Music Award nominations. Their International award winning rock group has been led by Hubert since 1990, combining a unique sound of traditional chants and contemporary rock.</p><p> Hubert Francis hails from the band Eaglefeather from Elsipogtog Mig’Mag Indian Reserve. Eaglefeather’s last cd “Message From A Drum” received Juno, East Coast Music, and American Music Award nominations. Their International award winning rock group has been led by Hubert since 1990, combining a unique sound of traditional chants and contemporary rock.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2017-archive/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2017\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
      }
    ],
