ltar of Us”, a theatre work that reveals the clash of cultures existing amidst their union as it raises interesting questions around culture, race and gender.</p><p>*The Play is in development with the assistance of Playwrights Theatre Centre (PTC) and through support from Theatre Conspiracy. Consulting Dramaturg: Kathleen Flaherty.”</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2017-archive/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2017\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
