    ],
    "http://schema.org/headline": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Studio Black! 2017"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"1024\" height=\"571\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Screen-Shot-2021-05-05-at-1.30.07-PM-1024x571.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Screen-Shot-2021-05-05-at-1.30.07-PM-1024x571.png 1024w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Screen-Shot-2021-05-05-at-1.30.07-PM-300x167.png 300w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Screen-Shot-2021-05-05-at-1.30.07-PM-768x428.png 768w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Screen-Shot-2021-05-05-at-1.30.07-PM-1536x857.png 1536w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Screen-Shot-2021-05-05-at-1.30.07-PM-1120x625.png 1120w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Screen-Shot-2021-05-05-at-1.30.07-PM-640x357.png 640w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Screen-Shot-2021-05-05-at-1.30.07-PM.png 1778w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>Directors:</strong> Cory Bowles, Koumbie, Juanita Peters<br /><strong>Writer</strong>: William D. MacGillivray<br /><strong>Producer</strong>: Terry Greenlaw<br /><strong>Cast</strong>: Kate MacDonald, Nathan D. Simmons, Stephen M.D., Lawrence, Adrian Bromfield, Cavell Holland-Borden, Micha Cromwell, Koumbie, Brent Williams<br /><strong>Editor:</strong> Kimberlee McTaggart<br /><strong>Country:</strong> Canada<br /><strong>Runtime:</strong> 90 minutes</p><p> </p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Studio Black!</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>Type of Art:</strong>  Film</p><p><strong>Dates: </strong>Sept 20th @ 7 pm</p><p><strong>Location: </strong>Cineplex Theatre - Park Lane Theatre 5</p>\t\t\n\t\t<p>After an award-winning Season One, the ground-breaking series Studio Black! returns to the big screen. These new stories, The Contented Lady and the Rutabaga Rascals, No. 2 Construction, The Devil at the Dance and The Wedding Picture once again demonstrate the amazing range of the talented actors in this African Nova Scotian ensemble as well as their directors, Cory Bowles, Koumbie, and Juanita Peters who made each of these stories their own.</p><p>A Special Panel Discussion, including Studio Black! filmmakers, Koumbie, Juanita Peters, Cory Bowles and Prismatic's Shahin Sayadi will be held in the cinema immediately following the screening.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2017-archive/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2017\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
      }
    ],
