        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Creative/Production Team  Landline is created by Dustin Harvey and Adrienne Wong, and produced by Neworld Theatre and Secret... <a class=\"excerpt-read-more\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/neworld-theatre-and-secret-theatre-2014/\"><span>Continue Reading</span></a>"
