        "@value": "Written and Performed by Daniel Thau-Eleff Direction and Dramaturgy by Chris Gerrard-Pinker With Assistance from Arne MacPherson Media... <a class=\"excerpt-read-more\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/good-people-bad-things-2014/\"><span>Continue Reading</span></a>"
