sn’t confusing enough, Mike’s even more of a musical chameleon who cites blues, folk, and anything with a good groove, as his influences. Together they form an unforgettable combination of crazy-ass beatboxing, sassy rapping, killer harmonies, and fresh, urban, RnB-influenced compositions. And their debut album, Turn Me Up, exemplifies their abundant influences.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPrevious\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNext\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2014-archive/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2014\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
