    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"1024\" height=\"643\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Screen-Shot-2020-08-11-at-11.30.23-AM-1024x643.png\" alt=\"Sounds of Motown Prismatic Arts Festival 2015\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Screen-Shot-2020-08-11-at-11.30.23-AM-1024x643.png 1024w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Screen-Shot-2020-08-11-at-11.30.23-AM-300x188.png 300w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Screen-Shot-2020-08-11-at-11.30.23-AM-768x482.png 768w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Screen-Shot-2020-08-11-at-11.30.23-AM-1536x964.png 1536w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Screen-Shot-2020-08-11-at-11.30.23-AM-1120x703.png 1120w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Screen-Shot-2020-08-11-at-11.30.23-AM-640x402.png 640w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Screen-Shot-2020-08-11-at-11.30.23-AM.png 1622w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Sounds     of     Motown&nbsp;</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>Type of Art:</strong>  Music </p><p><strong>Dates: </strong>Aug 22nd </p><p><strong>Location:</strong> Alderney landing Outdoor Mainstage </p>\t\t\n\t\t<p>Coaxing bodies to the dance floor with favourites from the likes of Aretha Franklin, The  Temptations, Marvin Gaye, Stevie Wonder and Etta James, The Sounds of Motown is equal parts soothing and electrifying, and much more than a cover band. It takes an unstoppable lineup of performers to do such a legendary set list justice, which is why this band is built around the mammoth voices of genre-spanning vocalist Michelle Durling and veterans behind the mic Sam Moon, Henry Lewis and Carl Thomas. The familiar songs will draw you in, the air-tight performances will hook you and the band’s dynamic, fun-loving spirit will stick with you.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2015-archive/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2015\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
