      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"682\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/dinuk-682x1024.jpg\" alt=\"dinuk\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/dinuk-682x1024.jpg 682w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/dinuk-200x300.jpg 200w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/dinuk-768x1154.jpg 768w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/dinuk-1022x1536.jpg 1022w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/dinuk-1120x1683.jpg 1120w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/dinuk-640x962.jpg 640w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/dinuk.jpg 1278w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 682px) 100vw, 682px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>Dinuk Wijeratne</strong> (Piano)<br /><strong>Daniel MacNeil</strong> (Oud)<br /><strong>Nick Halley</strong> (Percussion)<br /><strong>Chris Mitchell</strong> (Saxophone)</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.dinukwijeratne.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tDesktop\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://twitter.com/WijeratneWorks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTwitter\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/wijeratneworks/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tInstagram\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Dinuk     Wijeratne&nbsp;Middle-Eastern Jazz Fusion</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>Type of Art:</strong>  Music</p><p><strong>Dates: </strong>Aug 23rd</p><p><strong>Location: </strong>Alderney Landing Outdoor Mainstage</p>\t\t\n\t\t<p>Middle-Eastern Jazz Fusion is an exemplary group of musicians composed of leading Canadian jazz and world musicians: Dinuk Wijeratne, Daniel MacNeil, Chris Mitchell and Nick Halley. These talented and dynamic musicians come together for an evocative evening of Middle-Eastern fus