 from the gospel cannon and some of the original gospel arrangements of traditional Christmas carols, that are featured in Tell it on the Mountain.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2015-archive/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2015\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
