        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Allysa Flint 2016"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Presentation-Document.002-1024x576.jpeg\" alt=\"Allysa Flint\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Presentation-Document.002-1024x576.jpeg 1024w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Presentation-Document.002-300x169.jpeg 300w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Presentation-Document.002-768x432.jpeg 768w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Presentation-Document.002-1536x864.jpeg 1536w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Presentation-Document.002-1120x630.jpeg 1120w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Presentation-Document.002-640x360.jpeg 640w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Presentation-Document.002.jpeg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Allysa Flint</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>Type of Art:</strong>  Spoken Word</p><p><strong>Dates:  </strong>Sept 23rd - 24th @ 9:30am</p><p><strong>Location: </strong>Halifax Central Library - Paul O’Regan Hall </p><p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">         Halifax Central Library - RBC Learning Centre </p>\t\t\n\t\t<p>Allysa Flint, a local Halifax spoken word artist, is joining us once again at this year’s Prismatic Arts Festival! Allysa’s powerful performance at the Opening Gala at Prismatic 2015 blew audiences away proving that she has a bright future ahead. Allysa has been writing poetry since she was 12 years old and in recent years she has been establishing herself as an outstanding spoken word performer. Her writing reflects the topics she feels most passionate about; the issues facing youth in this day and age - including sexual violence, suicide, bullying, and drugs and alcohol. A sensitive and passionate youth artist, Allysa strives to convey an insightful message to her fellow youth through spoken word.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2016-archive/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2016\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
      }
    ],
