      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Eljuri1-768x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Eljuri\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Eljuri1-768x1024.jpg 768w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Eljuri1-225x300.jpg 225w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Eljuri1-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Eljuri1-1120x1493.jpg 1120w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Eljuri1-640x853.jpg 640w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Eljuri1.jpg 1440w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/eljurimusic/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFacebook\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Eljuri\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTwitter\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbC5vGrZnhxQH7qHwH9ZO3g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tYoutube\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.eljurimusic.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tDesktop\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/eljurimusic/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tInstagram\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Eljuri </h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>Type of Art:</strong>  Music</p><p><strong>Dates:  </strong>Sept 23rd @ 7pm</p><p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">     Sept  24th @ 11:30pm </p><p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">     Sept 25th @  7pm</p><p><strong>Location: </strong>Company House</p><p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">         Halifax Central Library - Paul O’Regan Hall</p><p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">         Pier 21 - Kenneth C. Rowe Hall</p>\t\t\n\t\t<p>Eljuri creates a sonic reflecting pool. This energizing musician and performer absorbs drops of influence from all over the world - from cultures that she calls her own and others into which she dives to discover their treasures. Her music is sometimes a mirror lake reflecting this generation’s global fusion and sometimes a turbulent sea churning with cultural clashes.</p><p>Cecilia Villar Eljuri was born in Guayaquil, Ecuador and raised in New York City. From a young age she was immersed in music and the arts, demonstrating a singular focus for her passion. Sensitive and committed, of Latin blood and heart, she is a passionate singer, accomplished guitarist and award-winning songwriter who has toured all over the U.S., Mexico, South America and debuted in Canada in 2015. Her third studio album will be released in Fall 2016 and features a collection of songs that are fresh and of the times – her times and your times.</p><p>Her inspiration: “I continue to look at myself, my journeys passed and my path forward — I’m evolving and embracing it. The themes of my new songs center around stopping injustice and searching for a better way. I’m using my voice and guitar to drive and inspire positive social change.”</p><p>We are thrilled to present Eljuri – she is going to rock the Prismatic stage with her global rhythms and universal truths.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1024\" height=\"721\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Eljuri2-1024x721.jpg\" alt=\"Eljuri\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Eljuri2-1024x721.jpg 1024w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Eljuri2-300x211.jpg 300w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Eljuri2-768x541.jpg 768w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Eljuri2-1536x1082.jpg 1536w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Eljuri2-1120x789.jpg 1120w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Eljuri2-640x451.jpg 640w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Eljuri2.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2016-archive/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2016\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
      }
