    ],
    "http://schema.org/headline": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Maarja Nuet 2016"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/MaarjaNuut3-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"Maarja Nuut\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/MaarjaNuut3-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/MaarjaNuut3-300x225.jpg 300w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/MaarjaNuut3-768x576.jpg 768w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/MaarjaNuut3-1120x840.jpg 1120w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/MaarjaNuut3-640x480.jpg 640w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/MaarjaNuut3.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/MaarjaNuutEst/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFacebook\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/MaarjaNuutEst/videos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tYoutube\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.maarjanuut.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tDesktop\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Maarja     Nuut&nbsp;</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>Type of Art:</strong>  Music</p><p><strong>Dates: </strong>Sept 24th @ 7pm</p><p>             25th @  7pm </p><p><strong>Location: </strong>Company House</p><p>                   Pier 21 - Kenneth C. Rowe Hall</p>\t\t\n\t\t<p>Maarja Nuut is a fiddler and singer from Northern Estonia. Her music combines traditional dance tunes, songs, and stories with live electronics to create an intricate layered soundscape in a space where minimalism and experimental music meet the village musical traditions of pre-war Europe. It is like nothing you have heard, and without realizing, you will be whistling her repetitious tunes for hours after watching her perform.</p><p>Maarja is a storyteller and her tools are her fiddle, voice and modern electronics. In performance, Maarja creates a lively, relaxed state entrancing the audience and prolonging being in the moment while altering the ways of seeing, hearing and perceiving.</p><p>Her debut album Soolo was released in 2013 and her second album Une meeles was released internationally in June 2016.</p><p>Bringing the sounds and stories of Northern Estonia all the way to the Halifax stage – Prismatic presents musical storyteller Maarja Nuut.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2016-archive/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2016\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
      }
    ],
