m a large chain corporation and foraged from nature. These objects were then switched, returning the purchased objects to nature, and the foraged objects to the store. She demonstrates the prevalence of colonial desire to pillage the land for profit, while examining the contextual worth of natural resources.</p><p>Currently Najet is living in Vancouver, British Columbia pursuing work as a sculptor in the film industry but is looking forward to coming back to Halifax to take her well-deserved place on the Prismatic stage.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2016-archive/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2016\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
