  {
    "@id": "_:g4079520",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/ImageObject"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Solawa1.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/contentUrl": [
      {
        "@id": "https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Solawa1.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/width": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": "1200"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/height": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "462"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "solawa-2016"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/headline": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Solawa 2016"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"693\" height=\"462\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Solawa1.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Solawa1.jpg 693w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Solawa1-300x200.jpg 300w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Solawa1-640x427.jpg 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 693px) 100vw, 693px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/solawamontreal/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFacebook\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://solawa.bandcamp.com/album/tempo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tMusic\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Solawa </h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>Type of Art:</strong>  Music</p><p><strong>Date: </strong>Sept 22nd  @ 8pm</p><p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">  Sept 23rd  @ 7pm</p><p><strong>Location: </strong>Company House </p>\t\t\n\t\t<p>Hailing from Montreal – Solawa is a band composed of five incredibly talented, multi-dimensional artists. The music takes you away with a crisp, colourful multi dimensional sound. With something for everyone they perform in Plains Cree, French, Spanish and English. Together they bridge their musical and cultural universes and bring you – Solawa.</p><p>Moe Clark is a Métis multidisciplinary artist who specializes in vocals and spoken word. Éveline Grégoire-Rousseau is a harpist and singer who is always working on new, exciting projects. Damian Nisenson is a composer, singer, and saxophonist – who is heavily inspired by Jewish, Argentinian and Jazz music. Jean Félix Mailloux is a double bassist who is inspired by various genres from Jazz to World music. Ziya Tabassian is an Iranian percussionist who specializes in Baroque, Persian and Mediterranean music.</p><p>5 artists. 4 languages. 1 band. Bridging different musical cultures and universes – Prismatic is honoured to bring you a band that showcases the richness and true diversity of contemporary Canada.</p><p>Personnel: Moe Clark (vocals), Éveline Grégoire-Rousseau (harp and vocals), Damian Nisenson (sax, guitar, vocals), Jean Félix Mailloux (bass and vocals), Ziya Tabassian (percussions and vocals)</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"693\" height=\"462\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Solawa3.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Solawa3.jpg 693w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Solawa3-300x200.jpg 300w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Solawa3-640x427.jpg 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 693px) 100vw, 693px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"693\" height=\"462\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Solawa2.jpg\" alt=\"Solawa2\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Solawa2.jpg 693w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Solawa2-300x200.jpg 300w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Solawa2-640x427.jpg 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 693px) 100vw, 693px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2016-archive/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2016\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
      }
