        "@value": "The Talk 2018"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "TALK Conference 2018\n\n<img width=\"1024\" height=\"642\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Shibaali-2-1024x642.jpg\" alt=\"shibaali Prismatic Arts Festival\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Shibaali-2-1024x642.jpg 1024w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Shibaali-2-300x188.jpg 300w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Shibaali-2-768x482.jpg 768w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Shibaali-2-1536x964.jpg 1536w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Shibaali-2-2048x1285.jpg 2048w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Shibaali-2-1120x703.jpg 1120w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Shibaali-2-640x401.jpg 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\">\n<img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Rah-Eleh-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Rah-Eleh\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Rah-Eleh-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Rah-Eleh-150x150.jpg 150w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Rah-Eleh-300x300.jpg 300w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Rah-Eleh-768x768.jpg 768w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Rah-Eleh-1120x1120.jpg 1120w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Rah-Eleh-640x640.jpg 640w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Rah-Eleh.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\">\n<img width=\"1024\" height=\"680\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Mush-Hole-2-1024x680.jpg\" alt=\"mush Hole Prismatic Arts Festival 2018\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Mush-Hole-2-1024x680.jpg 1024w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Mush-Hole-2-300x199.jpg 300w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Mush-Hole-2-768x510.jpg 768w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Mush-Hole-2-1536x1020.jpg 1536w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Mush-Hole-2-2048x1360.jpg 2048w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Mush-Hole-2-1120x744.jpg 1120w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Mush-Hole-2-640x425.jpg 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\">\n<img width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Picture-1092-1024x683.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Picture-1092-1024x683.jpeg 1024w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Picture-1092-300x200.jpeg 300w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Picture-1092-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Picture-1092-1536x1024.jpeg 1536w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Picture-1092-1120x747.jpeg 1120w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Picture-1092-640x427.jpeg 640w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Picture-1092.jpeg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\">\n\n<b>Artists of the Iranian Diaspora</b>\n\nSeptember 11 at 9pm\n\nReception &amp; Panel Discussion - Presented by Cresco\n\nAtlantica Hotel Halifax - Commons Room\n\nFollowing Shibaali concert, Prismatic hosts a reception and panel discussion to explore the artistic and professional challenges and opportunities facing artists in the Iranian diaspora. Hear from Prismatic 2018 artists: Habib Meftahboushehri (France), Sina Bathaie (Canada), Rah-Eleh (Canada), Mohsen Sharifian (Iran) and Shahin Sayadi (Canada / US).\n\n<b>Rah-Eleh - Artist Talk </b>\n\nSeptember 13 at 6pm\n\nDalhousie University - The Kenneth C. Rowe Management Building: Room 1028\n\nVisual and performance artist Rah-Eleh will be speaking about her creative process and work, with specific reference to SuperNova – the artist’s installation that is co-presented by Prismatic and the Art Gallery of Nova Scotia.\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>Inside the Creative Process</b></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">September 12 at 1:30pm</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Dalhousie University - The Kenneth C. Rowe Management Building: Room 1028</p>\nA part of Intro to Performance class but Open to the Public, Prismatic 2018 artists, Shahin Sayadi and Rah-Eleh, will be engaging with students of the Fountain School of Performing Arts (Dalhousie University) to provide a “behindthe- scenes” look into the creative process that the artists employ to develop and produce their theatre, visual arts and performance art works.\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>Santee Smith - Artist Talk </b></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">September 14</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Spatz Theatre</p>\nFollowing the student matinee performance of The Mush Hole Award-winning dancer and choreographer, Santee Smith, will engage with audiences following the performance of The Mush Hole.\n\n<b>Shahin Sayadi – Artist Talk</b>\n\nSeptember 14&nbsp;\n\nDalhousie Arts Centre - Dunn Theatre\n\nTheatre artist, Shahin Sayadi, will engage with audiences following the final performance of Asheq at Prismatic 2018. He will be discussing his creative influences and the process used to develop and produce Asheq: Ritual Music to Cure a Lover.\n\n<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2018-archive/\" role=\"button\">\nBack to 2018\n</a>"
      }
    ],
