r Best Original Score.</p><p>Jacques mesmerized audiences in Ottawa at Prismatic 2019, and we are delighted to welcome him back to the stage, this time in his home province!</p><p><i>Prismatic’s 2021 digital programming is generously supported by </i><b><i>TD Bank Group </i></b><i>and </i><b><i>Light House GO.</i></b></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2021\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2021\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
