es it almost impossible for audiences to sit still.</p><p><i>Prismatic’s 2021 digital programming is generously supported by </i><b><i>TD Bank Group </i></b><i>and </i><b><i>Light House GO.</i></b></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2021-2/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2021\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
