        "@value": "  Dilshan Weerasinghe | GuitarNathan Simmons | Bass, VocalsNicolae Orengo | DrumsBehrooz Mihankhah | KeyboardAaron Klein | Trumpet... <a class=\"excerpt-read-more\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/illest-omen-2021/\"><span>Continue Reading</span></a>"
