        "@value": "Desktop Twitter Instagram Lead With Love  Lorraine Whitman (“Grandmother White Sea Turtle”) This film discusses multiple forms of... <a class=\"excerpt-read-more\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/tyler-simmonds-2021/\"><span>Continue Reading</span></a>"
