        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Morgan Toney 2021"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Keith-Morgan-Iona-bridge-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i1.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Keith-Morgan-Iona-bridge.jpg?resize=1024%2C683&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i1.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Keith-Morgan-Iona-bridge.jpg?resize=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i1.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Keith-Morgan-Iona-bridge.jpg?resize=768%2C512&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i1.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Keith-Morgan-Iona-bridge.jpg?resize=1536%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i1.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Keith-Morgan-Iona-bridge.jpg?resize=1120%2C747&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i1.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Keith-Morgan-Iona-bridge.jpg?resize=640%2C427&amp;ssl=1 640w, https://i1.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Keith-Morgan-Iona-bridge.jpg?w=1920&amp;ssl=1 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://morgantoney.bandcamp.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tMusic\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/channel/UClFyAWN7qQdh1wo3olFDxSA/featured%20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tYoutube\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/Morgan-Toney-Mikmaq-Fiddle-Player-106589264500596\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFacebook\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.instagram.com/morgantoneymusic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tInstagram\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://morgantoneymusic.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tDesktop\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<p><b>Morgan Toney </b>| Fiddle, Vocals<br /><b>Keith Mullins </b>| Guitar, Percussion, Vocals<br /><b>Jesse Cox </b>| Guitar, Banjo, Vocals<br /><b>Isabella Samson </b> | Piano, Vocals</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Morgan Toney</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Friday, October 1st | 7PM</p><p><b>Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Stage</b></p><p data-wahfont=\"18\"><em>Regular $30 | Pay What You Can $5, $10, $15, $20, $25 options</em></p><p><b> </b></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://sales.neptunetheatre.com/Online/seatSelect.asp?createBO::WSmap=1&#038;BOparam::WSmap::loadBestAvailable::performance_ids=36BE66B7-CFC1-4DF9-A8B0-60743DA89C2C\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBuy Tickets Here\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<p>Morgan Toney is a 22-year-old Mi’kmaw singer-songwriter and fiddler from Wagmatcook First Nation. Morgan combines his Mi’kmaw roots and his love of Cape Breton Celtic tunes in the creation of a fresh new sound he calls “Mi’kmaltic.” His debut album, <i> First Flight</i>, was produced by multi-ECMA award winner Keith Mullins.  </p><p>Morgan’s video releases of “Ko’jua” and “Alasutamaqn,” his song for CBC East Coast Music Hour, have gathered tens of thousands of views. In 2021, the International Indigenous Music Summit partnered with Apple to create a mini-documentary about Morgan’s music. Summit leaders described him as “the one fulfilling the prophecy and carrying the torch from the east.”</p><p>Morgan will be joined onstage by Cape Breton talents Jesse Cox, Isabella Samson, and Keith Mullins to wow crowds with a high-energy show. Get ready to be blown away by this lively group’s unique sound!</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Barn-Bhreagh-group-photo-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i1.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Barn-Bhreagh-group-photo.jpg?resize=1024%2C683&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i1.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Barn-Bhreagh-group-photo.jpg?resize=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i1.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Barn-Bhreagh-group-photo.jpg?resize=768%2C512&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i1.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Barn-Bhreagh-group-photo.jpg?resize=1536%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i1.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Barn-Bhreagh-group-photo.jpg?resize=1120%2C747&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i1.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Barn-Bhreagh-group-photo.jpg?resize=640%2C427&amp;ssl=1 640w, https://i1.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Barn-Bhreagh-group-photo.jpg?w=1920&amp;ssl=1 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/prismatic-2021/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2021\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
      }
