founder of the hugely popular Prismatic Arts Festival, producer, director, actor, and writer. Clyde A. Wray the author of books of poetry, playwright, director and producer and what he likes to call a sometime performer, share in common perseverance. Today the weight of the Prismatic Arts festival is in the skillful and accomplished hands of Raeesa Lalani, who generously asked the cast of We Were Here to perform at the Neptune Theatre and for that sometime performer to speak here at Dalhousie.\"</h5><h5 style=\"text-align: center;\">- Clyde A. Wray</h5>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"768\" height=\"432\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Prismatic-2021-Sponsors-Funders-09-03-768x432.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Prismatic-2021-Sponsors-Funders-09-03.png?resize=768%2C432&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Prismatic-2021-Sponsors-Funders-09-03.png?resize=300%2C169&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Prismatic-2021-Sponsors-Funders-09-03.png?resize=1024%2C576&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Prismatic-2021-Sponsors-Funders-09-03.png?resize=1120%2C630&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Prismatic-2021-Sponsors-Funders-09-03.png?resize=640%2C360&amp;ssl=1 640w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Prismatic-2021-Sponsors-Funders-09-03.png?w=1280&amp;ssl=1 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" />"
