    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"1024\" height=\"216\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/industry-events-01-1024x216.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i1.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/industry-events-01.png?resize=1024%2C216&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i1.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/industry-events-01.png?resize=300%2C63&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i1.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/industry-events-01.png?resize=768%2C162&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i1.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/industry-events-01.png?resize=1536%2C324&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i1.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/industry-events-01.png?resize=2048%2C433&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https://i1.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/industry-events-01.png?resize=1120%2C237&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i1.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/industry-events-01.png?resize=640%2C135&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">co-presented with </p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.edfringe.com/\">Edinburgh Festival Fringe</a></p><p> </p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">Tuesday, September 28th | 3:30PM ADT</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://connect.edfringe.com/events/67936\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tREGISTER HERE\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<h3><b>Voices We Need to Hear: Women in the Arts</b></h3><p>This year, Prismatic’s annual TALK conference is going international!</p><p>In partnership with the Edinburgh Festival Fringe, Prismatic invites you to a global conversation featuring women in the arts. As we work towards rebuilding the global arts sector which has been deeply affected by the COVID-19 pandemic, there are major outcomes that can and will change our futures moving forward. How will the roles of women change in the arts sector and beyond? Will working from home change the function and structure of the working world as we know it?</p><p>There are crucial voices that we need to hear from within our sector, women, particularly Indigenous women and women of colour. With gender equality and racial politics at the forefront of our conversations, this panel gathers women leaders in the international arts sector to discuss these urgent questions.</p><p><b>Moderator:</b> Raeesa Lalani (CAN)</p><p><b>Panelists: </b>Dolina Wehipeihana (NZD) , Maggie Stewart (USA), Merindah Donnelly (AUS), Liliona Quarmyne (CAN)</p>https://youtu.be/xuCQmtUvu-4<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><i>* This project has been made possible by the Government of Canada and Edinburgh Festival Fringe. *</i></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Fringe-Society-logo-round-Pink-300x297.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"119\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Spotlight-Canada-Voices-We-Need-to-Hear-Women-Banner-300x155.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"179\" height=\"93\"></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"768\" height=\"432\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Prismatic-2021-Sponsors-Funders-09-21-768x432.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Prismatic-2021-Sponsors-Funders-09-21.png?resize=768%2C432&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Prismatic-2021-Sponsors-Funders-09-21.png?resize=300%2C169&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Prismatic-2021-Sponsors-Funders-09-21.png?resize=1024%2C576&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Prismatic-2021-Sponsors-Funders-09-21.png?resize=1120%2C630&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Prismatic-2021-Sponsors-Funders-09-21.png?resize=640%2C360&amp;ssl=1 640w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Prismatic-2021-Sponsors-Funders-09-21.png?w=1280&amp;ssl=1 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" />"
