        "@value": "About Prismatic Prismatic is Art for Everyone! Prismatic recognizes that artists work and create across disciplines and in... <a class=\"excerpt-read-more\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/prismatic-arts-festival-about/\"><span>Continue Reading</span></a>"
