    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h1>About Prismatic</h1>\t\t\n\t\t<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Prismatic is Art for Everyone!</h1><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Prismatic recognizes that artists work and create across disciplines and in innovative blends of artistic forms, cultural expressions, and traditional influences. Prismatic is a multi-disciplinary professional arts festival that showcases works in theatre, dance, music, visual arts, media arts, film, and inter-disciplinary works that defy categorization.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Prismatic provides unique opportunities for audiences of all ages and backgrounds to engage with the artists and their work in high-quality, accessible performances, workshop's and conference events.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Within the broad community of Indigenous artists and artists of colour in Canada, Prismatic is committed to prioritizing the work of artists who identify as part of communities that are under-represented in Canadian professional arts, including, women, members of the LGBTQIA2S+ community, and artists who are Deaf and disability-identified.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<h1>Since 2008, Prismatic has showcased 270 performances, by 615 artists and arts professionals, and has engaged 34,000 audience members. Prismatic has grown and expanded its operations over the years and now includes:</h1>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/film-screenings/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t<h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/film-screenings/\">Prismatic Film Screenings</a>\n\t\t\t\t</h4>\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/the-talk-2020/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t<h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/the-talk-2020/\">The TALK<br><br><br></a>\n\t\t\t\t</h4>\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/industry-events/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t<h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/industry-events/\">Industry Events</a>\n\t\t\t\t</h4>\n\t\t\t<h1>Prismatic Mission</h1>\t\t\n\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">The <em><strong>Prismatic Mission</strong></em> is to be a leading Canadian arts festival that engages diverse stakeholders through performance, networking and collaborative learning.</p>\t\t\n\t\t<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Prismatic Mandate</h1><ul><li>To bring new works of Canada’s leading Indigenous and culturally diverse artists to a wide audience;</li><li>To create opportunities for the public to engage with and learn about new art forms and artistic traditions</li><li>To facilitate the professional and artistic development of emerging and professional artists</li><li>To partner with a variety of stakeholders to bring diverse perspectives, experiences and vision to Prismatic’s artistic pursuits and professional development activities.</li></ul><h1> </h1><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Accessibility and Inclusion</h1><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Art for Everyone!</strong></h2><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><strong> Prismatic is committed to making its events and performances accessible to all members of the community. </strong></em></h3><p><strong>This means that we:</strong></p><ul><li>Select venues that have accessible entrances and washrooms. Read more about accessibility at the Prismatic 2020 venues <strong><a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/plan-your-prismatic-2020/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a>.</strong></li><li>Welcome service animals and personal support workers to performances and events.</li><li>Work with artists to provide captioning, ASL, written and audio descriptions of performances, when possible.</li><li>Provide ASL translation or captioning at significant Prismatic events and activities.</li></ul><p>Prismatic wants everyone one to be able to engage with the artists and their work. Please contact us to discuss how Prismatic can best support your Festival experience. <strong><br /><a href=\"tel:9024256812\">902-425-6812</a> or <a href=\"mailto:info@prismaticfestival.com\">info@prismaticfestival.com</a></strong></p>\t\t\n\t\t<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Prismatic Staff &amp; Board Members</h1>\t\t\n\t\t\t<figure><a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/shahin-sayadi/\"><img width=\"426\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Shahin-Sayadi.jpg\" alt=\"Shahin Sayadi\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Shahin-Sayadi.jpg 426w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Shahin-Sayadi-200x300.jpg 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 426px) 100vw, 426px\" /></a></figure><h3><a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/shahin-sayadi/\">Shahin Sayadi</a></h3><p>Executive Director <br><br></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<figure><a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/maggie-stewart/\"><img width=\"426\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Maggie-Full-Body-1.jpg\" alt=\"Maggie Stewart\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Maggie-Full-Body-1.jpg 426w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Maggie-Full-Body-1-200x300.jpg 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 426px) 100vw, 426px\" /></a></figure><h3><a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/maggie-stewart/\">Maggie Stewart</a></h3><p>Managing Director <br><br></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<figure><a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/raeesa-lalani/\"><img width=\"426\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Raeesa-Lalani-Headshot.jpg\" alt=\"Raeesa Lalani\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Raeesa-Lalani-Headshot.jpg 426w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Raeesa-Lalani-Headshot-200x300.jpg 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 426px) 100vw, 426px\" /></a></figure><h3><a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/raeesa-lalani/\">Raeesa Lalani </a></h3><p>Artistic Director\n</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<figure><img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/new-staff-02-300x300.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/new-staff-02-300x300.png 300w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/new-staff-02-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/new-staff-02-150x150.png 150w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/new-staff-02-768x768.png 768w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/new-staff-02-1536x1536.png 1536w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/new-staff-02-1120x1120.png 1120w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/new-staff-02-640x640.png 640w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/new-staff-02.png 1667w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></figure><h3>Kelly Li</h3><p>Assistant Producer </p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<figure><img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/new-staff-03-300x300.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/new-staff-03-300x300.png 300w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/new-staff-03-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/new-staff-03-150x150.png 150w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/new-staff-03-768x768.png 768w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/new-staff-03-1536x1536.png 1536w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/new-staff-03-1120x1120.png 1120w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/new-staff-03-640x640.png 640w, https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/new-staff-03.png 1667w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></figure><h3>Alix Wilson </h3><p>Communications & Design Assistant</p>\t\t\n\t\t<h2><strong>BOARD OF DIRECTORS</strong></h2><p><strong>Rhia Perkins</strong> – <em>Chair </em> <br /><strong>Miya Turnbull</strong> – <em>Vice Chair</em>  <br /><strong>Kate Hamilton</strong> – <em>Treasurer</em></p><p>Jeff Ward<br />Agustina Perez<br /><br /></p><p>Neal Morgan<br />Erin McDonald</p>\t\t\n\t\t<h2><strong>GENERAL INQUIRIES</strong></h2><p><b>Email:</b> <a href=\"mailto:info@prismaticfestival.com\">info @ prismaticfestival.com</a></p><p><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href=\"tel:9024256812\">(902) 425-6812</a></p><p><strong>Mailing Address:</strong><br />Prismatic Arts Society<br />PO Box 1603, Hfx CRO<br />Halifax NS, B3J 2Y3</p><strong>Join the Prismatic Mailing List</strong>\n&nbsp;\n<style>\n #_form_1_ { font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin:0; }\n #_form_1_ * { outline:0; }\n ._form_hide { display:none; visibility:hidden; }\n ._form_show { display:block; visibility:visible; }\n #_form_1_._form-top { top:0; }\n #_form_1_._form-bottom { bottom:0; }\n #_form_1_._form-left { left:0; }\n #_form_1_._form-right { right:0; }\n #_form_1_ input[type=\"text\"],#_form_1_ input[type=\"date\"],#_form_1_ textarea { padding:6px; height:auto; border:#979797 1px solid; border-radius:4px; color:#000 !important; font-size:14px; -webkit-box-sizing:border-box; -moz-box-sizing:border-box; box-sizing:border-box; }\n #_form_1_ textarea { resize:none; }\n #_form_1_ ._submit { -webkit-appearance:none; cursor:pointer; font-family:arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; text-align:center; background:#333 !important; border:0 !important; -moz-border-radius:4px !important; -webkit-border-radius:4px !important; border-radius:4px !important; color:#fff !important; padding:10px !important; }\n #_form_1_ ._close-icon { cursor:pointer; background-image:url('https://d226aj4ao1t61q.cloudfront.net/esfkyjh1u_forms-close-dark.png'); backgroun