    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"1600\" height=\"1426\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Copy-of-Tamarzee_Nooze_hitlikeawoman_Headshot.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Copy-of-Tamarzee_Nooze_hitlikeawoman_Headshot.jpg?w=1600&amp;ssl=1 1600w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Copy-of-Tamarzee_Nooze_hitlikeawoman_Headshot.jpg?resize=300%2C267&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Copy-of-Tamarzee_Nooze_hitlikeawoman_Headshot.jpg?resize=1024%2C913&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Copy-of-Tamarzee_Nooze_hitlikeawoman_Headshot.jpg?resize=768%2C684&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Copy-of-Tamarzee_Nooze_hitlikeawoman_Headshot.jpg?resize=1536%2C1369&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Copy-of-Tamarzee_Nooze_hitlikeawoman_Headshot.jpg?resize=1120%2C998&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Copy-of-Tamarzee_Nooze_hitlikeawoman_Headshot.jpg?resize=640%2C570&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Tamarzee     &nbsp;Hit Like a Woman</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>September 26th, 27th, 28th,<br>October 2nd, 3rd, 7th, 8th, 9th<br>All Day (on loop) | Run time: 13 mins</p>\n<p><a style=\"color: #f3cf86;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues#rogers-square\">Rogers Square</a><br>Free</p><p>Supported by <a style=\"color: #fff;\" href=\"http://novacentre.ca/\">Nova Centre</a></p>\t\t\n\t\tTamarzee is a multidisciplinary poet and filmmaker. Her previous films have shown in the Victoria Film Festival; Women in the Director's Chair International Film & Video Festival, Chicago; Immaginaria International Film Festival, Italy; Mix NYC; and Inside Out, Toronto. In 2019, she won both English prizes at the RIDM Talent Lab. \t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://hitlikeawoman.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tGlobe\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\thttps://vimeo.com/668513311\t\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Hit Like a Woman</h2>\t\t\n\t\t<p><i>Hit Like a Woman</i> is a playful mix of screen in screen, montage, animation, and traditional documentary techniques that paints a musical portrait of Sarah Thawer; the ass-kicking drummer brought to you by the forces of intergenerational feminism and international music. In 2022, <em>Hit Like a Woman</em> had its world premiere at the Hot Docs Festival in Toronto.<br /></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Copy-of-hitlikeawoman_1-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Copy-of-hitlikeawoman_1.jpg?resize=1024%2C576&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Copy-of-hitlikeawoman_1.jpg?resize=300%2C169&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Copy-of-hitlikeawoman_1.jpg?resize=768%2C432&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Copy-of-hitlikeawoman_1.jpg?resize=1536%2C864&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Copy-of-hitlikeawoman_1.jpg?resize=1120%2C630&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Copy-of-hitlikeawoman_1.jpg?resize=640%2C360&amp;ssl=1 640w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Copy-of-hitlikeawoman_1.jpg?w=1920&amp;ssl=1 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/prismatic-2022/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2022\n\t\t\t\t\