    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h1>International Indigenous Music Summit <br>&amp; Prismatic Arts Festival present:<br><br><i>Bimiwizh (To Take Along) </i></h1>\t\t\n\t\t<h3><strong>&nbsp;</strong></h3>\n<h4><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;MONDAY, SEPTEMBER 26TH 2022&nbsp;</strong></h4><p>GATHERING</p>\n<p>9:30am - 12:00pm, Morning Gathering, Feast &amp; Discussion<br>(all Indigenous music community members welcome)</p>\n<p>12:00pm - 1:30pm, Lunch and Meet &amp; Greet<br>(open to ALL music community members)</p>\n<p>1:30pm - 4:00pm, Afternoon gathering &amp; discussion<br>(open to ALL music community members)</p>\n<p>Location:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune\">Neptune Theatre&nbsp;(Pratt and Whitney Rehearsal Room)</a>&nbsp;<br></p>\n<p>SHOWCASE</p>\n<p>6:30pm - 8:30pm, Indigenous Music Showcase<br>(everyone welcome, open to the public)&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Location:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune\">Neptune Theatre&nbsp;(Scotiabank Stage)</a></p><p>in partnership with the <a href=\"https://www.indigenousmusicsummit.com/\">International Indigenous Music Summit</a></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"768\" height=\"152\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/IIMS-horizontal-clr-01-768x152.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/IIMS-horizontal-clr-01.png?resize=768%2C152&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/IIMS-horizontal-clr-01.png?resize=300%2C59&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/IIMS-horizontal-clr-01.png?resize=1024%2C203&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/IIMS-horizontal-clr-01.png?resize=1536%2C304&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/IIMS-horizontal-clr-01.png?resize=1120%2C222&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/IIMS-horizontal-clr-01.png?resize=640%2C127&amp;ssl=1 640w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/IIMS-horizontal-clr-01.png?w=1920&amp;ssl=1 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/international-indigenous-music-summit-presents-bimiwizh-at-prismatic-2022-tickets-416200285257\" target=\"_blank\" role=\"button\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<i>Bimiwizh</i> - Register Here\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1024\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/IIMS-website-Prismatic-1-1024x360.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/IIMS-website-Prismatic-1.jpg?resize=1024%2C360&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/IIMS-website-Prismatic-1.jpg?resize=300%2C105&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/IIMS-website-Prismatic-1.jpg?resize=768%2C270&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/IIMS-website-Prismatic-1.jpg?resize=1536%2C540&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/IIMS-website-Prismatic-1.jpg?resize=1120%2C394&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/IIMS-website-Prismatic-1.jpg?resize=640%2C225&amp;ssl=1 640w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/IIMS-website-Prismatic-1.jpg?w=1920&amp;ssl=1 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/DiggingRoots-couch-Landscape-Hi-Res-pic-Ratul-Debnath-1-e1661893511447-pu1k3hz4rf24stoisonerrubfwqqr4ewzbncb25w5c.jpg\" title=\"DiggingRoots couch Landscape Hi-Res pic Ratul Debnath (1)\" alt=\"DiggingRoots couch Landscape Hi-Res pic Ratul Debnath (1)\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/MFI-PRISMATIC-Lobby-29-pu1nv7wdnipwwymoojjppdy2i8lt35ecqm5xhkouiw.jpg\" title=\"MFI-PRISMATIC-Lobby-29\" alt=\"MFI-PRISMATIC-Lobby-29\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"768\" height=\"618\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/twin-flames-1-e1661898841580-768x618.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/twin-flames-1-e1661898841580.jpg?resize=768%2C618&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/twin-flames-1-e1661898841580.jpg?resize=300%2C241&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/twin-flames-1-e1661898841580.jpg?resize=1024%2C824&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/twin-flames-1-e1661898841580.jpg?resize=1536%2C1236&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/twin-flames-1-e1661898841580.jpg?resize=1120%2C901&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/twin-flames-1-e1661898841580.jpg?resize=640%2C515&amp;ssl=1 640w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/twin-flames-1-e1661898841580.jpg?w=1545&amp;ssl=1 1545w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>This year, Prismatic is joining the International Indigenous Music Summit on their next stop in the IIMS <em>Bimiwizh</em> series which will take place on <strong>Monday September 26th as the opening event of Prismatic 2022</strong>!</p><p>The past few years have been immensely difficult and now, more than ever, our communities need to gather, heal, and dream together. Therefore, rather than hosting and inviting everyone to a full, in-person Summit event this year, the IIMS team is visiting community across northern Turtle Island through a series of 1-day regional Summit activations.</p><p>The day will include both a community gathering and a musical showcase featuring local Indigenous artists based in the Eastern provinces (Nova Scotia, New Brunswick, PEI, and Newfoundland &amp; Labrador).</p><p>The Summit brings together Indigenous artists and the music industry to honour tradition and forge new paths through curated musical showcases, networking activities, panels, and ceremonies.</p><p>Through collaboration with local and regional partners in the community, including the Mi’kmaq Friendship Centre, <em>Bimiwizh</em> will shine a spotlight on amazing local Indigenous talent and create opportunities for our community to gather together, build and strengthen relationships, and share our stories, challenges, successes, and dreams for the future.</p><p>In addition to the evening showcases, the full-day gathering will also facilitate opportunities to build meaningful and mutually beneficial bridges and partnerships between artists, professionals, and key players in both Indigenous and mainstream music industries.</p><p>Prismatic is thrilled to work together with the International Indigenous Music Summit and the Mi’kmaw Native Friendship Centre to bring <em>Bimiwizh</em> to Kjipuktuk / Halifax at Prismatic 2022!</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/industry-events-2022/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to Industry Events\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/canadian-heritage.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"250\" height=\"166\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-03-e1662144841715.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://canadacouncil.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-07.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.halifax.ca/parks-recreation/events\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-09.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://artsns.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-10.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.td.com/about-tdbfg/our-business/index.jsp?mobile=No\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-01.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.neptunetheatre.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-15.png\" title=\"sponsor-logos-15\" alt=\"sponsor-logos-15\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://liveartdance.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-17-1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.dal.ca/faculty/arts/school-of-performing-arts.html\" target