        "@value": "<h1>Plan Your Prismatic</h1>\t\t\n\t\t\t<h2>2022 Schedule</h2>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fas-caret-right\" /></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fas-caret-up\" /></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"\">Saturday, September 10th</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>12PM-4PM | Boma Nnaji &#8211; Live Painting <b>| </b><a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues#queens-marque\">Queens Marque</a></p>\n<p><img style=\"font-size: 0.95em;\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Pop-Up-Prismatic-logo-transparent-e1658861413543-300x233.png?resize=68%2C53&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"68\" height=\"53\"  data-recalc-dims=\"1\"></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fas-caret-right\" /></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fas-caret-up\" /></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"\">Thursday, September 22nd</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>7PM | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-brandon-hoax/\"><b>MOVEMARROW Artist Talk</b></a> w/ Brandon Hoax | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues#agns\">Art Gallery of Nova Scotia</a></p><p><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Pop-Up-Prismatic-logo-transparent-e1658861413543-300x233.png?resize=67%2C52&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"67\" height=\"52\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" /></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fas-caret-right\" /></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fas-caret-up\" /></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"\">Monday, September 26th</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>All Day | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-tamarzee/\"><b>HIT LIKE A WOMAN</b></a> by Tamarzee | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues#rogers-square\">Rogers Square</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fas-caret-right\" /></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fas-caret-up\" /></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"\">Tuesday, September 27th</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>All Day | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-tamarzee/\"><b>HIT LIKE A WOMAN </b></a>by Tamarzee | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues#rogers-square\">Rogers Square</a></p><p>6PM &#8211; 10PM  | <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-emmanuel-nwogbo/\">SUYA MAN</a> by Emmanuel Nwogbo | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune-theatre\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Lobby </a></p><p>6:45PM &#8211; 8:15PM | Dance workshop with Alexandra &#8216;&#8221;Spicey&#8221; Landé | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/\">House of Eights</a> | All (13+) are welcome to participate!</p><p>7PM | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-sarah-prosper/\"><b>Sarah Prosper</b></a> &amp; <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-santiago-guzman/\"><b>ALTAR </b></a>by Santiago Guzmán | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune-theatre\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Stage</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fas-caret-right\" /></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fas-caret-up\" /></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"\">Wednesday, September 28th</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>All Day | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-tamarzee/\"><b>HIT LIKE A WOMAN</b></a> by Tamarzee | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues#rogers-square\">Rogers Square</a></p><p>6PM &#8211; 10PM  | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-emmanuel-nwogbo/\"><b>SUYA MAN</b></a> by Emmanuel Nwogbo | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune-theatre\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Lobby</a></p><p>7PM | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-sarah-prosper/\"><b>Sarah Prosper</b></a> &amp; <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-santiago-guzman/\"><b>ALTAR </b></a>by Santiago Guzmán | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune-theatre\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Stage</a></p><p>TBD |<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-ebnfloh/\"> <strong>DANCE BATTLE</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#breaking-circus\">Breaking Circus Studio </a>| All are welcome to participate!</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fas-caret-right\" /></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fas-caret-up\" /></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"\">Friday, September 30th</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>6PM &#8211; 10PM  | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-emmanuel-nwogbo/\"><b>SUYA MAN</b></a> by Emmanuel Nwogbo | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune-theatre\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Lobby</a></p><p>8PM  | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-ebnfloh/\"><b>IN-WARD</b></a> by Ebnflōh | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune-theatre\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Stage</a></p><p>8:30PM | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-sarah-prosper/\"><b>Sarah Prosper</b></a> &amp; <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-aysanabee/\"><b>Aysanabee</b></a> | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#carleton\">The Carleton</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t