2-boca-del-lupo/\">RED PHONE </a>by Boca del Lupo | <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune-theatre\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Lobby</a></p><p>12PM &#8211; 4PM | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-emmanuel-nwogbo/\"><b>SUYA MAN</b></a> by Emmanuel Nwogbo | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune-theatre\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Lobby</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fas-caret-right\" /></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fas-caret-up\" /></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"\">Monday, October 3rd</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>All Day | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-tamarzee/\"><b>HIT LIKE A WOMAN</b></a> by Tamarzee | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues#rogers-square\">Rogers Square</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fas-caret-right\" /></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fas-caret-up\" /></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"\">Tuesday, October 4th</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>5:30PM &#8211; 7:30PM &amp; 9PM &#8211; 10PM | <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-boca-del-lupo/\">RED PHONE</a> by Boca del Lupo | <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune-theatre\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Lobby</a></p><p>5:30PM &#8211; 10PM  | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-emmanuel-nwogbo/\"><b>SUYA MAN</b></a> by Emmanuel Nwogbo | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune-theatre\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Lobby</a></p><p>7:30PM | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/ind