tre\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Lobby</a></p><p>6PM &#8211; 10PM  | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-emmanuel-nwogbo/\"><b>SUYA MAN</b></a> by Emmanuel Nwogbo | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune-theatre\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Lobby</a></p><p>7PM  | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-sarah-prosper/\"><b>Sarah Prosper</b></a> &amp; <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-breaking-circus-and-upstream/\"><strong>UP IN THE AIR</strong></a> by Breaking Circus &amp; Upstream Music | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#breaking-circus\">Breaking Circus Studio</a></p><p>7:30PM | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-cliff-cardinal/\"><b>HUFF</b></a> by Cliff Cardinal | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune-theatre\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Stage</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fas-caret-right\" /></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fas-caret-up\" /></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"\">Friday, October 7th</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>All Day | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-tamarzee/\"><b>HIT LIKE A WOMAN</b></a> by Tamarzee | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues#rogers-square\">Rogers Square</a> </p><p>5:30PM &#8211; 7:30PM &amp; 9PM &#8211; 10PM | <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-boca-del-lupo/\">RED PHONE</a> by Boca del Lupo | <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune-theatre\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Lobby</a></p><p>5:30PM &#8211; 10PM  | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-emmanuel-nwogbo/\"><b>SUYA MAN</b></a> by Emmanuel Nwogbo | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune-theatre\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Lobby</a></p><p>7:30PM | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-cliff-cardinal/\"><b>HUFF</b></a><b> </b>by Cliff Cardinal | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune-theatre\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Stage</a></p><p>8PM | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-deedee-austin/\"><b>DeeDee Austin</b></a> &amp; <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-celeigh-cardinal\"><b>Celeigh Cardinal</b></a> | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#carleton\">The Carleton</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fas-caret-right\" /></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fas-caret-up\" /></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"\">Saturday, October 8th</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>All Day | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-tamarzee/\"><b>HIT LIKE A WOMAN</b></a> by Tamarzee | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues#rogers-square\">Rogers Square</a></p><p>5:30PM &#8211; 7:30PM &amp; 9PM &#8211; 10PM | <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-boca-del-lupo/\">RED PHONE</a> by Boca del Lupo | <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune-theatre\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Lobby</a></p><p>5:30PM &#8211; 10PM  | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-emmanuel-nwogbo/\"><b>SUYA MAN</b></a> by Emmanuel Nwogbo | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune-theatre\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Lobby</a></p><p>7:30PM | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-cliff-cardinal/\"><b>HUFF</b></a><b> </b>by Cliff Cardinal | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune-theatre\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Stage</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fas-caret-right\" /></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fas-caret-up\" /></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"\">Sunday, October 9th</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>All Day | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-tamarzee/\"><b>HIT LIKE A WOMAN</b></a> by Tamarzee | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues#rogers-square\">Rogers Square</a></p><p>12PM &#8211; 2PM &amp; 3:30PM &#8211; 4:30PM | <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-boca-del-lupo/\">RED PHONE</a> by Boca del Lupo | <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune-theatre\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Lobby</a></p><p>12PM &#8211; 4:30PM  | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-emmanuel-nwogbo/\"><b>SUYA MAN</b></a> by Emmanuel Nwogbo | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune-theatre\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Lobby</a></p><p>2PM | <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-cliff-cardinal/\">HUFF</a> by Cliff Cardinal | <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune-theatre\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Stage</a></p><p>7:30PM | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-sarah-prosper/\"><b>Sarah Prosper</b></a> &amp; <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-djely-tapa/\"><b>Djely Tapa</b></a> | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#busstoptheatre\">The Bus Stop Theatre</a></p>\n\t\t\t<h2>Tickets</h2>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismatic.boldtypetickets.com\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBUY TICKETS HERE\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<p>Buy tickets to <em>huff</em> by Cliff Cardinal <a href=\"https://sales.neptunetheatre.com/Online/default.asp?BOparam::WScontent::loadArticle::permalink=Huff&amp;BOparam::WScontent::loadArticle::context_id=&amp;_gl=1*136nzwf*_gcl_aw*R0NMLjE2NTU5MTE5OTcuQ2p3S0NBanctOHFWQmhBTkVpd0FmalhMcnZ1dEdzcDVuaGV5LVJZbGM5dU1vVUZNRWpOYm15d3BHRW1GY28tS3N0VkNGcEhHNmZsYnVob0NQdGdRQXZEX0J3RQ..&amp;_ga=2.131453071.1650014238.1657809915-2008088359.1629740062&amp;_gac=1.92474991.1655911997.CjwKCAjw-8qVBhANEiwAfjXLrvutGsp5nhey-RYlc9uMoUFMEjNbmywpGEmFco-KstVCFpHG6flbuhoCPtgQAvD_BwE\"><strong>here</strong></a>.<br />Buy tickets to <em>In-Ward</em> by Ebnflōh <strong><a href=\"https://prod5.agileticketing.net/websales/pages/info.aspx?evtinfo=227141~db0595fc-d0fc-448c-9427-ea5576a1211b&amp;#\">here</a></strong></p><p>Please note that tickets to shows at The Carleton will be sold by table. If you would like to sit with your party, please purchase your tickets together as a table. If you require assistance or support, please reach out to us! </p><p>If you have any additional needs in booking your ticket, or are looking for a seating arrangement that is not available online, please email us at <a href=\"mailto:info@prismaticfestival.com\">info@prismaticfestival.com</a>, reach out to us on social media, or call or text us at (902) 425-6812.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Accessibility</h2>\t\t\n\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 1.1em;\"><strong>Art</strong><b> for Everyone!</b></p><p><i>Prismatic is committed to making its events and performances accessible to all members of the community.</i></p><p style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 1.1em;\"><b>This means that we:</b></p><ul><li>Select venues that have <strong>accessible entrances and washrooms</strong>.</li><li>Welcome <strong>service animals</strong> and <strong>personal support workers</strong> to performances and events.</li><li>Are committed to working intentionally with artists and communities to provide <b>ASL interpretation</b>, <strong>captioning</strong>, <b>written and audio descriptions</b> of performances, when possible.</li><li>Provide items and options at the Front of House that support <strong>positive sensory experiences</strong> including <strong>balloons</strong>, <strong>ear plugs</strong>, <strong>sunglasses</strong>, and <strong>quiet spaces</strong>.</li></ul><p>Prismatic will provide additional support for event tickets at The Carleton. They are sold by table and are priced according to the number of seats per table at a general rate and a pay what you can rate. If you would like to sit with your party, please purchase your tickets together as a table. If you need additional support please reach out to us.</p><p>Prismatic 2022 will feature ASL interpreted performances of <em>ALTAR</em> by Santiago Guzmán. The interpreter has worked closely with the <em>ALTAR</em> team to create high quality, integrated interpretation of the play.</p><p>A cultural support worker and quiet space will be available at performances of <em>huff</em> by Cliff Cardinal.</p><p>At the <em>MOVEMARROW</em> Artist Talk by Brandon Hoax there will be ASL interpretation.</p><p>Please feel free to approach our volunteers anytime for help or with any requests that would improve your access to the event. Our volunteers will be wearing Prismatic Volunteer pins.</p><p>For more information on safety and accessibility at Prismatic Arts Festival’s venues, please click <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues\">here</a>.</p><p><strong>If you have any specific access needs or concerns</strong>, please reach out. We would like to work with you to best support your Festival experience. To get in touch, please email us at <a href=\"mailto:hannah@prismaticfestival.com\">hannah@prismaticfestival.com</a>, reach out to us on social media, or call or text us at (902) 425-6812.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Covid-19 Protocols</h2>\t\t\n\t\t<p>Prismatic is committed to presenting a safe festival and will follow the individual policies of each venue. </p><p>We encourage masks and mindful physical distancing at all events. If you are experiencing COVID-19 symptoms or have tested positive for COVID-19, we recommend that you stay home for the safety of other audience members.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/canadian-heritage.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"250\" height=\"166\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-03-e1662144841715.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://canadacouncil.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-07.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.halifax.ca/parks-recreation/events\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-09.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://artsns.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-10.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.td.com/about-tdbfg/our-business/index.jsp?mobile=No\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-01.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.neptunetheatre.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-15.png\" title=\"sponsor-logos-15\" alt=\"sponsor-logos-15\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://liveartdance.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-17-1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.dal.ca/faculty/arts/school-of-performing-arts.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-06.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://downtownhalifax.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-11.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.marriott.com/en-us/hotels/yhzmc-halifax-marriott-harbourfront-hotel/overview/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-04.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://atlanticpresenters.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-16.png\" title=\"sponsor-logos-16\" alt=\"sponsor-logos-16\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.artgalleryofnovascotia.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-08.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://developns.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-13.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://novacentre.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-05.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.thecarleton.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-02.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.rogers.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-12-12.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://afhalifax.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-14.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://nscad.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/NSCAD-logo-01-1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0