e also received two Western Canadian Music Awards nominations, including Indigenous Artist of the Year and Songwriter of the Year. With two full-length albums completed and her third release in the works, Celeigh’s voice is quickly becoming one of the great Canadian voices that make up the fabric of the Canadian roots music scene.\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.celeighcardinal.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tGlobe\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fas-globe\" /></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/celeighcardinalmusic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFacebook\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fab-facebook\" /></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/celeighcardinal/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tInstagram\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fab-instagram\" /></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/7HAq3UBI3pb8ok9k7dkdGR?autoplay=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSpotify\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fab-spotify\" /></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://twitter.com/celeighcardinal?lang=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTwitter\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fab-twitter\" /></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/CeleighCardinal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tYoutube\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fab-youtube\" /></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1439\" height=\"943\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Celeigh-Cardinal-2-photo-by-Megan-Kemshead-e1656445648648.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Celeigh-Cardinal-2-photo-by-Megan-Kemshead-e1656445648648.jpg?w=1439&amp;ssl=1 1439w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Celeigh-Cardi