    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "2022-celeigh-cardinal"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/headline": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "2022 Celeigh Cardinal"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"988\" height=\"1498\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Celeigh-Cardinal-Spring-2021-photo-by-Sheena-Zilinski-e1656444223168.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Celeigh-Cardinal-Spring-2021-photo-by-Sheena-Zilinski-e1656444223168.jpg?w=988&amp;ssl=1 988w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Celeigh-Cardinal-Spring-2021-photo-by-Sheena-Zilinski-e1656444223168.jpg?resize=198%2C300&amp;ssl=1 198w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Celeigh-Cardinal-Spring-2021-photo-by-Sheena-Zilinski-e1656444223168.jpg?resize=675%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 675w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Celeigh-Cardinal-Spring-2021-photo-by-Sheena-Zilinski-e1656444223168.jpg?resize=768%2C1164&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Celeigh-Cardinal-Spring-2021-photo-by-Sheena-Zilinski-e1656444223168.jpg?resize=640%2C970&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 988px) 100vw, 988px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Celeigh     Cardinal&nbsp;</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Friday, October 7th | 8PM<br /><a style=\"color: #f3cf86;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues#carleton\">The Carleton</a><br />Regular $25 / PWYC $10 (tickets sold by table)</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismatic.boldtypetickets.com/events/128182660/celeigh-cardinal\" target=\"_blank\" role=\"button\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBuy Tickets\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\tDiscovery is the beauty of music. It reveals itself in layers. Such is the evolution of Celeigh Cardinal. With a confident voice and boundless energy, Celeigh owns a stage, connecting deeply with her audience through humour, passion, and love. In 2020, Celeigh achieved one of Canada’s highest musical accolades, a Juno Award for Indigenous Artist of the Year. She also received two Western Canadian Music Awards nominations, including Indigenous Artist of the Year and Songwriter of the Year. With two full-length albums completed and her third release in the works, Celeigh’s voice is quickly becoming one of the great Canadian voices that make up the fabric of the Canadian roots music scene.\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.celeighcardinal.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tGlobe\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fas-globe\" /></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/celeighcardinalmusic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFacebook\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fab-facebook\" /></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/celeighcardinal/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tInstagram\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fab-instagram\" /></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/7HAq3UBI3pb8ok9k7dkdGR?autoplay=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSpotify\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fab-spotify\" /></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://twitter.com/celeighcardinal?lang=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTwitter\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fab-twitter\" /></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/CeleighCardinal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tYoutube\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fab-youtube\" /></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1439\" height=\"943\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Celeigh-Cardinal-2-photo-by-Megan-Kemshead-e1656445648648.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Celeigh-Cardinal-2-photo-by-Megan-Kemshead-e1656445648648.jpg?w=1439&amp;ssl=1 1439w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Celeigh-Cardinal-2-photo-by-Megan-Kemshead-e1656445648648.jpg?resize=300%2C197&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Celeigh-Cardinal-2-photo-by-Megan-Kemshead-e1656445648648.jpg?resize=1024%2C671&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Celeigh-Cardinal-2-photo-by-Megan-Kemshead-e1656445648648.jpg?resize=768%2C503&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Celeigh-Cardinal-2-photo-by-Megan-Kemshead-e1656445648648.jpg?resize=1120%2C734&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Celeigh-Cardinal-2-photo-by-Megan-Kemshead-e1656445648648.jpg?resize=640%2C419&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1439px) 100vw, 1439px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<em>Photo credits: Sheena Zilinski (top), Megan Kemshead (bottom) </em>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/prismatic-2022/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2022\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
      }
    ],
