        "@value": "2022 Breaking Circus and Upstream"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1920\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Breaking-Circus.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Breaking-Circus.png?w=1920&amp;ssl=1 1920w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Breaking-Circus.png?resize=300%2C300&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Breaking-Circus.png?resize=1024%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Breaking-Circus.png?resize=150%2C150&amp;ssl=1 150w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Breaking-Circus.png?resize=768%2C768&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Breaking-Circus.png?resize=1536%2C1536&amp;ssl=1 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"420\" height=\"497\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Breaking-Circus-Upstream-B12BE135-05E3-4C43-A186-83D824282C40-2-e1660319141396.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Breaking-Circus-Upstream-B12BE135-05E3-4C43-A186-83D824282C40-2-e1660319141396.png?w=420&amp;ssl=1 420w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Breaking-Circus-Upstream-B12BE135-05E3-4C43-A186-83D824282C40-2-e1660319141396.png?resize=254%2C300&amp;ssl=1 254w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 420px) 100vw, 420px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p><br />Personnel</p><p>Evan Syliboy | Guitar<br />Karlene Francis | Cello<br />Mohammad Saharaei | Tar<br />Inti Gonzalez | Percussion<br />Kyle Mckenna | Voice<br />Lukas Pearse | Double Bass</p><p>Dawn Shepherd<br />Ryan Gray<br />Aiyana Graham<br />Jayden Gigliotti<br />Ross Burns<br />Adrian Bah</p><p>Special Guest: Sarah Prosper</p><p> </p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Breaking     Circus     +     Upstream&nbsp;UP IN THE AIR</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Thursday, October 6th | 7PM<br /><a style=\"color: #f3cf86;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues#breaking-circus\">Breaking Circus Studio</a><br />Regular $15 / Students, Seniors, &amp; Underwaged $10 / PWYC </p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismatic.boldtypetickets.com/events/127681309/up-in-the-air-by-breaking-circus-upstream\" target=\"_blank\" role=\"button\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBuy Tickets  \n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<h2>Breaking Circus</h2>\t\t\n\t\t<p>Founded in 2018, Breaking Circus is a contemporary circus arts production company based in Kjipuktuk / Halifax. They develop, produce, promote, and present contemporary circus arts performances for live and digital audiences. The company works with local, professional circus artists from diverse backgrounds to develop original content for their in-house productions and for external clients. The Breaking Circus Studio is located in the heart of the north end of Halifax.</p><p>Breaking Circus’ mission is to create innovative, contemporary circus works that inspire meaningful dialogue amongst audiences while being socially responsible and endeavouring to work closely with community for mutual benefit.</p><p>The company's co-founders and co-directors are Dawn Shepherd and Ryan Gray, partners in business and partners in life. Both founders were educated at the prestigious École national de cirque in Montreal and returned to the East Coast in 2014 to begin building a contemporary circus arts production company together. Dawn Shepherd is the only contemporary circus arts director of African descent in Nova Scotia.</p><p>Alongside contemporary circus production, Breaking Circus also offers services and support in aerial rigging, circus instruction, community outreach, studio/venue rental, and project consultation and development.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://breakingcircus.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tGlobe\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fas-globe\" /></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/breakingcircus/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFacebook\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fab-facebook\" /></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/breakingcircus/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tInstagram\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fab-instagram\" /></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<style>/*! elementor - v3.7.8 - 02-10-2022 */\n.elementor-column .elementor-spacer-inner{height:var(--spacer-size)}.e-container{--container-widget-width:100%}.e-container>.elementor-widget-spacer{width:var(--container-widget-width,var(--spacer-size));-ms-flex-item-align:stretch;align-self:stretch;-ms-flex-negative:0;flex-shrink:0}.e-container>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container,.e-container>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container>.elementor-spacer{height:100%}.e-container>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container>.elementor-spacer>.elementor-spacer-inner{height:var(--container-widget-height,var(--spacer-size))}</style>\t\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Upstream</h2>\t\t\n\t\tUpstream Music Association has been creating pan-genre orchestral nujazz, beyond classical, cyber world, experimental music improvisation, composition and conduction ensembles, concert series, festivals, recordings, workshops and symposia locally for over 32 years!\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://upstreammusic.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tGlobe\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fas-globe\" /></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/upstreammusicassociation/community\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFacebook\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fab-facebook\" /></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://twitter.com/upstreamhalifax\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTwitter\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg><use xlink:href=\"#fab-twitter\" /></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1024\" height=\"542\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Breaking-Circus-Upstream-6B984EB1-40BC-4281-9E24-10F92CA50D58-1024x542.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Breaking-Circus-Upstream-6B984EB1-40BC-4281-9E24-10F92CA50D58.png?resize=1024%2C542&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Breaking-Circus-Upstream-6B984EB1-40BC-4281-9E24-10F92CA50D58.png?resize=300%2C159&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Breaking-Circus-Upstream-6B984EB1-40BC-4281-9E24-10F92CA50D58.png?resize=768%2C407&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Breaking-Circus-Upstream-6B984EB1-40BC-4281-9E24-10F92CA50D58.png?resize=1536%2C814&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Breaking-Circus-Upstream-6B984EB1-40BC-4281-9E24-10F92CA50D58.png?resize=1120%2C593&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Breaking-Circus-Upstream-6B984EB1-40BC-4281-9E24-10F92CA50D58.png?resize=640%2C339&amp;ssl=1 640w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Breaking-Circus-Upstream-6B984EB1-40BC-4281-9E24-10F92CA50D58.png?w=1920&amp;ssl=1 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Up in the Air</h2>\t\t\n\t\t<p>Improvisational music and contemporary circus meet to create a unique experience with <em>Up in the Air</em>, a gathering of musicians and circus artists exploring the concept of the unknown. This show explores new territory and finds common ground on our journey to understand what we do and do not know about the unknown in this global period of growth.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/prismatic-2022/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2022\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
      }
    ],
