n Bernard, &amp; Jane Meader<br />Singers / Composers: Eastern Owl, shalan joudry, Riley Mclean Dewitt, &amp; Msit No'kmaq (All My Relations) </p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Samqwan-personnel-list-.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Samqwan-personnel-list-.jpeg?w=1080&amp;ssl=1 1080w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Samqwan-personnel-list-.jpeg?resize=300%2C300&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Samqwan-personnel-list-.jpeg?resize=1024%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Samqwan-personnel-list-.jpeg?resize=150%2C150&amp;ssl=1 150w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Samqwan-personnel-list-.jpeg?resize=768%2C768&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Samqwan-personnel-list-.jpeg?resize=640%2C640&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1080px) 100vw, 1080px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/prismatic-2022/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2022\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
