        "@value": "The TALK International: Our Movements in-Season https://youtu.be/cevfm10D4_M ↑ English Español ↓ https://youtu.be/GN8nduNdD24 Facilitator:Aiden Gillis (Mi&#8217;kmaw and French, Canada)... <a class=\"excerpt-read-more\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/the-talk-2022/\"><span>Continue Reading</span></a>"
