    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"429\" height=\"720\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/3-website-Guyleigh-Johnson-IMG_1713.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/3-website-Guyleigh-Johnson-IMG_1713.jpg?w=429&amp;ssl=1 429w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/3-website-Guyleigh-Johnson-IMG_1713.jpg?resize=179%2C300&amp;ssl=1 179w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 429px) 100vw, 429px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p><em>Photo credits: <i>Jared &amp; Abby Lank</i></em></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Guyleigh Johnson</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Monday, October 2nd | 6:30PM<br /><a style=\"color: #ded9e9;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues#citadel-casemates\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Halifax Citadel National Historic Site - North Front Casemates</a><br /><em>(registration required due to limited capacity)</em></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismatic.tickethalifax.com/events/141706209/prismatic-after-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFREE - Register Here\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<p>Guyleigh Johnson is a proud African Nova Scotian author, spoken word artist, community advocate, and Arts facilitator from Dartmouth. She has a passion for inner and collective healing, youth engagement, and creative expression. She has published two books, <i>Expect The Unexpected</i> (2016) and <i>Afraid Of the Dark </i>(2018), both with Pottersfield press. In 2018 she won the Ancestral Roots Award, presented by Delmore Buddy Daye Learning Institute. This year she won The Inspirational Griot award for her short film <i>Scratching the Surface</i> presented by Emerging Lens Cultural Film Festival. This year her film was nominated for best direction of a documentary series at the Canadian Screen Awards. Her purpose is to create and cultivate access for youth in her community to pursue literary arts.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://guyleighjohnson.wixsite.com/mysite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tGlobe\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 496 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M336.5 160C322 70.7 287.8 8 248 8s-74 62.7-88.5 152h177zM152 256c0 22.2 1.2 43.5 3.3 64h185.3c2.1-20.5 3.3-41.8 3.3-64s-1.2-43.5-3.3-64H155.3c-2.1 20.5-3.3 41.8-3.3 64zm324.7-96c-28.6-67.9-86.5-120.4-158-141.6 24.4 33.8 41.2 84.7 50 141.6h108zM177.2 18.4C105.8 39.6 47.8 92.1 19.3 160h108c8.7-56.9 25.5-107.8 49.9-141.6zM487.4 192H372.7c2.1 21 3.3 42.5 3.3 64s-1.2 43-3.3 64h114.6c5.5-20.5 8.6-41.8 8.6-64s-3.1-43.5-8.5-64zM120 256c0-21.5 1.2-43 3.3-64H8.6C3.2 212.5 0 233.8 0 256s3.2 43.5 8.6 64h114.6c-2-21-3.2-42.5-3.2-64zm39.5 96c14.5 89.3 48.7 152 88.5 152s74-62.7 88.5-152h-177zm159.3 141.6c71.4-21.2 129.4-73.7 158-141.6h-108c-8.8 56.9-25.6 107.8-50 141.6zM19.3 352c28.6 67.9 86.5 120.4 158 141.6-24.4-33.8-41.2-84.7-50-141.6h-108z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/GuyleighJohnson\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFacebook\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256C504 119 393 8 256 8S8 119 8 256c0 123.78 90.69 226.38 209.25 245V327.69h-63V256h63v-54.64c0-62.15 37-96.48 93.67-96.48 27.14 0 55.52 4.84 55.52 4.84v61h-31.28c-30.8 0-40.41 19.12-40.41 38.73V256h68.78l-11 71.69h-57.78V501C413.31 482.38 504 379.78 504 256z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/guyleighjohnson\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tInstagram\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.1 141c-63.6 0-114.9 51.3-114.9 114.9s51.3 114.9 114.9 114.9S339 319.5 339 255.9 287.7 141 224.1 141zm0 189.6c-41.1 0-74.7-33.5-74.7-74.7s33.5-74.7 74.7-74.7 74.7 33.5 74.7 74.7-33.6 74.7-74.7 74.7zm146.4-194.3c0 14.9-12 26.8-26.8 26.8-14.9 0-26.8-12-26.8-26.8s12-26.8 26.8-26.8 26.8 12 26.8 26.8zm