    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"1536\" height=\"1920\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/1-website-Syreeta-Hector-BB-1-Jeremy-Mimnagh.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/1-website-Syreeta-Hector-BB-1-Jeremy-Mimnagh.jpg?w=1536&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/1-website-Syreeta-Hector-BB-1-Jeremy-Mimnagh.jpg?resize=240%2C300&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/1-website-Syreeta-Hector-BB-1-Jeremy-Mimnagh.jpg?resize=819%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 819w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/1-website-Syreeta-Hector-BB-1-Jeremy-Mimnagh.jpg?resize=768%2C960&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/1-website-Syreeta-Hector-BB-1-Jeremy-Mimnagh.jpg?resize=1229%2C1536&amp;ssl=1 1229w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/1-website-Syreeta-Hector-BB-1-Jeremy-Mimnagh.jpg?resize=1120%2C1400&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/1-website-Syreeta-Hector-BB-1-Jeremy-Mimnagh.jpg?resize=640%2C800&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1536px) 100vw, 1536px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<em>Photo credits: Jeremy Mimnagh (top), Andrew McCormack (bottom)</em>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Syreeta     Hector&nbsp;Black Ballerina</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Thursday, October 5th | 7:30PM<br /><a style=\"color: #ded9e9;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues#alderney-landing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Alderney Landing Theatre</a></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://tproatlantic.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/Prismatic2023?aff=outlet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBuy Tickets\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<p>Syreeta Hector is a dance artist and educator in Toronto, Ontario. As a highly accomplished performer, she has worked for internationally recognized companies such as Adelheid Dance Projects, Danny Grossman Dance Company, Peggy Baker Dance Projects, and Toronto Dance Theatre. She is a proud graduate of The National Ballet School’s Teacher Training Program, The School of Toronto Dance Theatre, and has achieved her Master of Arts in Dance from York University.</p><p>Syreeta participated in the Creators in Residence Program at Canadian Stage, the Creative Encounters Residency Program at ProArteDanza, and the Artist in Residence Program at Luminato. This season she is one of the choreographer’s in residence with Toronto Dance Theatre’s “Pilot Projects” and is part of the Creative Incubator Program at the Citadel + Compagnie.</p><p>Most recently, Syreeta has been commissioned by Mocean Dance (Nova Scotia) and ProArteDanza (Ontario) to create ensemble works. She is also currently supported by the Concept to Realization Program at the Canada Council for the Arts to create a new work, which will act as the second chapter in her “Black Ballerina” series. Although performance and creation endeavours remain a priority for Syreeta, she derives an equal measure of inspiration by teaching movement. She has recently joined York University’s Department of Dance as an Assistant Professor.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.syreetahector.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tGlobe\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 496 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M336.5 160C322 70.7 287.8 8 248 8s-74 62.7-88.5 152h177zM152 256c0 22.2 1.2 43.5 3.3 64h185.3c2.1-20.5 3.3-41.8 3.3-64s-1.2-43.5-3.3-64H155.3c-2.1 20.5-3.3 41.8-3.3 64zm324.7-96c-28.6-67.9-86.5-120.4-158-141.6 24.4 33.8 41.2 84.7 50 141.6h108zM177.2 18.4C105.8 39.6 47.8 92.1 19.3 160h108c8.7-56.9 25.5-107.8 49.9-141.6zM487.4 192H372.7c2.1 21 3.3 42.5 3.3 64s-1.2 43-3.3 64h114.6c5.5-20.5 8.6-41.8 8.6-64s-3.1-43.5-8.5-64zM120 256c0-21.5 1.2-43 3.3-64H8.6C3.2 212.5 0 233.8 0 256s3.2 43.5 8.6 64h114.6c-2-21-3.2-42.5-3.2-64zm39.5 96c14.5 89.3 48.7 152 88.5 152s74-62.7 88.5-152h-177zm159.3 141.6c71.4-21.2 129.4-73.7 158-141.6h-108c-8.8 56.9-25.6 107.8-50 141.6zM19.3 352c28.6 67.9 86.5 120.4 158 141.6-24.4-33.8-41.2-84.7-50-141.6h-108z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/syreets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tInstagram\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.1 141c-63.6 0-114.9 51.3-114.9 114.9s51.3 114.9 114.9 114.9S339 319.5 339 255.9 287.7 141 224.1 141zm0 189.6c-41.1 0-74.7-33.5-74.7-74.7s33.5-74.7 74.7-74.7 74.7 33.5 74.7 74.7-33.6 74.7-74.7 74.7zm146.4-194.3c0 14.9-12 26.8-26.8 26.8-14.9 0-26.8-12-26.8-26.8s12-26.8 26.8-26.8 26.8 12 26.8 26.8zm76.1 27.2c-1.7-35.9-9.9-67.7-36.2-93.9-26.2-26.2-58-34.4-93.9-36.2-37-2.1-147.9-2.1-184.9 0-35.8 1.7-67.6 9.9-93.9 36.1s-34.4 58-36.2 93.9c-2.1 37-2.1 147.9 0 184.9 1.7 35.9 9.9 67.7 36.2 93.9s58 34.4 93.9 36.2c37 2.1 147.9 2.1 184.9 0 35.9-1.7 67.7-9.9 93.9-36.2 26.2-26.2 34.4-58 36.2-93.9 2.1-37 2.1-147.8 0-184.8zM398.8 388c-7.8 19.6-22.9 34.7-42.6 42.6-29.5 11.7-99.5 9-132.1 9s-102.7 2.6-132.1-9c-19.6-7.8-34.7-22.9-42.6-42.6-11.7-29.5-9-99.5-9-132.1s-2.6-102.7 9-132.1c7.8-19.6 22.9-34.7 42.6-42.6 29.5-11.7 99.5-9 132.1-9s102.7-2.6 132.1 9c19.6 7.8 34.7 22.9 42.6 42.6 11.7 29.5 9 99.5 9 132.1s2.7 102.7-9 132.1z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<h2>Black Ballerina</h2>\t\t\n\t\tBlack Ballerina focuses on the dualities within one's identity, along with Syreeta’s Blackness and Indigeneity in relationship to classical ballet. This short, work-in-progress solo gained recognition at the SummerWorks Festival in 2019 and won the Stratford Festival Lab Award for Research and Creation. This condensed version of the piece was also performed at the Citadel Dance Mix and received a Dora Mavor Moore nomination for Outstanding Performance by an Individual. The full length version was live streamed through the online dance series “Citadel Live,” garnering record viewership. Due to the overwhelming response it was rebroadcast on the Harbourfront Centre streaming platform. This full length work is now touring live across Canada. \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1536\" height=\"1920\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/4-website-Syreeta-Hector-BB-7-Andrew-McCormack-.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/4-website-Syreeta-Hector-BB-7-Andrew-McCormack-.jpg?w=1536&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/4-website-Syreeta-Hector-BB-7-Andrew-McCormack-.jpg?resize=240%2C300&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/4-website-Syreeta-Hector-BB-7-Andrew-McCormack-.jpg?resize=819%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 819w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/4-website-Syreeta-Hector-BB-7-Andrew-McCormack-.jpg?resize=768%2C960&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/4-website-Syreeta-Hector-BB-7-Andrew-McCormack-.jpg?resize=1229%2C1536&amp;ssl=1 1229w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/4-website-Syreeta-Hector-BB-7-Andrew-McCormack-.jpg?resize=1120%2C1400&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/4-website-Syreeta-Hector-BB-7-Andrew-McCormack-.jpg?resize=640%2C800&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1536px) 100vw, 1536px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/prismatic-2023/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2023\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
      }
