    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"1280\" height=\"1920\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/1-website-Theland-Kicknosway-artist-photos.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/1-website-Theland-Kicknosway-artist-photos.jpeg?w=1280&amp;ssl=1 1280w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/1-website-Theland-Kicknosway-artist-photos.jpeg?resize=200%2C300&amp;ssl=1 200w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/1-website-Theland-Kicknosway-artist-photos.jpeg?resize=683%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 683w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/1-website-Theland-Kicknosway-artist-photos.jpeg?resize=768%2C1152&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/1-website-Theland-Kicknosway-artist-photos.jpeg?resize=1024%2C1536&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/1-website-Theland-Kicknosway-artist-photos.jpeg?resize=1120%2C1680&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/1-website-Theland-Kicknosway-artist-photos.jpeg?resize=640%2C960&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Theland     Kicknosway&nbsp;</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Thursday, October 5th | 7:30PM<br /><a style=\"color: #ded9e9;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues#Alderney Landing\">Alderney Landing Theatre</a></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://tproatlantic.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/Prismatic2023?aff=outlet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBuy Tickets\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\tTheland Kicknosway is Potawatami and Cree, and a member of the Wolf Clan. Theland is an internationally recognized traditional singer, drummer, dancer, and social media influencer. As a member of Walpole Island and Bkejwanong Territory, Theland uses his voice to spread his message and showcase Indigenous culture. At just 19 years old, he is an activist, role model, and educator who weaves his culture into all that he does. In 2018, Theland became the youngest Indspire Laureate named for Culture, Heritage and Spirituality. His path-breaking efforts have also been highlighted by Nike, Disney, the BBC, Teen Vogue, Entertainment Tonight, and Complex. \t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://indspire.ca/laureate/theland-kicknosway/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tGlobe\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 496 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M336.5 160C322 70.7 287.8 8 248 8s-74 62.7-88.5 152h177zM152 256c0 22.2 1.2 43.5 3.3 64h185.3c2.1-20.5 3.3-41.8 3.3-64s-1.2-43.5-3.3-64H155.3c-2.1 20.5-3.3 41.8-3.3 64zm324.7-96c-28.6-67.9-86.5-120.4-158-141.6 24.4 33.8 41.2 84.7 50 141.6h108zM177.2 18.4C105.8 39.6 47.8 92.1 19.3 160h108c8.7-56.9 25.5-107.8 49.9-141.6zM487.4 192H372.7c2.1 21 3.3 42.5 3.3 64s-1.2 43-3.3 64h114.6c5.5-20.5 8.6-41.8 8.6-64s-3.1-43.5-8.5-64zM120 256c0-21.5 1.2-43 3.3-64H8.6C3.2 212.5 0 233.8 0 256s3.2 43.5 8.6 64h114.6c-2-21-3.2-42.5-3.2-64zm39.5 96c14.5 89.3 48.7 152 88.5 152s74-62.7 88.5-152h-177zm159.3 141.6c71.4-21.2 129.4-73.7 158-141.6h-108c-8.8 56.9-25.6 107.8-50 141.6zM19.3 352c28.6 67.9 86.5 120.4 158 141.6-24.4-33.8-41.2-84.7-50-141.6h-108z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/creedrummer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFacebook\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256C504 119 393 8 256 8S8 119 8 256c0 123.78 90.69 226.38 209.25 245V327.69h-63V256h63v-54.64c0-62.15 37-96.48 93.67-96.48 27.14 0 55.52 4.84 55.52 4.84v61h-31.28c-30.8 0-40.41 19.12-40.41 38.73V256h68.78l-11 71.69h-57.78V501C413.31 482.38 504 379.78 504 256z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/the_landk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t