    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"1365\" height=\"1920\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/2-website-Mali-Obomsawin-Mali-01586credit_-Jared-and-Abby-Lank.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/2-website-Mali-Obomsawin-Mali-01586credit_-Jared-and-Abby-Lank.jpeg?w=1365&amp;ssl=1 1365w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/2-website-Mali-Obomsawin-Mali-01586credit_-Jared-and-Abby-Lank.jpeg?resize=213%2C300&amp;ssl=1 213w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/2-website-Mali-Obomsawin-Mali-01586credit_-Jared-and-Abby-Lank.jpeg?resize=728%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 728w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/2-website-Mali-Obomsawin-Mali-01586credit_-Jared-and-Abby-Lank.jpeg?resize=768%2C1080&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/2-website-Mali-Obomsawin-Mali-01586credit_-Jared-and-Abby-Lank.jpeg?resize=1092%2C1536&amp;ssl=1 1092w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/2-website-Mali-Obomsawin-Mali-01586credit_-Jared-and-Abby-Lank.jpeg?resize=1120%2C1575&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/2-website-Mali-Obomsawin-Mali-01586credit_-Jared-and-Abby-Lank.jpeg?resize=640%2C900&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1365px) 100vw, 1365px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p><em>Photo credits: <i>Jared &amp; Abby Lank</i></em></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Mali Obomsawin</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Saturday, July 15th | 7PM<br /><a style=\"color: #ded9e9;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues#st-matthews\">St. Matthew’s United Church</a></p><p>Co-presented with </p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"574\" height=\"89\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/HJF-wht-horizontal-01.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/HJF-wht-horizontal-01.png?w=574&amp;ssl=1 574w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/HJF-wht-horizontal-01.png?resize=300%2C47&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 574px) 100vw, 574px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.tixr.com/groups/halifaxjazzfest/events/2023-td-halifax-jazz-festival-presents-mali-obomsawin-67723\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTicket Sales Ended\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<p>Mali Obomsawin (they/she) is an award winning bassist, songwriter, and composer from Abenaki First Nation at Odanak.</p><p>With an expansive background in American roots, rock, and jazz, Mali’s debut album <em>Sweet Tooth</em> received international acclaim since its release, including rave reviews and Best of 2022 placement in The Guardian, JazzTimes, and NPR. A suite for Indigenous resistance, the album flies in the face of Western tropes that insist Indigenous cultures are monolithic, trapped in time. Instead, Obomsawin highlights centuries of clever adaptation and resistance that have fueled the art and culture of Wabanaki people.</p><p>As a Smithsonian Folkways Recordings artist, they toured internationally with Lula Wiles, appeared as an accompanist with contemporaries like Jake Blount and Lizzie No, and performed at premier festivals like Newport and Philly Folk Fest. In 2022, Mali received an International Folk Music Association's Rising Tide Award and a New England Foundation of the Arts' New Work New England award. Mali is a member of The Julia Keefe Indigenous Big Band and Indigenous Performance Productions' <em>Welcome To Indian Country</em>. They scored the upcoming film <em>We Are The Warriors</em>.</p><p>Beyond the stage, Mali is a community organiser and advocate for Indigenous rights, environmental justice, and landback. She works with the Wabanaki-led Sunlight Media Collective to document and promote stories at the intersection of environmental justice and Tribal sovereignty. Her journalism has been published in Smithsonian, National Performance Network, and the Boston Globe. In 2020, Mali co-founded Bomazeen Land Trust, the first ever Wabanaki land trust, where she currently serves as executive director.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.maliobomsawin.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tGlobe\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 496 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M336.5 160C322 70.7 287.8 8 248 8s-74 62.7-88.5 152h177zM152 256c0 22.2 1.2 43.5 3.3 64h185.3c2.1-20.5 3.3-41.8 3.3-64s-1.2-43.5-3.3-64H155.3c-2.1 20.5-3.3 41.8-3.3 64zm324.7-96c-28.6-67.9-86.5-120.4-158-141.6 24.4 33.8 41.2 84.7 50 141.6h108zM177.2 18.4C105.8 39.6 47.8 92.1 19.3 160h108c8.7-56.9 25.5-107.8 49.9-141.6zM487.4 192H372.7c2.1 21 3.3 42.5 3.3 64s-1.2 43-3.3 64h114.6c5.5-20.5 8.6-41.8 8.6-64s-3.1-43.5-8.5-64zM120 256c0-21.5 1.2-43 3.3-64H8.6C3.2 212.5 0 233.8 0 256s3.2 43.5 8.6 64h114.6c-2-21-3.2-42.5-3.2-64zm39.5 96c14.5 89.3 48.7 152 88.5 152s74-62.7 88.5-152h-177zm159.3 141.6c71.4-21.2 129.4-73.7 158-141.6h-108c-8.8 56.9-25.6 107.8-50 141.6zM19.3 352c28.6 67.9 86.5 120.4 158 141.6-24.4-33.8-41.2-84.7-50-141.6h-108z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/maliobomsawin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFacebook\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256C504 119 393 8 256 8S8 119 8 256c0 123.78 90.69 226.38 209.25 245V327.69h-63V256h63v-54.64c0-62.15 37-96.48 93.67-96.48 27.14 0 55.52 4.84 55.52 4.84v61h-31.28c-30.8 0-40.41 19.12-40.41 38.73V256h68.78l-11 71.69h-57.78V501C413.31 482.38 504 379.78 504 256z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/maliobomsawin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tInstagram\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.1 141c-63.6 0-114.9 51.3-114.9 114.9s51.3 114.9 114.9 114.9S339 319.5 339 255.9 287.7 141 224.1 141zm0 189.6c-41.1 0-74.7-33.5-74.7-74.7s33.5-74.7 74.7-74.7 74.7 33.5 74.7 74.7-33.6 74.7-74.7 74.7zm146.4-194.3c0 14.9-12 26.8-26.8 26.8-14.9 0-26.8-12-26.8-26.8s12-26.8 26.8-26.8 26.8 12 26.8 26.8zm76.1 27.2c-1.7-35.9-9.9-67.7-36.2-93.9-26.2-26.2-58-34.4-93.9-36.2-37-2.1-147.9-2.1-184.9 0-35.8 1.7-67.6 9.9-93.9 36.1s-34.4 58-36.2 93.9c-2.1 37-2.1 147.9 0 184.9 1.7 35.9 9.9 67.7 36.2 93.9s58 34.4 93.9 36.2c37 2.1 147.9 2.1 184.9 0 35.9-1.7 67.7-9.9 93.9-36.2 26.2-26.2 34.4-58 36.2-93.9 2.1-37 2.1-147.8 0-184.8zM398.8 388c-7.8 19.6-22.9 34.7-42.6 42.6-29.5 11.7-99.5 9-132.1 9s-102.7 2.6-132.1-9c-19.6-7.8-34.7-22.9-42.6-42.6-11.7-29.5-9-99.5-9-132.1s-2.6-102.7 9-132.1c7.8-19.6 22.9-34.7 42.6-42.6 29.5-11.7 99.5-9 132.1-9s102.7-2.6 132.1 9c19.6 7.8 34.7 22.9 42.6 42.6 11.7 29.5 9 99.5 9 132.1s2.7 102.7-9 132.1z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@maliobomsawin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tYoutube\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M549.655 124.083c-6.281-23.65-24.787-42.276-48.284-48.597C458.781 64 288 64 288 64S117.22 64 74.629 75.486c-23.497 6.322-42.003 24.947-48.284 48.597-11.412 42.867-11.412 132.305-11.412 132.305s0 89.438 11.412 132.305c6.281 23.65 24.787 41.5 48.284 47.821C117.22 448 288 448 288 448s170.78 0 213.371-11.486c23.497-6.321 42.003-24.171 48.284-47.821 11.412-42.867 11.412-132.305 11.412-132.305s0-89.438-11.412-132.305zm-317.51 213.508V175.185l142.739 81.205-142.739 81.201z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://mali-obomsawin.bandcamp.com/album/sweet-tooth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBandcamp\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M256,8C119,8,8,119,8,256S119,504,256,504,504,393,504,256,393,8,256,8Zm48.2,326.1h-181L207.9,178h181Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1280\" height=\"1920\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/3-website-Mali-Obomsawin-Mali-9600credit_-Jared-and-Abby-Lank.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/3-website-Mali-Obomsawin-Mali-9600credit_-Jared-and-Abby-Lank.jpeg?w=1280&amp;ssl=1 1280w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/3-website-Mali-Obomsawin-Mali-9600credit_-Jared-and-Abby-Lank.jpeg?resize=200%2C300&amp;ssl=1 200w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/3-website-Mali-Obomsawin-Mali-9600credit_-Jared-and-Abby-Lank.jpeg?resize=683%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 683w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/3-website-Mali-Obomsawin-Mali-9600credit_-Jared-and-Abby-Lank.jpeg?resize=768%2C1152&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/3-website-Mali-Obomsawin-Mali-9600credit_-Jared-and-Abby-Lank.jpeg?resize=1024%2C1536&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/3-website-Mali-Obomsawin-Mali-9600credit_-Jared-and-Abby-Lank.jpeg?resize=1120%2C1680&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/3-website-Mali-Obomsawin-Mali-9600credit_-Jared-and-Abby-Lank.jpeg?resize=640%2C960&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1280\" height=\"1920\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/4-website-Mali-Obomsawin-Mali-9673credit_-Jared-and-Abby-Lank.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/4-website-Mali-Obomsawin-Mali-9673credit_-Jared-and-Abby-Lank.jpeg?w=1280&amp;ssl=1 1280w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/4-website-Mali-Obomsawin-Mali-9673credit_-Jared-and-Abby-L