        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "2023 Crazy Smooth"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"1099\" height=\"1280\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/6-website-Crazy-Smooth-📷-Jerick-Collantes-e1689796806758.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/6-website-Crazy-Smooth-📷-Jerick-Collantes-e1689796806758.jpg?w=1099&amp;ssl=1 1099w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/6-website-Crazy-Smooth-📷-Jerick-Collantes-e1689796806758.jpg?resize=258%2C300&amp;ssl=1 258w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/6-website-Crazy-Smooth-📷-Jerick-Collantes-e1689796806758.jpg?resize=879%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 879w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/6-website-Crazy-Smooth-📷-Jerick-Collantes-e1689796806758.jpg?resize=768%2C894&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/6-website-Crazy-Smooth-📷-Jerick-Collantes-e1689796806758.jpg?resize=640%2C745&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1099px) 100vw, 1099px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p><em>Photo credits: <i>Jerick Collantes</i></em></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Crazy     Smooth&nbsp;In My Body</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Friday, September 29th - Saturday, September 30th | 8PM<br /><a style=\"color: #ded9e9;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues#dal-arts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Dalhousie Arts Centre - The Dunn Theatre</a></p><p>Co-presented with</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://liveartdance.ca/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1024\" height=\"398\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/10-Live-Art-Dance-LADLogo_outline-PhotoRoom-1.png-PhotoRoom-1-1024x398.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/10-Live-Art-Dance-LADLogo_outline-PhotoRoom-1.png-PhotoRoom-1.png?resize=1024%2C398&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/10-Live-Art-Dance-LADLogo_outline-PhotoRoom-1.png-PhotoRoom-1.png?resize=300%2C116&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/10-Live-Art-Dance-LADLogo_outline-PhotoRoom-1.png-PhotoRoom-1.png?resize=768%2C298&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/10-Live-Art-Dance-LADLogo_outline-PhotoRoom-1.png-PhotoRoom-1.png?resize=1120%2C435&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/10-Live-Art-Dance-LADLogo_outline-PhotoRoom-1.png-PhotoRoom-1.png?resize=640%2C249&amp;ssl=1 640w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/10-Live-Art-Dance-LADLogo_outline-PhotoRoom-1.png-PhotoRoom-1.png?w=1280&amp;ssl=1 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://liveartdance.ca/bboyizm/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBuy Tickets\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<p>Crazy Smooth (Yvon Soglo) is one of Canada’s top street dancers, performers, choreographers, instructors, judges, and community leaders. He is the founder and artistic director of Bboyizm, an award-winning street-dance company that has been instrumental in the preservation and proliferation of street dance in Canada and internationally.</p><p>He was named the 2020 Clifford E. Lee award recipient by the Banff Centre for the Arts for In My Body, created as a part of the 2019-2021 Long Term Artist in Residency at the Centre de Création O Vertigo in Montreal. The project has received a CanDance Creation Fund grant and significant investment from the NAC National Creation Fund.</p><p>In 2004, Smooth founded Bboyizm and the company has successfully brought authentic street dance into the professional theatre setting. Three of his full-length creations— <em>The Evolution of B-boying</em>, <em>IZM</em>, and <em>Music Creates Opportunity</em>—have toured throughout Canada. The company was nominated for a Dora award in 2012 and won the Atlantic Presenters Association Touring Performers of the Year Award in 2013 and the Ontario Presenters Network Emerging Touring Artist of the Year in 2012. Crazy Smooth has performed, taught, and judged competitions throughout North America and Europe. He continually strives to be a positive example for the community and an ambassador of the street dance culture at large.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.bboyizm.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tGlobe\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 496 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M336.5 160C322 70.7 287.8 8 248 8s-74 62.7-88.5 152h177zM152 256c0 22.2 1.2 43.5 3.3 64h185.3c2.1-20.5 3.3-41.8 3.3-64s-1.2-43.5-3.3-64H155.3c-2.1 20.5-3.3 41.8-3.3 64zm324.7-96c-28.6-67.9-86.5-120.4-158-141.6 24.4 33.8 41.2 84.7 50 141.6h108zM177.2 18.4C105.8 39.6 47.8 92.1 19.3 160h108c8.7-56.9 25.5-107.8 49.9-141.6zM487.4 192H372.7c2.1 21 3.3 42.5 3.3 64s-1.2 43-3.3 64h114.6c5.5-20.5 8.6-41.8 8.6-64s-3.1-43.5-8.5-64zM120 256c0-21.5 1.2-43 3.3-64H8.6C3.2 212.5 0 233.8 0 256s3.2 43.5 8.6 64h114.6c-2-21-3.2-42.5-3.2-64zm39.5 96c14.5 89.3 48.7 152 88.5 152s74-62.7 88.5-152h-177zm159.3 141.6c71.4-21.2 129.4-73.7 158-141.6h-108c-8.8 56.9-25.6 107.8-50 141.6zM19.3 352c28.6 67.9 86.5 120.4 158 141.6-24.4-33.8-41.2-84.7-50-141.6h-108z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/BboyizmDanceCompany\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFacebook\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256C504 119 393 8 256 8S8 119 8 256c0 123.78 90.69 226.38 209.25 245V327.69h-63V256h63v-54.64c0-62.15 37-96.48 93.67-96.48 27.14 0 55.52 4.84 55.52 4.84v61h-31.28c-30.8 0-40.41 19.12-40.41 38.73V256h68.78l-11 71.69h-57.78V501C413.31 482.38 504 379.78 504 256z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/bboycrazysmooth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tInstagram\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.1 141c-63.6 0-114.9 51.3-114.9 114.9s51.3 114.9 114.9 114.9S339 319.5 339 255.9 287.7 141 224.1 141zm0 189.6c-41.1 0-74.7-33.5-74.7-74.7s33.5-74.7 74.7-74.7 74.7 33.5 74.7 74.7-33.6 74.7-74.7 74.7zm146.4-194.3c0 14.9-12 26.8-26.8 26.8-14.9 0-26.8-12-26.8-26.8s12-26.8 26.8-26.8 26.8 12 26.8 26.8zm76.1 27.2c-1.7-35.9-9.9-67.7-36.2-93.9-26.2-26.2-58-34.4-93.9-36.2-37-2.1-147.9-2.1-184.9 0-35.8 1.7-67.6 9.9-93.9 36.1s-34.4 58-36.2 93.9c-2.1 37-2.1 147.9 0 184.9 1.7 35.9 9.9 67.7 36.2 93.9s58 34.4 93.9 36.2c37 2.1 147.9 2.1 184.9 0 35.9-1.7 67.7-9.9 93.9-36.2 26.2-26.2 34.4-58 36.2-93.9 2.1-37 2.1-147.8 0-184.8zM398.8 388c-7.8 19.6-22.9 34.7-42.6 42.6-29.5 11.7-99.5 9-132.1 9s-102.7 2.6-132.1-9c-19.6-7.8-34.7-22.9-42.6-42.6-11.7-29.5-9-99.5-9-132.1s-2.6-102.7 9-132.1c7.8-19.6 22.9-34.7 42.6-42.6 29.5-11.7 99.5-9 132.1-9s102.7-2.6 132.1 9c19.6 7.8 34.7 22.9 42.6 42.6 11.7 29.5 9 99.5 9 132.1s2.7 102.7-9 132.1z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@bboycrazysmooth/videos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tYoutube\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M549.655 124.083c-6.281-23.65-24.787-42.276-48.284-48.597C458.781 64 288 64 288 64S117.22 64 74.629 75.486c-23.497 6.322-42.003 24.947-48.284 48.597-11.412 42.867-11.412 132.305-11.412 132.305s0 89.438 11.412 132.305c6.281 23.65 24.787 41.5 48.284 47.821C117.22 448 288 448 288 448s170.78 0 213.371-11.486c23.497-6.321 42.003-24.171 48.284-47.821 11.412-42.867 11.412-132.305 11.412-132.305s0-89.438-11.412-132.305zm-317.51 213.508V175.185l142.739 81.205-142.739 81.201z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<h2>In My Body </h2>\t\t\n\t\t<p>It's said that the bravest thing a dancer can do is grow old – for a b-boy/b-girl, the experience is approaching heroic. In keeping with hip-hop culture, b-boys/b-girls present a façade of confidence and invincibility as they engage in battles to prove their value and establish their dominance. The resulting vocabulary is one of the most physically demanding and visually impressive of the dance genres and leaves no room for the expression of vulnerability.</p><p>For <em>In My Body</em>, dancer / choreographer Crazy Smooth brings together an intergenerational group of dancers and an international creative team for an intensely athletic investigation of the evolution of self and the effects of aging on street dancers.</p><p><em>In My Body</em> is dedicated to the memory of Frosty Freeze, Marjory Smarth, Flash, Don Campbellock and others gone before – their legacy lives within us.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Personnel</h2>\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>Crazy Smooth</strong> | Choreographer<br /><strong>Saxon Fraser</strong> | Assistant Choreographer &amp; Rehearsal Director <br /><strong>Julie Rock</strong> | Dancer<br /><strong>JC Fresh</strong> | Dancer<br /><strong>Montuu</strong> | Dancer<br /><strong>DKC Freeze</strong> | Dancer<br /><strong>JK 47</strong> | Dancer<br /><strong>Vibz</strong> | Dancer<br /><strong>Tash</strong> | Dancer<br /><strong>Crazy Smooth</strong> | Dancer<br /><strong>Nubian Néné</strong> | Dancer<br /><strong>Anyo</strong> | Dancer &amp; Social Media Coordinator<br /><strong>Melly Mel</strong> | Outside Eye<br /><strong>Sonya Bayer</strong> | Costume Designer &amp; Stylists<br /><strong>Melly Mel</strong> | Costume Designer &amp; Stylists<br /><strong>DJ Shash’U</strong> | Original Music</p><p><strong>Alejandro Rodriguez</strong> | Writer<br /><strong>Chantal Labonté</strong> | Lights<br /><strong>Sophie Michaud</strong> | Creative Consultant</p><p><strong>Thomas Payette</strong> | Multimedia Designer<br /><strong>Charles-Éric Gandubert</strong> (The interactive box) | Creative Programmer<br /><strong>Xavier Mary</strong> (mirari) | Set Designer</p><p><strong>André Houle - CCOV</strong> | Production Director &amp; Technical Director<br /><b>Dominique Hawry</b> | Video Director<br /><b>Martin Lepage</b> | Lighting Director<br /><b>Gaétan Paré</b> | Tour Manager<br /><strong>Gillian Reid</strong> | Agent</p><p><strong>Centre de Création O Vertigo - CCOV</strong> | Executive Producer</p><p>Developed with support from the National Arts Centre's National Creation Fund.</p><p>With co-production partners Bboyizm, The CanDance Network Creation Fund, Banff Centre for Arts and Creativity, Brian Webb Dance Company, Yukon Arts Centre, dance Immersion, &amp; Canadian Stage, and supported by the Canada Council for the Arts.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1143\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/4-website-Crazy-Smooth-📷-Jerick-Collantes-_-Interpretes-Dancers-_-Bboy-Vibz-Anyo.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/4-website-Crazy-Smooth-📷-Jerick-Collantes-_-Interpretes-Dancers-_-Bboy-Vibz-Anyo.jpg?w=1920&amp;ssl=1 1920w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/4-website-Crazy-Smooth-📷-Jerick-Collantes-_-Interpretes-Dancers-_-Bboy-Vibz-Anyo.jpg?resize=300%2C179&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/4-website-Crazy-Smooth-📷-Jerick-Collantes-_-Interpretes-Dancers-_-Bboy-Vibz-Anyo.jpg?resize=1024%2C610&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/4-website-Crazy-Smooth-📷-Jerick-Collantes-_-Interpretes-Dancers-_-Bboy-Vibz-Anyo.jpg?resize=768%2C457&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/4-website-Crazy-Smooth-📷-Jerick-Collantes-_-Interpretes-Dancers-_-Bboy-Vibz-Anyo.jpg?resize=1536%2C914&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/4-website-Crazy-Smooth-📷-Jerick-Collantes-_-Interpretes-Dancers-_-Bboy-Vibz-Anyo.jpg?resize=1120%2C667&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/4-website-Crazy-Smooth-📷-Jerick-Collantes-_-Interpretes-Dancers-_-Bboy-Vibz-Anyo.jpg?resize=640%2C381&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/prismatic-2023/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2023\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
      }
    ],
