/09/Atlantica-logo-2022-1.png?resize=640%2C427&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Africville-Museum.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://afhalifax.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"549\" height=\"92\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Long-and-Mcquade-logo.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Long-and-Mcquade-logo.png?w=549&amp;ssl=1 549w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Long-and-Mcquade-logo.png?resize=300%2C50&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 549px) 100vw, 549px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.halifaxpubliclibraries.ca/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/everyone-on-every-day-qc0w6d9c8j125yd76cc25a81sjj2z30k6spobd11k0.png\" title=\"everyone on every day\" alt=\"everyone on every day\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://halifaxurbanfolkfestival.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/mikmaw-native-friendship-centre-qc0w7mdlgylye3r6eb4206h02b62yfj6m1jg54cetg.png\" title=\"mikmaw native friendship centre\" alt=\"mikmaw native friendship centre\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1480\" height=\"493\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/ClubInclusion_logo_color.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/ClubInclusion_logo_color.png?w=1480&amp;