0.png\" title=\"everyone on every day\" alt=\"everyone on every day\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://halifaxurbanfolkfestival.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/mikmaw-native-friendship-centre-qc0w7mdlgylye3r6eb4206h02b62yfj6m1jg54cetg.png\" title=\"mikmaw native friendship centre\" alt=\"mikmaw native friendship centre\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1480\" height=\"493\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/ClubInclusion_logo_color.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/ClubInclusion_logo_color.png?w=1480&amp;ssl=1 1480w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/ClubInclusion_logo_color.png?resize=300%2C100&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/ClubInclusion_logo_color.png?resize=1024%2C341&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/ClubInclusion_logo_color.png?resize=768%2C256&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/ClubInclusion_logo_color.png?resize=1120%2C373&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/ClubInclusion_logo_color.png?resize=640%2C213&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1480px) 100vw, 1480px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Halifax-Harbour-Bridges-logo-qc0watzqtl082538n7360vap4pc897a61xs665kz72.png\" title=\"Halifax Harbour Bridges logo\" alt=\"Halifax Harbour Bridges logo\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://afhalifax.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img