    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h1>Community Telling Tour with Akpik Theatre</h1>\t\t\n\t\t<p></p>\n<p>In October 2023, Prismatic Arts Festival and Akpik Theatre embarked on a tour to visit Mi’kmaq communities around the province.&nbsp;</p><p>Akpik Theatre shared their community telling of Pawâkan Macbeth, creating space for learning, connection, and cultural sharing between Cree and Mi’kmaq cultures.</p>\n<p>Over several days, Prismatic and Akpik Theatre will visit the Mi’kmaw Native Friendship Centre (Kjipuktuk), Membertou First Nation, Eskasoni First Nation, and Millbrook First Nation.</p>\n<p>Each stop will involve a gathering and feast with local youth and community, giving artists and community members alike opportunities for cultural sharing, storytelling, and connection through the arts.</p>\t\t\n            <a href=\"#/\" style=\"background-image: url(https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/IMG_5259-4.jpg);\"  tabindex=\"0\">\n                        <h2>September 11th</h2>                            <p><p>The cast and crew of Akpik Theatre, along with the Prismatic Arts Festival staff gathered at the Friendship Centre for breakfast to be welcomed to the land by the Mi&#8217;kmaq community.</p></p>\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"#/\" style=\"background-image: url(https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/IMG_5240-1-e1700751230389.jpg);\"  tabindex=\"1\">\n                        <h2>October 10th </h2>                            <p><p>Community Telling at Mi&#8217;kmaw Native Friendship Centre.</p></p>\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"#/\" style=\"background-image: url(https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/IMG_5184-e1700751437252.jpeg);\"  tabindex=\"2\">\n                        <h2>October 11th</h2>                            <p><p>Community Telling at Membertou Trade and Convention Centre with National Gathering of Graduate Students.</p></p>\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"#/\" style=\"background-image: url(https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/IMG_7182.png);\"  tabindex=\"3\">\n                        <h2>October 13th</h2>                            <p><p>Community Telling at Allison Bernard Memorial High School.</p></p>\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"#/\" style=\"background-image: url(https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/IMG_5337.jpeg);\"  tabindex=\"4\">\n                        <h2>October 14th</h2>                            <p><p>Community Telling at Millbrook Cultural and Heritage Centre.</p></p>\n            </a>\n        <style typr=\"text/css\">\n                    #eael-img-accordion-dae0a58 .eael-image-accordion-hover:hover {\n                        flex: 3 1 0% !important;\n                    }\n                    #eael-img-accordion-dae0a58 .eael-image-accordion-hover:hover:hover .overlay-inner * {\n                        opacity: 1;\n                        visibility: visible;\n                        transform: none;\n                        transition: all .3s .3s;\n                    }\n                </style>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"768\" height=\"768\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Pawakan-Macbeth-updated-square-graphic-768x768.jpeg\" alt=\"The words &quot;Akpik Theatre&#039;s a community telling of Pawâkan Macbeth&quot; are written over a painting of a face with some skeletal and frightening features. The words &quot;A Cree takeover by Reneltta Arluk&quot; are in the bottom right corner&quot;.\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Pawakan-Macbeth-updated-square-graphic.jpeg?resize=768%2C768&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Pawakan-Macbeth-updated-square-graphic.jpeg?resize=300%2C300&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Pawakan-Macbeth-updated-square-graphic.jpeg?resize=1024%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Pawakan-Macbeth-updated-square-graphic.jpeg?resize=150%2C150&amp;ssl=1 150w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Pawakan-Macbeth-updated-square-graphic.jpeg?resize=640%2C640&amp;ssl=1 640w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Pawakan-Macbeth-updated-square-graphic.jpeg?w=1080&amp;ssl=1 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/industry-events-2023/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to Industry Events\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://canadacouncil.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/sponsor-logos-03-e1662144841715-pu6mdre1v8drvd5f8n6lj8hoaal0ok3u5j8p7tj148.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/canadian-heritage.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/sponsor-logos-07-psz3w6k5hqfrh0k73afzfz0odmh24sw1g2xrcuvgke.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.halifax.ca/parks-recreation/events\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/sponsor-logos-09-psz3w4oh42d6tsmxe9mqazhr6uqbpeokrtmseay8wu.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://artsns.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/sponsor-logos-10-psz3w3qmx8bwi6oajr83qhqalguyhpkufozax0zn32.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t