        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h1>2014\n</h1>\t\t\n\t\t<p>August 21-24</p>\t\t\n\t\t<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Prismatic Artists</h2>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/sounds-of-motown-2014/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tThe Sounds of Motown\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/paul-wong-2014/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPaul Wong\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/kahawi-dance-theatre-2014/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tKaha:wi Dance Theatre\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/a-tribe-called-red-2014/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tA Tribe Called Red\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/neworld-theatre-and-secret-theatre-2014/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tNeworld Theatre + Secret Theatre\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/jp-cormier-2014/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tJP Cormier\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/the-sanctified-brothers-2014/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tThe Sanctified Brothers\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/reeny-smith-2014/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tReeny Smith \n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/good-people-bad-things-2014/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tDaniel Thau-Eleff\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/broken-english-karaoke-2014/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tStephanie Yee\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/canadian-primos-2014/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tCanadian Primos\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/dinuk-wijeratne-2014/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tDinuk Wijeratne\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/eh440-2014/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tEh440\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/my-space-theatre-2014/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tMT Space Theatre\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Prismat