        "@value": "<h1>2022</h1>\t\t\n\t\t\t<h2>September 26th - October 9th</h2>\t\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Prismatic Artists</h2>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-aysanabee\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tAysanabee\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-boca-del-lupo\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBoca del Lupo\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-boma-nnaji\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBoma Nnaji\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-brandon-hoax\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBrandon Hoax\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-breaking-circus-and-upstream/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBreaking Circus + Upstream\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-celeigh-cardinal/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tCeleigh Cardinal\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-cliff-cardinal\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tCliff Cardinal\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-deedee-austin/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tDeedee Austin\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-djely-tapa/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tDjely Tapa\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-ebnfloh\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tEbnflōh\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-emmanuel-nwogbo/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tEmmanuel Nwogbo\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-santiago-guzman\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSantiago Guzmán\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-sarah-prosper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSarah Prosper\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-tamarzee/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTamarzee\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<h2>Virtual Presentation</h2>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2022-koqm/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tKOQM\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\