        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h1>2012</h1>\t\t\n\t\t<p>September 14 - 29</p>\t\t\n\t\t<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Prismatic 2012 Program</h2>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://issuu.com/prismaticartsfestival/docs/prismatic_2012_program\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t2012\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Prismatic 2012 Poster</h2>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"585\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Prismatic-2012-Flyer-585x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Prismatic-2012-Flyer.jpg?resize=585%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 585w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Prismatic-2012-Flyer.jpg?resize=171%2C300&amp;ssl=1 171w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Prismatic-2012-Flyer.jpg?w=600&amp;ssl=1 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 585px) 100vw, 585px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/B598w7zIcAEJkPm.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"bfdbf16\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6Njk2MSwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL3ByaXNtYXRpY2Zlc3RpdmFsLmNvbVwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyMVwvMDVcL0I1OTh3N3pJY0FFSmtQbS5qcGciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiJiZmRiZjE2In0%3D\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/1_24-copy.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"bfdbf16\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6Njk1OSwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL3ByaXNtYXRpY2Zlc3RpdmFsLmNvbVwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyMVwvMDVcLzFfMjQtY29weS5qcGciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiJiZmRiZjE2In0%3D\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/1_5.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" d