        "@value": "<h1>Plan Your Prismatic</h1>\t\t\n\t\t\t<h2>2023 Schedule</h2>\t\t\n\t\t<p> ■ Art Exhibitions    ■ Performances    ■ Industry Events</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 192 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a tabindex=\"0\">Aug 28th - Oct 30th</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p><a style=\"color: #2e8b57; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-lux-gow-habrich/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lux Habrich <b>—</b> Queen Mothers of Eastern and Western Skies </a>| <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#bus-stop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Bus Stop Theatre</a></p><p><em style=\"color: #54b3d6; font-size: 16.2px;\">(the exhibit is available during all Bus Stop Theatre programming)</em></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 192 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a tabindex=\"0\">Oct 5th - Dec  22nd</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p><a style=\"color: green;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-sameer-farooq/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sameer Farooq – The Fairest Order in the World</a> | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#dal-arts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Dalhousie Art Gallery</a></p><p><em style=\"color: #54b3d6; font-size: 16.2px;\">(this a co-presentation with Dalhousie Art Gallery. The exhibit is available during their <a href=\"https://artgallery.dal.ca/sameer-farooq-fairest-order-world\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">gallery hours</a>)</em></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 192 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a tabindex=\"0\">Friday, September 29th</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>8pm |<a style=\"color: royalblue;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-crazy-smooth/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Crazy Smooth – In My Body</a> | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#dal-arts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Dunn Theatre, Dalhousie Arts Centre</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 192 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a tabindex=\"0\">Saturday, September 30th</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>All day | <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #2e8b57; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-alan-syliboy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Alan Syliboy – Wolverine and Little Thunder </a>| <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#rogers-square\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rogers Square</a></p><p>2pm |<a style=\"color: royalblue;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-anyma/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Anyma</a> + <a style=\"color: royalblue;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-leonard-sumner/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Leonard Sumner</a> | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#carleton\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Carleton</a></p><p>8pm |<a style=\"color: royalblue;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-crazy-smooth/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Crazy Smooth – In My Body</a> | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#dal-arts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Dunn Theatre, Dalhousie Arts Centre</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 192 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a tabindex=\"0\">Sunday, October 1st</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>All day | <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #2e8b57; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-alan-syliboy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Alan Syliboy – Wolverine and Little Thunder </a>| <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#rogers-square\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rogers Square</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 192 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a tabindex=\"0\">Monday, October 2nd</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>All day | <a style=\"color: #2e8b57; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-alan-syliboy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Alan Syliboy – Wolverine and Little Thunder </a>| <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#rogers-square\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rogers Square </a></p><p>12pm &#8211; 1:30pm |<a style=\"color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/workshops-and-events-2023/#syreeta-hector\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Welcome &amp; Land Based Movement Workshop with Syreeta Hector </a>| <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#africville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Africville Museum (outdoors)</a></p><p>1:45pm &#8211; 3:45pm |  <a style=\"color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/arrivals-legacy-project-2023/#alp-meet-and-greet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Living History at the Crossroads: Arrivals Legacy Project Meet &amp; Greet</a> | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#africville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Africville Museum (indoors)</a></p><p>6:30pm |<a style=\"color: royalblue;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-jacques-mindreau/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Prismatic After Dark: Jacques Mindreau</a> &amp; <a style=\"color: royalblue;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-jacques-mindreau-and-andrew-jackson/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Andrew Jackson</a>  +  <a style=\"color: royalblue;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-guyleigh-johnson/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Guyleigh Johnson</a> + <a style=\"color: royalblue;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-alan-syliboy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Alan Syliboy</a> |  <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#citadel-casemates\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">North Front Casemate, Halifax Citadel National Historic Site</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 192 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a tabindex=\"0\">Tuesday, October 3rd</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>All day | <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #2e8b57; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-alan-syliboy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Alan Syliboy – <em>Wolverine and Little Thunder </em></a>| <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#rogers-square\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rogers Square</a></p><p>2pm &#8211; 3:30pm |<a style=\"color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/the-talk-2023/#sharing-circle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> The TALK: Art as Healing </a>| <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#central-library\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Room 301, Halifax Central Library</a></p><p>2:35pm &#8211; 5:25pm |<a style=\"color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/masterclasses-2023/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Weaving New Ways of Knowing Masterclass &#8211; An Arrivals Taster </a>| <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#dal-arts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Studio 2, Dalhousie Arts Centre</a></p><p>7:30pm |<a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff; color: royalblue;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-akpik-theatre/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Akpik Theatre – Pawâkan Macbeth <em>(PWYC)</em></a><em> </em>| <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Stage</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 192 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a tabindex=\"0\">Wednesday, October 4th</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>All day | <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #2e8b57; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-alan-syliboy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Alan Syliboy – Wolverine and Little Thunder </a>| <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#rogers-square\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rogers Square</a></p><p>10am &#8211; 11:30am | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/the-talk-2023/#at-the-threshold\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The TALK: At the Threshold</a> | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#central-library\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Room 301, Halifax Central Library</a></p><p>3pm &#8211; 5:30pm |  <a style=\"color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/arrivals-legacy-project-2023/#alp-showcase\">Showcase: Diaspora Kidz + Arrivals Legacy Project SeedPool </a>| <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#bus-stop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Bus Stop Theatre</a></p><p>3:45pm &#8211; 4:45pm |  <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff; color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/workshops-and-events-2023/#anyma\">Singing Workshop with Anyma </a>| <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://theclubinclusion.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Club Inclusion</a></p><p>7:30pm |<a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff; color: royalblue;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-akpik-theatre/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Akpik Theatre – Pawâkan Macbeth</a> | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Stage</a></p><p>7:30pm |<a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: royalblue; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-pisuwin/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Atlantic Ballet &#8211; PISUWIN </a> | <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#spatz-theatre\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Spatz Theatre</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 192 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a tabindex=\"0\">Thursday, October 5th</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>All day | <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #2e8b57; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-alan-syliboy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Alan Syliboy – Wolverine and Little Thunder </a>| <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#rogers-square\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rogers Square</a></p><p>3pm – 4pm | <a style=\"color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/workshops-and-events-2023/#guyleigh-johnson\">The Griot In You: Poetry Writing Workshop with Guyleigh Johnson </a>| <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#eoed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Every One Every Day</a></p><p>5pm &#8211; 8pm |<a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: royalblue; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-sameer-farooq/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Sameer Farooq – The Fairest Order in the World <em>(opening artist reception)</em></a> | <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Dalhousie Art Gallery</a></p><p>7:30pm |<a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff; color: royalblue;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-akpik-theatre/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Akpik Theatre – Pawâkan Macbeth</a> | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune-theatre\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Stage</a></p><p>7:30pm | <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: royalblue; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-jeanette-kotowich/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Jeanette Kotowich &#8211; Kisiskâciwan</a> + <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: royalblue; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-syreeta-hector/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Syreeta Hector &#8211; Black Ballerina </a>+<a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: royalblue; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-syreeta-hector/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> </a><a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: royalblue; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-theland-kicknosway/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Theland Kicknosway</a> | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#alderney-landing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Alderney Landing Theatre</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 192 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a tabindex=\"0\">Friday, October 6th</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>All day | <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #2e8b57; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-alan-syliboy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Alan Syliboy – Wolverine and Little Thunder </a>| <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#rogers-square\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rogers Square</a></p><p>11am | <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/workshops-and-events-2023/#lux-habrich\">Mending Fibres and Stitching Stories: Workshop with Lux Gow-Habrich </a>| <a style=\"background: #ffffff; border-color: #323232; outline: 0px; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#eoed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Every One Every Day</a></p><p>2:30pm – 4pm |<a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/masterclasses-2023/#jeanette-kotowich\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Joy of Jigging Masterclass with Jeanette Kotowich | </a><a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#dal-arts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Dalhousie Arts Centre</a></p><p>7:30pm |<a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff; color: royalblue;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-akpik-theatre/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Akpik Theatre – Pawâkan Macbeth</a> | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Stage</a></p><p>8pm |<a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: royalblue; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-basset/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Basset</a> + <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: royalblue; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-logan-staats/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Logan Staats</a><a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: royalblue; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-syreet-hector/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> </a>| <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#carleton\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Carleton</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 192 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a tabindex=\"0\">Saturday, October 7th</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>All day | <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #2e8b57; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-alan-syliboy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Alan Syliboy – <em>Wolverine and Little Thunder </em></a>| <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#rogers-square\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rogers Square</a></p><p>7:30pm |<a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff; color: royalblue;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-akpik-theatre/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Akpik Theatre – Pawâkan Macbeth </a> + <a style=\"color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/workshops-and-events-2023/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mi&#8217;kmaw Craft Market</a> | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Stage</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 192 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a tabindex=\"0\">Sunday, October 8th</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>All day | <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #2e8b57; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-alan-syliboy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Alan Syliboy – <em>Wolverine and Little Thunder </em></a>| <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#rogers-square\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rogers Square</a></p><p>2pm |<a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff; color: royalblue;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2023-akpik-theatre/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Akpik Theatre – Pawâkan Macbeth </a>+ <a style=\"color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/workshops-and-events-2023/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mi&#8217;kmaw Craft Market</a> | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Stage</a></p>\n\t\t\t<h2>Accessibility</h2>\t\t\n\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 1.1em;\"><strong>Art</strong><b> for Everyone!</b></p>\n<p><i>Prismatic is committed to making its events and performances accessible to all members of the community.</i></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 1.1em;\">This means that we:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Strive to prioritize venues that have accessible entrances and washrooms.</li>\n<li>Welcome service animals and personal support workers to performances and events.</li>\n<li>Are committed to working intentionally with artists and communities to provide ASL interpretation, captioning, written and audio descriptions of performances, when possible.</li>\n<li>Will be providing ASL interpretation at <em>The Griot In You: Poetry Writing Workshop</em> with Guyleigh Johnson and Sameer Farooq's <em>The Fairest Order in the World</em> (opening artist reception).</li>\n<li>Provide items and options at the Front of House that support positive sensory experiences including balloons, ear plugs, sunglasses, and quiet spaces.</li>\n<li>Have assistive listening devices available at all events taking place at Alderney Landing Theatre. If you would like to use this service, please let the Front of House know upon your arrival.</li>\n</ul><b>&nbsp;All events at Prismatic are photographed. If you do not want to be photographed, please let a staff member know when you arrive.</b><br>\n<br>\t\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Tickets</h2>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismatic.boldtypetickets.com\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBUY TICKETS HERE\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<p></p>\n<p>Buy tickets to <i>Pawakan Macbeth</i>&nbsp;by Akpik Theatre&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.neptunetheatre.com/box-office/pawakan-macbeth\"><strong>here</strong></a>.<br>Buy tickets to <em>PISUWIN</em>&nbsp;by Atlantic Ballet&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/pisuwin-tickets-663781447177?aff=oddtdtcreator\">here</a>.</strong></p><p>Please note that tickets to shows at The Carleton will be sold by table. If you would like to sit with your party, please purchase your tickets together as a table. If you require assistance or support, please reach out to us! </p><p>If you have any additional needs in booking your ticket, or are looking for a seating arrangement that is not available online, please email us at <a href=\"mailto:info@prismaticfestival.com\">info@prismaticfestival.com</a>, reach out to us on social media, or call or text us at (902) 425-6812.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/TICKETS-ON-SALE-NOW-300x300.png\" alt=\"The Prismatic 2023 festival graphic with the text &quot;Tickets on sale now!&quot;.\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/TICKETS-ON-SALE-NOW.png?resize=300%2C300&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/TICKETS-ON-SALE-NOW.png?resize=1024%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/TICKETS-ON-SALE-NOW.png?resize=150%2C150&amp;ssl=1 150w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/TICKETS-ON-SALE-NOW.png?resize=768%2C768&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/TICKETS-ON-SALE-NOW.png?resize=1120%2C1120&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/TICKETS-ON-SALE-NOW.png?resize=640%2C640&amp;ssl=1 640w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/TICKETS-ON-SALE-NOW.png?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Volunteer with Us!</h2>\t\t\n\t\t<p>Prismatic is Art for Everyone! </p><p>Our vibrant festival celebrates artistic expressions, performances, and conversations from/by incredible Indigenous artists and artists of color.</p><p>If witnessing the transformative power of the arts in bringing people together, fostering understanding, and promoting social cohesion is a priority to you, join us this year at Prismatic 2023!</p><p>For more information, email: hannah [@] prismaticfestival [dot] com.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://canadacouncil.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/sponsor-logos-03-e1662144841715-pu6mdre1v8drvd5f8n6lj8hoaal0ok3u5j8p7tj148.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/canadian-heritage.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/sponsor-logos-07-psz3w6k5hqfrh0k73afzfz0odmh24sw1g2xrcuvgke.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.halifax.ca/parks-recreation/events\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/sponsor-logos-09-psz3w4oh42d6tsmxe9mqazhr6uqbpeokrtmseay8wu.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://artsns.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/sponsor-logos-10-psz3w3qmx8bwi6oajr83qhqalguyhpkufozax0zn32.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.neptunetheatre.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Untitled-design-4-PhotoRoom-PhotoRoom-e1687535713237-q8e5ubgezujktkcpjcdu3gz65p7rm