        "@value": "<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1282\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©-Photo-Credit-@stoometzphoto-86.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©-Photo-Credit-@stoometzphoto-86.jpg?w=1920&amp;ssl=1 1920w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©-Photo-Credit-@stoometzphoto-86.jpg?resize=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©-Photo-Credit-@stoometzphoto-86.jpg?resize=1024%2C684&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©-Photo-Credit-@stoometzphoto-86.jpg?resize=768%2C513&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©-Photo-Credit-@stoometzphoto-86.jpg?resize=1536%2C1026&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©-Photo-Credit-@stoometzphoto-86.jpg?resize=1120%2C748&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©-Photo-Credit-@stoometzphoto-86.jpg?resize=640%2C427&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Prismatic     2024     Date     Launch     Event&nbsp;Featuring: Jeff Ward & Denise John</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Saturday, June 29th | 2:00 PM</p><p>Halifax Shopping Centre</p><p>Photo Credits: Stoo Metz</p><p>In Partnership with</p><p><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Screenshot-2024-08-04-at-9.38.44 PM-e1722821964899.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"156\" height=\"86\" /></p>\t\t\n\t\t<p>Celebrate Prismatic 2024’s Official Date Launch! Featuring performances by Mi’kmaq artists Jeff Ward and Denise John.</p>\n<p>Referred to as Mi’kmaq Knowledge keeper/sharer, Jeff is a member of Kun’tewiktuk Singers and Sons of Membertou &amp; Thunder Eagle Singers, who has been dancing, drumming and performing his way into people’s hearts since he was a child. Jeff is a Lodge keeper, drum keeper/maker, conductor of ceremonies, and involved in talking and justice circles. He is a General Manager of Membertou Heritage park, Director of Community Culture and Heritage for Wagmatcook First Nation and a leader in the White Eagle Sundance.</p>\n<p>Denise John is a proud L’nu dancer, community worker and victim support navigator from Mi’kma’ki Miawpukek (Conne River) Newfoundland who is passionate about learning, preserving culture and honoring elders and knowledge sharers. </p>\n<p>Prismatic and Halifax Shopping Centre invites the greater Halifax community to join us in honoring Indigenous artists and Artists of color. The Prismatic Arts Festival dates for the 2024 season are September 26th - October 6th. Check out our line up of incredibly talented artists!</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 796 708 779 692 767L438 487 692 225C700 217 708 204 708 187 708 171 704 154 692 142 675 129 663 125 646 125Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPrevious slide\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M696 533C708 521 713 504 713 487 713 471 708 454 696 446L400 146C388 133 375 125 354 125 338 125 325 129 313 142 300 154 292 171 292 187 292 204 296 221 308 233L563 492 304 771C292 783 288 800 288 817 288 833 296 850 308 863 321 871 338 875 354 875 371 875 388 867 400 854L696 533Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNext slide\n\t\t\t<h2>Personnel</h2>\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>Jeff Ward</strong> | Performer, Dancer, Knowledge Keeper<br /><strong>Denise John</strong> | Dancer<br /><strong>Raeesa Lalani </strong> | Prismatic Artistic Director<br /><strong>Alexane Couture </strong>| <strong>Technical Producer</strong><br /><strong>Katie Blatt</strong> | Marketing and Communications Assistant </p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/prismatic-2024/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2024\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
      }
