        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"988\" height=\"738\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/shianne-gould-2-e1719425806316.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/shianne-gould-2-e1719425806316.png?w=988&amp;ssl=1 988w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/shianne-gould-2-e1719425806316.png?resize=300%2C224&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/shianne-gould-2-e1719425806316.png?resize=768%2C574&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/shianne-gould-2-e1719425806316.png?resize=640%2C478&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 988px) 100vw, 988px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100063586958026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFacebook\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256C504 119 393 8 256 8S8 119 8 256c0 123.78 90.69 226.38 209.25 245V327.69h-63V256h63v-54.64c0-62.15 37-96.48 93.67-96.48 27.14 0 55.52 4.84 55.52 4.84v61h-31.28c-30.8 0-40.41 19.12-40.41 38.73V256h68.78l-11 71.69h-57.78V501C413.31 482.38 504 379.78 504 256z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@shiannegould\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTiktok\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M448,209.91a210.06,210.06,0,0,1-122.77-39.25V349.38A162.55,162.55,0,1,1,185,188.31V278.2a74.62,74.62,0,1,0,52.23,71.18V0l88,0a121.18,121.18,0,0,0,1.86,22.17h0A122.18,122.18,0,0,0,381,102.39a121.43,121.43,0,0,0,67,20.14Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/shiannegould.sunshinestudio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tInstagram\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.1 141c-63.6 0-114.9 51.3-114.9 114.9s51.3 114.9 114.9 114.9S339 319.5 339 255.9 287.7 141 224.1 141zm0 189.6c-41.1 0-74.7-33.5-74.7-74.7s33.5-74.7 74.7-74.7 74.7 33.5 74.7 74.7-33.6 74.7-74.7 74.7zm146.4-194.3c0 14.9-12 26.8-26.8 26.8-14.9 0-26.8-12-26.8-26.8s12-26.8 26.8-26.8 26.8 12 26.8 26.8zm76.1 27.2c-1.7-35.9-9.9-67.7-36.2-93.9-26.2-26.2-58-34.4-93.9-36.2-37-2.1-147.9-2.1-184.9 0-35.8 1.7-67.6 9.9-93.9 36.1s-34.4 58-36.2 93.9c-2.1 37-2.1 147.9 0 184.9 1.7 35.9 9.9 67.7 36.2 93.9s58 34.4 93.9 36.2c37 2.1 147.9 2.1 184.9 0 35.9-1.7 67.7-9.9 93.9-36.2 26.2-26.2 34.4-58 36.2-93.9 2.1-37 2.1-147.8 0-184.8zM398.8 388c-7.8 19.6-22.9 34.7-42.6 42.6-29.5 11.7-99.5 9-132.1 9s-102.7 2.6-132.1-9c-19.6-7.8-34.7-22.9-42.6-42.6-11.7-29.5-9-99.5-9-132.1s-2.6-102.7 9-132.1c7.8-19.6 22.9-34.7 42.6-42.6 29.5-11.7 99.5-9 132.1-9s102.7-2.6 132.1 9c19.6 7.8 34.7 22.9 42.6 42.6 11.7 29.5 9 99.5 9 132.1s2.7 102.7-9 132.1z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Shianne Gould\n</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Monday, September 30th | 6PM&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em>This exhibition is available from Sunday, September 22nd to Saturday, December 21st during all scheduled performances at The Bus Stop Theatre.</em></p>\n<p><i>Evening Performance Schedule:&nbsp;</i><br><i>6:00pm – View Shianne Gould's Exhibition<br>6:30pm –&nbsp; <a style=\"color: #ded9e9; transition-property: all;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2024-shion-skye-carter/\" data-wahfont=\"16\">Dáminí and Afroqueen </a>Performance followed by&nbsp;<a style=\"color: #ded9e9; transition-property: all;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2024-shion-skye-carter/\" data-wahfont=\"16\">Residuals (住み・墨) </a>by Shion Skye Carter</i><em><br></em></p>\n<p><a style=\"color: #ded9e9;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/accessibility/#bus-stop\">Bus Stop Theatre - Lobby Gallery</a></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.simpletix.com/e/an-evening-with-prismatic-shion-skye-carte-tickets-173789\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBuy Tickets\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\tShianne Gould is a talented Mi’kmaq artist who resides in Whycocomagh First Nation. She has been painting since childhood. Her work is characterized by vivid, vibrant colours with themes surrounding family and relationship to Mother Earth. Shianne’s art has been featured in the Friends United initiative.\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1539\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/shianne-gould-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/shianne-gould-1.jpeg?w=1539&amp;ssl=1 1539w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/shianne-gould-1.jpeg?resize=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/shianne-gould-1.jpeg?resize=1024%2C681&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/shianne-gould-1.jpeg?resize=768%2C511&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/shianne-gould-1.jpeg?resize=1536%2C1022&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/shianne-gould-1.jpeg?resize=1120%2C745&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/shianne-gould-1.jpeg?resize=640%2C426&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1539px) 100vw, 1539px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/prismatic-2024/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2024\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
