l=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBuy Tickets\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\tShianne Gould is a talented Mi’kmaq artist who resides in Whycocomagh First Nation. She has been painting since childhood. Her work is characterized by vivid, vibrant colours with themes surrounding family and relationship to Mother Earth. Shianne’s art has been featured in the Friends United initiative.\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1539\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/shianne-gould-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/shianne-gould-1.jpeg?w=1539&amp;ssl=1 1539w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/shianne-gould-1.jpeg?resize=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/shianne-gould-1.jpeg?resize=1024%2C681&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/shianne-gould-1.jpeg?resize=768%2C511&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/shianne-gould-1.jpeg?resize=1536%2C1022&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/shianne-gould-1.jpeg?resize=1120%2C745&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/shianne-gould-1.jpeg?resize=640%2C426&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1539px) 100vw, 1539px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/prismatic-2024/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2024\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
