alifax</a></h3></header>\n                        <p>LiveArtDancePrismaticBringKahawiDownload</p><a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2024/09/29/live-art-dance-prismatic-bring-kahawi-dance-theatres-homelands-to-halifax/\">Read More</a>\n                    <time datetime=\"September 29, 2024\">September 29, 2024</time>\n    </article><article data-id=\"22649\">\n            <header><h3><a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2024/09/26/the-prismatic-arts-festival-is-on-now-heres-what-you-need-to-know/\" title=\"The Prismatic Arts Festival is on now— here’s what you need to know\">The Prismatic Arts Festival is on now— here’s what you need to know</a></h3></header>\n                        <p>PrismaticOnNowDownload</p><a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2024/09/26/the-prismatic-arts-festival-is-on-now-heres-what-you-need-to-know/\">Read More</a>\n                    <time datetime=\"September 26, 2024\">September 26, 2024</time>\n    </article><article data-id=\"22643\">\n            <header><h3><a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2024/09/25/immersive-and-interactive-foreign-radical-comes-to-the-prismatic-arts-festival/\" title=\"Immersive and interactive Foreign Radical comes to the Prismatic Arts Festival\">Immersive and interactive Foreign Radical comes to the Prismatic Arts Festival</a></h3></header>\n                        <p>ForeignRadicalComesToPrismaticDownload</p><a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2024/09/25/immersive-and-interactive-foreign-radical-comes-to-the-prismatic-arts-festival/\">Read More</a>\n                    <time datetime=\"September 25, 2024\">September 25, 2024</time>\n    </article><article data-id=\"22653\">\n            <header><h3><a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2024/09/19/prismatic-returns-in-a-celebration-of-work-by-indigenous-artists-and-artists-of-colour/\" title=\"Prismatic returns in a celebration of work by Indigenous artists and artists of colour\">Prismatic returns in a celebration of work by Indigenous artists and artists of colour</a></h3></header>\n                        <p>PrismaticReturnsDownload</p><a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2024/09/19/prismatic-returns-in-a-celebration-of-work-by-indigenous-artists-and-artists-of-colour/\">Read More</a>\n                    <time datetime=\"September 19, 2024\">September 19, 2024</time>\n    </article><article data-id=\"21707\">\n            <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2024/08/11/prismatic-arts-festival-reveals-incredible-2024-artist-line-up/\"></a>\n                <img width=\"1920\" height=\"1920\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Prismatic-Cover-Design-FINAL.png\" alt=\"\" />\n        <header><h3><a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2024/08/11/prismatic-arts-festival-reveals-incredible-2024-artist-line-up/\" title=\"Prismatic Arts Festival Reveals Incredible 2024 Artist Line-Up\">Prismatic Arts Festival Reveals Incredible 2024 Artist Line-Up</a></h3></header>\n                        <p>August 7th 2024, Kjipuktuk/Halifax, Nova Scotia — Prismatic 2024 is...</p><a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2024/08/11/prismatic-arts-festival-reveals-incredible-2024-artist-line-up/\">Read More</a>\n                    <time datetime=\"August 11, 2024\">August 11, 2024</time>\n    </article><article data-id=\"20069\">\n            <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2024/06/29/prismatic-2024-date-launch-at-the-halifax-shopping-centre/\"></a>\n                <img width=\"1000\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Newsletter.png\" alt=\"\" />\n        <header><h3><a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/2024/06/29/prismatic-2024-date-launch-at-the-halifax-shopping-centre/\" title=\"Prismatic 2024 Date Launch at the Halifax Shopping Centre\">Prismatic 2024 Date Launch at the Halifax Shopping Centre</a></h3></hea