        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "2025 Raymond Sewell"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"1150\" height=\"1438\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/RaymondSewell-e1749759619678.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/RaymondSewell-e1749759619678.jpg?w=1150&amp;ssl=1 1150w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/RaymondSewell-e1749759619678.jpg?resize=240%2C300&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/RaymondSewell-e1749759619678.jpg?resize=819%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 819w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/RaymondSewell-e1749759619678.jpg?resize=768%2C960&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/RaymondSewell-e1749759619678.jpg?resize=1120%2C1400&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/RaymondSewell-e1749759619678.jpg?resize=640%2C800&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1150px) 100vw, 1150px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Raymond Sewell</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Thursday, September 26th – Sunday, October 5th</p><p>Multiple Locations </p><p><em>Raymond will be opening various shows at Prismatic 2025.</em></p>\t\t\n\t\t<p>Raymond Sewell is an l’nu poet, singer-songwriter, and English professor from Pabineau First Nation, New Brunswick. Since a young age Raymond has been writing and producing creative works. Raymond currently lives in Bedford, Nova Scotia and is inspired by the ocean. Writing has become a calling – a way of life for this burgeoning artist. Raymond constantly promotes Indigenous excellence and intellectualism providing many public performances and lectures.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/raymond.sewell.589\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFacebook\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256C504 119 393 8 256 8S8 119 8 256c0 123.78 90.69 226.38 209.25 245V327.69h-63V256h63v-54.64c0-62.15 37-96.48 93.67-96.48 27.14 0 55.52 4.84 55.52 4.84v61h-31.28c-30.8 0-40.41 19.12-40.41 38.73V256h68.78l-11 71.69h-57.78V501C413.31 482.38 504 379.78 504 256z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/rockinawesome1\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tInstagram\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.1 141c-63.6 0-114.9 51.3-114.9 114.9s51.3 114.9 114.9 114.9S339 319.5 339 255.9 287.7 141 224.1 141zm0 189.6c-41.1 0-74.7-33.5-74.7-74.7s33.5-74.7 74.7-74.7 74.7 33.5 74.7 74.7-33.6 74.7-74.7 74.7zm146.4-194.3c0 14.9-12 26.8-26.8 26.8-14.9 0-26.8-12-26.8-26.8s12-26.8 26.8-26.8 26.8 12 26.8 26.8zm76.1 27.2c-1.7-35.9-9.9-67.7-36.2-93.9-26.2-26.2-58-34.4-93.9-36.2-37-2.1-147.9-2.1-184.9 0-35.8 1.7-67.6 9.9-93.9 36.1s-34.4 58-36.2 93.9c-2.1 37-2.1 147.9 0 184.9 1.7 35.9 9.9 67.7 36.2 93.9s58 34.4 93.9 36.2c37 2.1 147.9 2.1 184.9 0 35.9-1.7 67.7-9.9 93.9-36.2 26.2-26.2 34.4-58 36.2-93.9 2.1-37 2.1-147.8 0-184.8zM398.8 388c-7.8 19.6-22.9 34.7-42.6 42.6-29.5 11.7-99.5 9-132.1 9s-102.7 2.6-132.1-9c-19.6-7.8-34.7-22.9-42.6-42.6-11.7-29.5-9-99.5-9-132.1s-2.6-102.7 9-132.1c7.8-19.6 22.9-34.7 42.6-42.6 29.5-11.7 99.5-9 132.1-9s102.7-2.6 132.1 9c19.6 7.8 34.7 22.9 42.6 42.6 11.7 29.5 9 99.5 9 132.1s2.7 102.7-9 132.1z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/prismatic-2025/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2025\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
