    ],
    "http://schema.org/headline": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Donate to Prismatic"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h1>Donate to Prismatic</h1>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1024\" height=\"684\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©-Photo-Credit-@stoometzphoto-85-1024x684.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-85.jpg?resize=1024%2C684&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-85.jpg?resize=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-85.jpg?resize=768%2C513&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-85.jpg?resize=1536%2C1026&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-85.jpg?resize=1120%2C748&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-85.jpg?resize=640%2C427&amp;ssl=1 640w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-85.jpg?w=1920&amp;ssl=1 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\tFor over 16 years, Prismatic has worked hard to showcase the work of Indigenous artists and artists of colour, bringing their brilliant work to audiences in Kjipuktuk / Halifax. As a not for profit organization, community support is essential to further our goal of creating an inclusive and vibrant artistic hub in our communities. <p><strong>Prismatic is a member of Theatre Nova Scotia’s Partnership Program.</strong> Donations over $20 made to Prismatic through Theatre Nova Scotia are eligible for a charitable tax receipt for income tax purposes.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>How to make a Donation</h3>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<strong>1.   </strong><a href=\"https://www.theatrens.ca/donate\">Go to Theatre Nova Scotia’s donation page</a><strong>2.   </strong>In the Donation Details section, open the drop-down menu labelled <strong>“Fund”</strong><strong>3.   </strong>From the list, select <strong>“30 Prismatic Arts Festival”</strong><strong>4.   </strong>Enter your donation amount<strong>5.   </strong>Fill out personal and payment details\n<strong>6.   </strong>Submit the form by clicking <strong>“Complete Donation Now”</strong>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Thank you for supporting independent art festivals!</h3>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1024\" height=\"684\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©-Photo-Credit-@stoometzphoto-33-1024x684.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-33.jpg?resize=1024%2C684&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-33.jpg?resize=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-33.jpg?resize=768%2C513&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-33.jpg?resize=1536%2C1026&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-33.jpg?resize=1120%2C748&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-33.jpg?resize=640%2C427&amp;ssl=1 640w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/2024-Soft-Launch-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-%C2%A9-Photo-Credit-%40stoometzphoto-33.jpg?w=1920&amp;ssl=1 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://canadacouncil.ca/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/CCA_RGB_colour_e-r7vzv385fkpgklnuqtvg59g4ni766vsjr0lllxmjri.png\" title=\"CCA_RGB_colour_e\" alt=\"CCA_RGB_colour_e\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://artsns.ca/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/ArtsNS-colour-r7vzwpi487wjnann89bckoc0yllzjf8a0dru2c2cl8.png\" title=\"ArtsNS&#8211;colour\" alt=\"ArtsNS--colour\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/canadian-heritage.html\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/wordmark_C-r7vzy8ylsln80pnx99xy8h8q7dqvdbpsvhzom6ysc0.png\" title=\"wordmark_C.png\" alt=\"wordmark_C.png\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.halifax.ca/parks-recreation/events\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/sponsor-logos-09-psz3w4oh42d6tsmxe9mqazhr6uqbpeokrtmseay8wu.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.neptunetheatre.com/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Neptune-vector-black-horizontal-r7vzzpll1917nky6rbsewlgpspf51b51dw2jjwrvde.png\" title=\"Neptune-vector-black-horizontal\" alt=\"Neptune-vector-black-horizontal\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://liveartdance.ca/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/sponsor-logos-17-1-psz43iosu6hc3fwj8ym5emd7awb77r0m4e977lztzy.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.dal.ca/faculty/arts/school-of-performing-arts.html\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/sponsor-logos-06-psz3w6k5qi6xpaq33uvq5rmcibmjlz4y3qr86jnwv4.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://downtownhalifax.ca/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Downtown-Halifax-Business-Commission-r86apo8ja30mqty6ouaktli97955mpbaas0d4veb7k.png\" title=\"Downtown Halifax Business Commission\" alt=\"Downtown Halifax Business Commission\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://atlanticahotelhalifax.com/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Atlantica-logo-2022-1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Atlantica-logo-2022-1.png?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Atlantica-logo-2022-1.png?resize=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Atlantica-logo-2022-1.png?resize=1024%2C683&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Atlantica-logo-2022-1.png?resize=768%2C512&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Atlantica-logo-2022-1.png?resize=1120%2C747&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Atlantica-logo-2022-1.png?resize=640%2C427&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://symphonynovascotia.ca/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/SNS_RGB_TRANSPARENT-301x173-1-q8al72resysxs9lpslcv3vmp0mc50bsbaw8x920b02.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://artgallery.dal.ca/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/download-removebg-preview-1-q8cowvwequ9ui90mwxcxqwix3a9sbuic9u5yqs2c1k.png\" title=\"dal art gallery\" alt=\"dal art gallery\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://agns.ca/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/AGNS-LOGO-COLOUR-03-qpuuwzos2kn9bipmlg63qru820qv86ia1bb0rst64k.png\" title=\"AGNS LOGO COLOUR 03\" alt=\"AGNS LOGO COLOUR 03\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://agns.ca/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/topLogoBlue-r7w0dlnpscakzulxmri71ao9ozsxb41byzbe1fdz2i.png\" title=\"topLogoBlue\" alt=\"topLogoBlue\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://minuteman.com/ca/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/minuteman-press-qpuu53t0ov4qim3x4lxg5pq758amt53ppq0kk751rq.png\" title=\"minuteman press\" alt=\"minuteman press\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\