        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"1440\" height=\"1920\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/AngeliqueFrancis.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/AngeliqueFrancis.jpg?w=1440&amp;ssl=1 1440w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/AngeliqueFrancis.jpg?resize=225%2C300&amp;ssl=1 225w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/AngeliqueFrancis.jpg?resize=768%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/AngeliqueFrancis.jpg?resize=1152%2C1536&amp;ssl=1 1152w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/AngeliqueFrancis.jpg?resize=1120%2C1493&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/AngeliqueFrancis.jpg?resize=640%2C853&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1440px) 100vw, 1440px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/angeliquefrancisofficialpage\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFacebook\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256C504 119 393 8 256 8S8 119 8 256c0 123.78 90.69 226.38 209.25 245V327.69h-63V256h63v-54.64c0-62.15 37-96.48 93.67-96.48 27.14 0 55.52 4.84 55.52 4.84v61h-31.28c-30.8 0-40.41 19.12-40.41 38.73V256h68.78l-11 71.69h-57.78V501C413.31 482.38 504 379.78 504 256z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/angelique.francis_music\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tInstagram\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.1 141c-63.6 0-114.9 51.3-114.9 114.9s51.3 114.9 114.9 114.9S339 319.5 339 255.9 287.7 141 224.1 141zm0 189.6c-41.1 0-74.7-33.5-74.7-74.7s33.5-74.7 74.7-74.7 74.7 33.5 74.7 74.7-33.6 74.7-74.7 74.7zm146.4-194.3c0 14.9-12 26.8-26.8 26.8-14.9 0-26.8-12-26.8-26.8s12-26.8 26.8-26.8 26.8 12 26.8 26.8zm76.1 27.2c-1.7-35.9-9.9-67.7-36.2-93.9-26.2-26.2-58-34.4-93.9-36.2-37-2.1-147.9-2.1-184.9 0-35.8 1.7-67.6 9.9-93.9 36.1s-34.4 58-36.2 93.9c-2.1 37-2.1 147.9 0 184.9 1.7 35.9 9.9 67.7 36.2 93.9s58 34.4 93.9 36.2c37 2.1 147.9 2.1 184.9 0 35.9-1.7 67.7-9.9 93.9-36.2 26.2-26.2 34.4-58 36.2-93.9 2.1-37 2.1-147.8 0-184.8zM398.8 388c-7.8 19.6-22.9 34.7-42.6 42.6-29.5 11.7-99.5 9-132.1 9s-102.7 2.6-132.1-9c-19.6-7.8-34.7-22.9-42.6-42.6-11.7-29.5-9-99.5-9-132.1s-2.6-102.7 9-132.1c7.8-19.6 22.9-34.7 42.6-42.6 29.5-11.7 99.5-9 132.1-9s102.7-2.6 132.1 9c19.6 7.8 34.7 22.9 42.6 42.6 11.7 29.5 9 99.5 9 132.1s2.7 102.7-9 132.1z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Angelique Francis</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Saturday, September 27th | 8:30 PM</p>\n<p><a style=\"color: #ded9e9;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/accessibility/#carleton\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Carleton</a>&nbsp;</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/1431867517289?aff=oddtdtcreator\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBuy Tickets  \n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\tJUNO award winning and 2x Canadian Blues award winning artist Angelique Francis is a versatile and exceptionally gifted musician. This multi-talented, multi-instrumentalist, multi-genre singer-songwriter and composer has wowed audiences across the globe with her electrifying performances, instrumental abilities, and powerful textured vocals. She is known for her eclectic mix of various musical genres including blues, soul, folk, Americana, jazz, gospel, and rock. Angelique has shared the stage  with and opened for a large roster of well-known musicians such as Buddy Guy, Gary Clark Jr, Joe Bonamassa, Eric Gales, Keb’ Mo’, Beth Hart, Tom Cochran, Burton Cummings, Sugar Ray, and the list goes on.Angelique’s soulful, smoky vocals and instrumental techniques are reminiscent of a bygone era, but with a unique and modern sensibility.  Within her vocal style, you will hear influences of legends like Big Mama Thornton, Koko Taylor, Aretha Franklin, Bessie Smith, and many more. Her instrumental abilities call to mind Willie Dixon on the bass, Sister Rosetta Thorpe on guitar, Big Mama Thornton on the Harmonica, and Aretha on the piano.\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Personnel</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>Angelique Francis</strong> | Vocals / Bass<br /><strong>Kharincia Francis</strong> | Saxophone<br /><strong>Kira Francis</strong> | Trombone<br /><strong>Kiran Francis</strong> | Drums</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/3-website-Pisuwin-346832991_942014243680661_4538303676708427131_n.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/3-website-Pisuwin-346832991_942014243680661_4538303676708427131_n.jpg?w=1920&amp;ssl=1 1920w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/3-website-Pisuwin-346832991_942014243680661_4538303676708427131_n.jpg?resize=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/3-website-Pisuwin-346832991_942014243680661_4538303676708427131_n.jpg?resize=1024%2C683&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/3-website-Pisuwin-346832991_942014243680661_4538303676708427131_n.jpg?resize=768%2C512&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/3-website-Pisuwin-346832991_942014243680661_4538303676708427131_n.jpg?resize=1536%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/3-website-Pisuwin-346832991_942014243680661_4538303676708427131_n.jpg?resize=1120%2C747&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/3-website-Pisuwin-346832991_942014243680661_4538303676708427131_n.jpg?resize=640%2C427&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index