        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "2025 International Community Tour"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h2>International Artist Community Tour</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Cian-Parker-landscape.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Cian-Parker-landscape.jpg?w=1920&amp;ssl=1 1920w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Cian-Parker-landscape.jpg?resize=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Cian-Parker-landscape.jpg?resize=1024%2C683&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Cian-Parker-landscape.jpg?resize=768%2C512&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Cian-Parker-landscape.jpg?resize=1536%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Cian-Parker-landscape.jpg?resize=1120%2C747&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Cian-Parker-landscape.jpg?resize=640%2C427&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Sorry     for     Your     Loss&nbsp;by Cian Parker</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Monday, September 22nd | 7pm <br /><a style=\"color: #fff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/accessibility/#al-whittle\">Al Whittle Theatre, Wolfville</a></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/1434792285349?aff=oddtdtcreator\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBuy Tickets  \n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<p>Tuesday, September 23rd | 1:30 PM (with artist talkback)<br>\n<a style=\"color: #fff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/accessibility/#kings-theatre\">King’s Theatre, Annapolis Royal</a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Wednesday, September 24th | 1:00 PM<br>\n<a style=\"color: #fff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/accessibility/#bella-rose\">Bella Rose Arts Centre, Halifax</a></p><p>Prismatic will be hitting the road with award-winning Māori artist Cian Parker (Ngāpuhi), coming all the way from Aotearoa / New Zealand to bring her brilliant, one woman play, <em>Sorry For Your Loss</em> to communities across Nova Scotia! After the show, audiences can stay for an artist talkback to meet Cian and ask questions to learn more about her work and the experiences that inspired the play’s creation.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Sorry For Your Loss</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\tA heartfelt and hilarious story about growing up on the mean streets of Aotearoa (New Zealand) with a sometimes-there-mostly-not Dad. Cian Parker shares her story about reclaiming her heritage when she is unexpectedly introduced to a father and a family she didn’t know existed.<em>Sorry For Your Loss</em> is about the power of wāhine (women); and the gift of strength from one woman to another.\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>This tour is proudly supported by:</strong></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/creative-nz-1-r8ij82nfynhccv2csuvlfdh483esp6k3xw8nsfkisq.png\" title=\"creative nz\" alt=\"creative nz\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/ArtsNS-colour-r7vzwpi4cls4rfql8jj7xkmv0y6qa0cqc7okh6gkrk.png\" title=\"ArtsNS&#8211;colour\" alt=\"ArtsNS--colour\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://symphonynovascotia.ca/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Town-of-Wolfville-r8h2cllbcai6nlh5pd8czbq9dtxmrd5nll8h17hyc2.png\" title=\"Town of Wolfville\" alt=\"Town of Wolfville\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Mermaid-Theatre-r8h2cknh9uchg4lgv51lrq9musn0a96dlahpyrxkk6.png\" title=\"Mermaid Theatre\" alt=\"Mermaid Theatre\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://agns.ca/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Kings-Theatre-1-r8ij93b4r9hlcy6dtdmou4px2diecfzdfs4xg031au.png\" title=\"Kings Theatre\" alt=\"Kings Theatre\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://agns.ca/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Halifax-Regional-Arts-r8wbh8lyge5qrfi8qr5w3obt49eihaepv3mzj6qgra.png\" title=\"Halifax Regional Arts\" alt=\"Halifax Regional Arts\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/prismatic-2025/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2025\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
      }
